 Moskalev"},"message":"align monolith and MFE for fair benchmarking\n\n- pin vue@3.5.26, vite@6.4.1, pinia@2.3.1, vue-router@4.6.4 across all 7 projects\n- align build: target=esnext, minify=true everywhere (including shell)\n- update @module-federation/vite to 1.14.5 in all MFEs\n- frontend nginx: enable gzip, cache-control immutable, CORS headers (parity with shell)\n- frontend Dockerfile.prod: switch to node:20-slim (rollup native bindings) + drop stale lockfile\n- frontend index.html: remove font preload, lang=ru (parity with shell)\n- shell: copy favicon.ico to fix 404\n- shell: remove 520KB dead pizza assets from public/img (only used by pizza-builder)\n- docker-compose.server.yml: add frontend-cors traefik middleware (parity with shell-cors)\n- new docker-compose.local.yml: full stack on localhost ports for benchmarking","tree":{"sha":"d5f2b7dc985363447494ae7ebb710972bcea5bb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EnderWarik/itmo_master_client_example_monolit_and_microfrontends_vue_pizza/git/trees/d5f2b7dc985363447494ae7ebb710972bcea5bb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EnderWarik/itmo_master_client_example_monolit_and_microfrontends_vue_pizza/git/commits/a9aa2364821a5b0134daeb976adf7ab3d1d807d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77185411?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EnderWarik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EnderWarik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EnderWarik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EnderWarik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EnderWarik","id":77185411,"login":"EnderWarik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTg1NDEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EnderWarik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EnderWarik/received_events","repos_url":"https://