ed_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/0f63c79ab4afb2be14ac7a35858c02c6dd8971a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:21:36Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:21:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(version): resolve real version from build info; add de --version (#67)\n\nde version printed \"devedge dev (unknown)\" for any binary built outside\ngoreleaser, even a legitimate `go install .../cmd/de@vX.Y.Z` whose module\nversion go can resolve. The version string came only from ldflags-injected\nvars, so an installed binary reported the placeholder.\n\nversion.String() now falls back to runtime/debug.ReadBuildInfo() when the\ninjected version is empty/\"dev\"/\"unknown\": it uses the module version\n(Main.Version, set for a go install @version) and the VCS revision from the\nbuild settings. The ldflags value stays the primary source for goreleaser\nbuilds, so released binaries are unchanged.\n\nAlso adds a top-level `de --version` flag reporting the same string as\n`de version`, for parity with `devedge-sdk --version`.\n\nCloses #66","tree":{"sha":"60ec163bf622ca99dcc8dc8feaecce79b8fc4bfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/60ec163bf622ca99dcc8dc8feaecce79b8fc4bfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/0f63c79ab4afb2be14ac7a35858c02c6dd8971a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 60ec163bf622ca99dcc8dc8feaecce79b8fc4bfc\nparent e81a4180c90502d4d02a7e74d250d66f88425f56\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783225296 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783225296 -0500\n\nfix(version): resolve real version from build info; add de --version (#67)\n\nde version printed \"devedge dev (unknown)\" for any binary built outside\ngoreleaser, even a legitimate `go install .../cmd/de@vX.Y.Z` whose module\nversion go can resolve. The version string came only from ldflags-injected\nvars, so an installed binary reported the placeholder.\n\nversion.String() now falls back to runtime/debug.ReadBuildInfo() when the\ninjected version is empty/\"dev\"/\"unknown\": it uses the module version\n(Main.Version, set for a go install @version) and the VCS revision from the\nbuild settings. The ldflags value stays the primary source for goreleaser\nbuilds, so released binaries are unchanged.\n\nAlso adds a top-level `de --version` flag reporting the same string as\n`de version`, for parity with `devedge-sdk --version`.\n\nCloses #66","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSdvQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtncQAEZXyJpVpKcfRi0PleNNa+/A\nNOkkfM4y0i2yIKs3UQ6zD57gMmwU28sPRPCwB3GvjHbHjtfpUaeMYkBpBZWW2wxS\n4R1ShsTBGQhKTeoLEMscfYudaomvNvY0woaQU4DKF/q/cfkZlv9p4mXO8ldJx0cx\nC8tKJam7wL7e5g5k24M5bshOhL2i0hP54BEWmzjOdTHHs9CM82deKOUdRdgac0ym\nOVzBd6GRzQkCpV9uFhideoDD6EmyPQM0f5GuTks0vEbNiPkVD6L8YF/rdtVL55QP\nFbaiL1LngTIz0k1C6sKZ62ygc9zzfzLSKVU1Q1xmqPt4S47+RKyj9yCzgy7pjQe3\nnqWQky2VvB/gLKkSEUYTOm8NYivHuTaHrLd6SEmFRUHLFoiq9cXP/oc9A8Aecxo4\n4EiySQ/2r/MMbGDdtUPERoBFEEKqnQWeL6Wk5j+g0TVJfp+eutqV7hqraQhXRKVE\ny8g3LRmZHiXfQGo5/TnzLJTX+KnI+aTuf0deP70X182J3jkXutyDUn9r1rfmSlOa\nxQDyYUres/GNu8o+UOuyIjmyLuknI08E7PPyfi1XfXrM0njyJFOyHuWmYfbxyCCa\nMopHxf4y9/Bs2CnaNP9dlczpLswdQo9uqDVYvDGhz5RLD4gzY6c+nUfvM120Ux2x\n2XlHFKQaRgSHccMbIIof\n=hteG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T04:21:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/