arcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T19:14:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(migrate): redact DSN password before formatting migrate errors (SEC-005) (#60)\n\nde migrate up/status/verify (and the SDK-shared toPgxURL/pqDSN/WithConnTimeouts\nhelpers in internal/migrate) formatted a scheme-less or malformed DSN straight\ninto an error with %q or wrapped a *url.Error with %w, both of which embed the\nraw DSN. For the common libpq keyword/value form (host=... user=... password=...)\nor a schemeless //user:pass@host URL, this put a cleartext database password on\nstderr and into CI/build logs.\n\nAdd internal/dsn.Redact to blank a DSN''s password (URL userinfo or a libpq\npassword=/pgpassword= token, falling back to \"[redacted]\" if unrecognized) and\nuse it at every raw-DSN error site in internal/migrate. Never wrap a raw\n*url.Error either, since its own Error() text embeds the DSN; unwrap to the\nunderlying reason instead.\n\nBelt-and-suspenders at the CLI boundary: the migrate subcommands now set\nSilenceErrors and print their own redacted error (internal/dsn.ScrubText),\ninstead of letting cobra''s default printer echo the RunE error verbatim.\n\nAdds regression tests asserting no password/DSN-userinfo substring reaches\nthe formatted error or the printed CLI output.","tree":{"sha":"42740b94a7fc18afb166302f9a53f90670741a11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/42740b94a7fc18afb166302f9a53f90670741a11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/c6c7adc238678abab9968be0b7b749e5ac63868f","verification":{"payload":"tree 42740b94a7fc18afb166302f9a53f90670741a11\nparent 9c24245c1b57ae867734cab9e681f14dd7cb8066\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783192475 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783192475 -0500\n\nfix(migrate): redact DSN password before formatting migrate errors (SEC-005) (#60)\n\nde migrate up/status/verify (and the SDK-shared toPgxURL/pqDSN/WithConnTimeouts\nhelpers in internal/migrate) formatted a scheme-less or malformed DSN straight\ninto an error with %q or wrapped a *url.Error with %w, both of which embed the\nraw DSN. For the common libpq keyword/value form (host=... user=... password=...)\nor a schemeless //user:pass@host URL, this put a cleartext database password on\nstderr and into CI/build logs.\n\nAdd internal/dsn.Redact to blank a DSN''s password (URL userinfo or a libpq\npassword=/pgpassword= token, falling back to \"[redacted]\" if unrecognized) and\nuse it at every raw-DSN error site in internal/migrate. Never wrap a raw\n*url.Error either, since its own Error() text embeds the DSN; unwrap to the\nunderlying reason instead.\n\nBelt-and-suspenders at the CLI boundary: the migrate subcommands now set\nSilenceErrors and print their own redacted error (internal/dsn.ScrubText),\ninstead of letting cobra''s default printer echo the RunE error verbatim.\n\nAdds regression tests asserting no password/DSN-userinfo substring reaches\nthe formatted error or the printed CLI output.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSVubCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/lgQACLPCmPRZweNWSscQMl6HyaL\nH/8uDywJIo3TUdgve5XuRlBQweMgWeFCxjoL5/bS48pqJ/KTd8mObrqUJvMWOfC6\nylWEHEjvqYds1nJOVVnBEF+OiTfei2Qt7jNO2QzOTEpnrfhmpOak4N0uHzeNbYP4\nCOHMlmveONzZZSe/yheGN3gXXsH+j725K33Tg+vvKJwJS5dIpOVo8bhW12qS9EWl\nIB8o07wJ0ge6EOqX1hKa6mZiEx/0rIllSsn5YVqHuNfFMoaQ1sRyY/hZ7EF7f4CX\nkE2/iR50SDdQvmnJiqmLqQyadtejVMIhwsbO4uEubhV6RhGYOyRtDXDjKkfY8UzH\ntHduwSWXIt/Fg3g9z+9AFPMUOcB4TGyX/qweJ2Vw2vtYDHhUFYBnS48okGpU56Q8\ng0fx1DJ4CAfA4u9srWhQgvhHz3PObW6GpPaM1dBs8biOTzvhjuGRNN5zvavpgjqv\nLP/LVQRXKLPiyUXRYLkKb4CI2bVe3tHmts42pi1DMHYFN2sXTesVzfda773pKrE4\nXvXhKW/fHp9MsDT8xwS4b2AL/1ZuSQC45biNEN5qCbAzgWRT3LxLu2tzH52sBwg9\nlTdA3KpGOrHCSkGK0Ddc/OEpc3b1eCNutqgSTqmyrm9QhvtSx5uDe1Bmco/bTKGe\ns7UA/Js4VQSvE3QQ2GKU\n=mIJ6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-