-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/290a62102fdb57b3e91cb3132d01f42a04b4b76e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T13:49:42Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T13:49:42Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"release: v0.14.3 — de idp clients sync writes YAML (idp-clients.yaml)\n\nThe dev IdP client/tile registry is now written as YAML (friendlier to hand-edit\nand hot-reload than JSON). de idp clients sync + de idp new --emit emit YAML;\ndefault --out is idp-clients.yaml. Keys unchanged (client_id/client_secret/\nredirect_uris/tile) so a .json with the same keys still parses. Regenerated the\nde idp CLI reference page. Pairs with devedge-idp (idp-clients.yaml/grants.yaml)\nand devedge-sdk v0.54.0 (YAML grants file + one documented Grant schema).","tree":{"sha":"f7c41e4e2e2bbbaf117ad39c88407974badc608b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/f7c41e4e2e2bbbaf117ad39c88407974badc608b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/290a62102fdb57b3e91cb3132d01f42a04b4b76e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_