5e98809e93f255260a0ac33dbf1e31988/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T03:47:37Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T03:47:37Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"feat(idp): add de idp verb group + app tile-metadata (WS-026)\n\nAdd the discovery/registration substrate for the dev IdP launchpad:\n\n- Optional, backward-compatible tile metadata (types.Tile: displayName,\n  description, iconURL, launchURL) on the route model, project RouteEntry,\n  and kind:Shell (shell-level tile → shell catch-all route). Plumbed through\n  the daemon RegisterRequest so tiles declared in devedge.yaml/kind:Shell\n  survive registration and are readable at GET /v1/routes. Existing configs\n  with no tile parse and behave identically.\n\n- New `de idp` verb group (cmd/de/idp.go):\n  - `de idp clients sync` (keystone): discover apps from the daemon route\n    registry + local devedge.yaml/kind:Shell, and rewrite idp-clients.json\n    (client_id=app name, dev-secret dummy, redirect_uris from host, tile).\n    Sources are best-effort and merged; output is deterministic/idempotent.\n  - `de idp up`: thin wrapper routing idp.dev.test → the local IdP port.\n  - `de idp new`: thin guidance pointing at infobloxopen/devedge-idp, with\n    --emit for a starter devedge.yaml + sample idp-clients.json.\n\n- Tests: tile round-trip + backward-compat (shell + project), client\n  synthesis/grouping/contract-shape/idempotency, sync-from-config E2E, and\n  command registration.","tree":{"sha":"c2f53d4e8c6f98cd8d8e4c305cc35aa4a9711fca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/c2f53d4e8c6f98cd8d8e4c305cc35aa4a9711fca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/e8986f05e98809e93f255260a0ac33dbf1e31988","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata