 local-dev auth bridge (#45)\n\nreference/cli/_index.md promises a page per de command, but cli.md and\nterraform.md were missing (never regenerated after WS-024 shipped those\ncommands). Adds both, generated by `make docs-cli` from the binary''s own help,\nmatching the sibling pages'' shape.\n\nAdds a \"Running a surface in local development\" section to\nexplanation/consuming-a-service.md documenting how a generated CLI (--header)\nor Terraform provider (headers attribute) sends the account-id/groups metadata a\ndevedge-sdk dev authorizer reads.","tree":{"sha":"544c43e894f1e3cfc21d62a457cefb05e8067be4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/544c43e894f1e3cfc21d62a457cefb05e8067be4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/6e012706a5d963012273a1d5ddd286b085490e49","verification":{"payload":"tree 544c43e894f1e3cfc21d62a457cefb05e8067be4\nparent 7bc24b9ec6d2a09471a917173ee59340c9c529d2\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783106898 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783106898 -0500\n\ndocs: add de cli / de terraform CLI reference pages; document local-dev auth bridge (#45)\n\nreference/cli/_index.md promises a page per de command, but cli.md and\nterraform.md were missing (never regenerated after WS-024 shipped those\ncommands). Adds both, generated by `make docs-cli` from the binary''s own help,\nmatching the sibling pages'' shape.\n\nAdds a \"Running a surface in local development\" section to\nexplanation/consuming-a-service.md documenting how a generated CLI (--header)\nor Terraform provider (headers attribute) sends the account-id/groups metadata a\ndevedge-sdk dev authorizer reads.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSA1SCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiJQQAFSgAXp/s54sU+nqY0Z2n9T2\nI/xGItDUK1BQ/bkjxU7Uh+rvKQ1M3DlqsLhXqFSyklOz1SVTlAJbRFuyqKVAIhIB\nOUUneei8JJMojk3DqU6Ro4gX4vc8sQj77i50rOtLLAQjppD3z1H/omYvv6yYV+Jm\nQJoS7dC/4alKF97UfK0Rv1EHgxE6WUE95hCG6UKOCKla2Bw