":"6e012706a5d963012273a1d5ddd286b085490e49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/6e012706a5d963012273a1d5ddd286b085490e49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/7bc24b9ec6d2a09471a917173ee59340c9c529d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T16:19:51Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T16:19:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(slo): add de slo command group (WS-025) (#42)\n\nAdd the developer-facing SLI/SLO verbs that orchestrate the devedge-sdk slo\nseam (imported directly as a pure-Go library transform; bump devedge-sdk to\nv0.50.0):\n\n  de slo generate  derive default OpenSLO SLOs from the enriched OpenAPI and\n                   write slo.yaml, deriving the gRPC service FQN (proto package\n                   + service name) from the project''s .proto files and passing\n                   it as the rpc.service label. Fails loud when a single service\n                   cannot be determined, so it never emits un-service-scoped SLIs.\n  de slo lint      run the fail-loud three-layer classifier (text|json)\n  de slo render    project to prometheus|grafana|loki; --preset-dir feeds the\n                   internal Grafana-Operator overlay\n  de slo check     query Prometheus/Cortex for each SLO''s current SLI and\n                   error-budget consumption, to calibrate the defaults\n  de slo kpis      print the Layer-0 API KPI reference\n\nAdd a how-to guide and the generated CLI reference page. Tests cover the\ngenerate->lint->render happy path, both fail-loud FQN paths, comment-safe FQN\nderivation, and the check query against a stubbed Prometheus API.","tree":{"sha":"19d88d4747b80889acd1efebdc33c28e40aac033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/19d88d4747b80889acd1efebdc33c28e40aac033"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/7bc24b9ec6d2a09471a917173ee59340c9c529d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 19d88d4747b80889acd1efebdc33c28e40aac033\nparent 89f9dae54031627845d2a74927d240ed17dc1595\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783095591 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783095591 -0500\n\nfeat(slo): add de slo command group (WS-025) (#42)\n\nAdd the developer-facing SLI/SLO verbs that orchestrate the devedge-sdk slo\nseam (imported directly as a pure-Go library transform; bump devedge-sdk to\nv0.50.0):\n\n  de slo generate  derive default OpenSLO SLOs from the enriched OpenAPI and\n                   write slo.yaml, deriving the gRPC service FQN (proto package\n                   + service name) from the project''s .proto files and passing\n                   it as the rpc.service label. Fails loud when a single service\n                   cannot be determined, so it never emits un-service-scoped SLIs.\n  de slo lint      run the fail-loud three-layer classifier (text|json)\n  de slo render    project to prometheus|grafana|loki; --preset-dir feeds the\n                   internal Grafana-Operator overlay\n  de slo check     query Prometheus/Cortex for each SLO''s current SLI and\n                   error-budget consumption, to calibrate the defaults\n  de slo kpis      print the Layer-0 API KPI reference\n\nAdd a how-to guide and the generated CLI reference page. Tests cover the\ngenerate->lint->render happy path, both fail-loud FQN paths, comment-safe FQN\nderivation, and the check query against a stubbed Prometheus API.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqR+EnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmxoQAD0A/dYrRnWTCOKM3HKFalsV\nobfoY2ydcCwTbxYxrWRiZxfk/ds6xU35yqRP1Juap/cdd7d5Pfxv7SRNhVzHvz0g\njdXBcdn4XtqFirrjxLTs9S3Xnsoj0IMvGCCfBkzWTPoA2uGFfM0VvXzZkCqDWwjj\n8xtsB8W2yl1daot4Gk2Evcpdfjs8NQlP+yJ3CdUeU6hdWCP2hdOVce9kqDt/nYzU\nwtEpJN+1vjvKzEBNVOCbjhHybmAC20n/38vvv/qbSQArGFF8E6Ru0nF0zip2rSIJ\nQiX/vjeyW09BkL8ghnHMd3vB8GawtZ3dNPm8OgX6Rs+lOBtdGc6nHsZ6yS/dpBgc\nZ7s/EjyYRk3q8LKngcnPAHaCzfWgB4F7wZa+6T8fqmL/3M+DZmmIo557WE6hkjBL\nLdHTbtOJurS9QtfmBxXR7JJzpbEPEDZsP9V1Ss6XeJTBrgaXECJzPFAsmTr7wq0S\ncfVYTg/FXC+nVd0rTs8uqKB/+RIq2dkbH4B0ZZEceiQtuQ/ZfdS273CuBKw+EV1y\nubQNGydNvbtbIOdmTrQunGNDTp2j9D5Nc/aztjYcovx4JBB3YCC7AFl45dr2f9dc\nmzlb6w0OWYKpTjhNHx0vYinOxmhynFKhSziF0NqqySZ//DfNg8g9fVfI0QOIEEwS\n4FucKhJywzAbNlLtsRfI\n=qz5O\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T16:19:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","re