comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T02:40:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(terraform): de terraform add accumulates resources into one provider (#34)\n\ntfgen registers only the resource from its current invocation, so a second\n''de terraform add'' dropped earlier resources. Re-derive resources_gen.go from\nevery generated resource in internal/provider after tfgen runs (the mirror of\nhow ''de cli add'' rebuilds domains_gen.go from gen/), so repeated adds compose\ninto one multi-resource provider. Adds TestTerraformMultiResource and a\nsymmetric note in the consuming-a-service doc.","tree":{"sha":"e4ba0c0c554f50047af19acda61ffc7412b5d9d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/e4ba0c0c554f50047af19acda61ffc7412b5d9d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/be21919cffc4c92a1259c6c123738916297365e0","verification":{"payload":"tree e4ba0c0c554f50047af19acda61ffc7412b5d9d6\nparent 8f3ed2f841e8c07d1ca865becd951ab0a91b1eff\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783046446 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783046446 -0500\n\nfix(terraform): de terraform add accumulates resources into one provider (#34)\n\ntfgen registers only the resource from its current invocation, so a second\n''de terraform add'' dropped earlier resources. Re-derive resources_gen.go from\nevery generated resource in internal/provider after tfgen runs (the mirror of\nhow ''de cli add'' rebuilds domains_gen.go from gen/), so repeated adds compose\ninto one multi-resource provider. Adds TestTerraformMultiResource and a\nsymmetric note in the consuming-a-service doc.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRyEuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN5AQALE2pcqwuduMCPbLPfHpWnxW\n7qUSlvfjVJFLUWghOfHjmrqfHUkBijrlJC8Tiqt0oIo+olCTSLQzJIkR8X70McMe\nZ+U38fCTuqFZa/3O+74Mq/dj3y2oY2l7gvkmfXGx7+PN/2d3bkc3lCsGAujgz6LC\nvUK1ePlPP8n+ZrXhdXb8iYkH3ZR8Hf7Hb9YjVQ20YnN9V7KinbY81Dnjnr/x/