ontracts.\n- test/integration/cli_multidomain_test.go: build de, `de cli new`, add the\n  devedge-sdk toy golden as `widgets` and orders.openapi.yaml as `orders`,\n  `go mod tidy && go build`, and assert the built shell''s command tree lists both\n  domains — exercising the catalog-as-roster mechanic (domains_gen.go re-derived\n  from every gen/* domain). Guarded like scaffold_smoke: skips on -short, without\n  go on PATH, or when the sibling toy golden is absent.\n- docs explanation page \"Consuming a service\": one contract (proto -> gRPC + REST\n  + enriched OpenAPI v3) projected onto four surfaces (Go client, TS client, CLI,\n  Terraform provider), the field_behavior projection table, the open-core +\n  private-overlay (--preset-dir) seam, and the apx catalog as the discovery roster.","tree":{"sha":"b268309cd35583bb34fb276e790fbe3e83b88cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/b268309cd35583bb34fb276e790fbe3e83b88cee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/8f3ed2f841e8c07d1ca865becd951ab0a91b1eff","verification":{"payload":"tree b268309cd35583bb34fb276e790fbe3e83b88cee\nparent 50708d3d3a8ceba00fa04f8fb803262754d46200\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783046151 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783046151 -0500\n\ntest(cli)+docs: multi-domain CLI proof + one-contract-four-surfaces page (WS-024 P3b) (#33)\n\nProve that N independent API domains compose into one CLI, and document the\nwhole WS-024 consumer story end to end.\n\n- testdata/multidomain/orders.openapi.yaml: a second minimal enriched OpenAPI v3\n  fixture (Order resource; CRUD ops carrying x-aip-resource/x-aip-method/\n  x-aip-pagination; field_behavior exercising REQUIRED/OUTPUT_ONLY/IMMUTABLE and\n  an enum), so the multi-domain test uses two independent contracts.\n- test/integration/cli_multidomain_test.go: build de, `de cli new`, add the\n  devedge-sdk toy golden as `widgets` and orders.openapi.yaml as `orders`,\n  `go mod tidy && go build`, and assert the built shell''s command tree lists both\n  domains — exercising the catalog-as-roster mechanic (domains_gen.go re-derived\n  from every gen/* domain). Guarded like scaffold_smoke: skips on -short, without\n  go on PATH, or when the sibling toy golden is absent.\n- docs explanation page \"Consuming a service\": one contract (proto -> gRPC + REST\n  + enriched OpenAPI v3) projected onto four surfaces (Go client, TS client, CLI,\n  Terraform provider), the field_behavior projection table, the open-core +\n  private-overlay (--preset-dir) seam, and the apx catalog as the discovery roster.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRyAHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIZEQAJRY6Nz3sugAdY/brN7lNZBE\nHx4L4tLGqhcnwBj9XjDrj++whEfobRlc1LWFEoykNLOcCSYJKHZ8L3HnaNv1gzdh\nvokss2g5+XuvCpebpOaiZTpBq411Jqpw62VMtjCc9Kyrs3H4nmTspn6EYi0RiJqA\nYf1cretkEKkTyktyUUWPQLjH9IppGa0P4YszCBjX41q+uij6VorysTYGe876Z8/l\nwK1hpJsT8xYConcReZ2D086Vcx+9BWbvCLHHMognjBQTRLTYsTnMFcfnBTxgq9M4\ngm+BW+tv0Ah5Fex/sMxcevZeLWzIE0Ttpx8mE9jcpd1hBhpPz7Yt6BPZVwsc+Km9\n+DzNMLVsK+9AQwgliISXA7RszJIHQXlItS5JqrKppM/tuQuoYNA/k1HvWe4wc1Eq\np6egDwCzVSDRC/NYs5o1Z5oU+wHiaRwjHO9EiLqKPB8bGmyg3QZYHybsEyZk4byt\n5j1L03W9DrxCAxsK3jDrxibimPpZt8Tdm6Hb252CJ/h2vsKa7mLwJqJhBCjazdWM\nhdFezmb9E4z6230lKtLI+cJ27qDGjw055+o25icpZIFX6sn8BJi/azLO12lokj20\nuNMQ/FAYm52KkLs96kxwBiEKRzzEYS1LS4Fo9BoSUuGHIUB9T9ttJNBYMb/GyvxO\n+uyfG9ofh+9F4d4Cp11n\n=h7jc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T02:35:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_i