edge/commit/84ff2baa9b0ce1a53bea30015e5678abd07a88a4","sha":"84ff2baa9b0ce1a53bea30015e5678abd07a88a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/84ff2baa9b0ce1a53bea30015e5678abd07a88a4"}],"sha":"074aa2a76676c671092611355b04afa9afc9fe00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/074aa2a76676c671092611355b04afa9afc9fe00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/84ff2baa9b0ce1a53bea30015e5678abd07a88a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T00:54:59Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T00:54:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(cli): de cli new + de cli add to scaffold rebrandable CLIs (WS-024 P1) (#30)\n\nAdd the de cli noun mirroring de ufe: de cli new scaffolds a rebrandable\nCLI-shell Go repo wired to the open-core devedge-cli-sdk clikit runtime, and\nde cli add generates a domain command module from an enriched OpenAPI v3 spec\n(via the SDK''s cligen) into the shell''s gen/ and regenerates domains_gen.go so\nthe domain is registered.\n\n- internal/cliscaffold: embedded template tree + text/template render\n  (missingkey=error, render-in-memory-then-write, refuses non-empty target)\n  and the --preset-dir overlay seam (public ships no preset), mirroring\n  internal/ufescaffold. Emits go.mod, main.go (shell wiring + OIDC session\n  factory / --dev stub), an initial empty domains_gen.go, README, .gitignore,\n  .goreleaser.yaml, a CI workflow, and gen/.gitkeep.\n- cmd/de/cli.go: cliCmd/cliNewCmd/cliAddCmd; add reads the shell module + app\n  name, runs cligen in-module (no nested go.mod), and idempotently rebuilds\n  domains_gen.go from the gen/ listing.\n\nde cli add pins cligen to the SDK version in the shell go.mod via\ngo run <pkg>@<ver> so it resolves before go mod tidy and matches the runtime.","tree":{"sha":"a38f7886a5e154d52b13d17f2a38b31a94b5f4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/a38f7886a5e154d52b13d17f2a38b31a94b5f4b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/84ff2baa9b0ce1a53bea30015e5678abd07a88a4","verification":{"payload":"tree a38f7886a5e154d52b13d17f2a38b31a94b5f4b6\nparent 66a7ffa3d73a22a296dbc265939f8abc2e9ecc3e\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783040099 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783040099 -0500\n\nfeat(cli): de cli new + de cli add to scaffold rebrandable CLIs (WS-024 P1) (#30)\n\nAdd the de cli noun mirroring de ufe: de cli new scaffolds a rebrandable\nCLI-shell Go repo wired to the open-core devedge-cli-sdk clikit runtime, and\nde cli add generates a domain command module from an enriched OpenAPI v3 spec\n(via the SDK''s cligen) into the shell''s gen/ and regenerates domains_gen.go so\nthe domain is registered.\n\n- internal/cliscaffold: embedded template tree + text/template render\n  (missingkey=error, render-in-memory-then-write, refuses non-empty target)\n  and the --preset-dir overlay seam (public ships no preset), mirroring\n  internal/ufescaffold. Emits go.mod, main.go (shell wiring + OIDC session\n  factory / --dev stub), an initial empty domains_gen.go, README, .gitignore,\n  .goreleaser.yaml, a CI workflow, and gen/.gitkeep.\n- cmd/de/cli.go: cliCmd/cliNewCmd/cliAddCmd; add reads the shell module + app\n  name, runs cligen in-module (no nested go.mod), and idempotently rebuilds\n  domains_gen.go from the gen/ listing.\n\nde cli add pins cligen to the SDK version in the shell go.mod via\ngo run <pkg>@<ver> so it resolves before go mod tidy and matches the runtime.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRwhjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApEsQAJNqRH/JgHWXuIqJDWnPVP5A\nbHAqpYJS+Df4g0R1vbWT60Yg0zy9EfaU1ktLUXx/vKAUOAAp7SwL+zbeuxkuNQrd\ny4MkDTIps3QiWcYlTwaHJ36JodplOjMCj/sM0V5Wrg3sWMVYsteNEf27oo9pWk5e\nS20hpu2DiUxVbodfjtsdGUuEi73zh/fRn5GKPG/wTu25j740UXF2yWRFcViuzf++\nlx/ybhhwbZ0wO+ew7bRaIDiDPBsu5zi/YnpjQiQTtgV9UipkbFsWrSyDVXzVaUN8\nrTP6QKEozNu+BMtvRYXw0x4WTB4dWDyEid/ad3+3TMfp+nSjY0qitILDbTYFDhF/\n5t9bbHPh4WEqeLt15j87padpS1NWvPBVg7NfPcQrrHF6fgrK2B88VbT2kCxDlqrw\nGs0JbwW58H/eWObOyhRbJE2EeDriQOrrWkKDW8PuTeLUqoUTmsMk+2VT5aL2q4pu\nk/2ABNUo8aFKVO2fthfUHLYZ9sYGXdAP980hQFTlDBoZlOHHlxqw11s5i0CRhPQJ\n5wIxZGNh+0P69x+GkxYJF2Xj1lWC+xovSPexBz+MynmmzjYjQKVKAHEdcGBpbfnj\nkEYLRezJORfCdUbZinZUXp3lcgo0dKkVO33r+LOLrpwnWjvkvvnb0pwwE08h7NWI\nVvcFlXV2z6tSd6gSKNue\n=5mPJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T00:55:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow"