criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/66a7ffa3d73a22a296dbc265939f8abc2e9ecc3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T23:51:14Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T23:51:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): de api publish --client-generator go (WS-024 P0b) (#29)\n\nThread a --client-generator flag (default typescript-angular) through\n''de api publish --client'' to ''apx client generate/publish --generator''.\n--client-generator go emits a typed Go client via apx (oapi-codegen);\nfor go, --package is the Go module path and --scope is ignored. The\ndefault TS/Angular invocation is unchanged (--generator passed only when\nnon-default).","tree":{"sha":"8ecc1cb79a7f3651380f3a281484cd04491d71c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/8ecc1cb79a7f3651380f3a281484cd04491d71c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/66a7ffa3d73a22a296dbc265939f8abc2e9ecc3e","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ecc1cb79a7f3651380f3a281484cd04491d71c7\nparent b5ae44935d99c3a4620b651bced9ab278559472c\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1783036274 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783036274 -0500\n\nfeat(api): de api publish --client-generator go (WS-024 P0b) (#29)\n\nThread a --client-generator flag (default typescript-angular) through\n''de api publish --client'' to ''apx client generate/publish --generator''.\n--client-generator go emits a typed Go client via apx (oapi-codegen);\nfor go, --package is the Go module path and --scope is ignored. The\ndefault TS/Angular invocation is unchanged (--generator passed only when\nnon-default).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRvlyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANMQQAAtNNPWTus6zVez9TRZHqR+R\nUWfxJ