"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/dea90e74d45e4ea5baf9992230ae6805daa6b5f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/d82e8615676cad4f17370a73c35a1477d814ec35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:43:14Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T06:43:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"harden de ufe new scaffold: declare HomeComponent, real --preset-dir, doc/Dockerfile fixes (#17)\n\nFixes from an adversarial review of the `de ufe new` micro-frontend scaffold.\n\nP0 — HomeComponent in no NgModule\n  app-routing routes HomeComponent, but app.module declared only AppComponent,\n  so HomeComponent belonged to no NgModule. Import it and add it to the\n  AppModule declarations. Without this the routed landing view throws NG0203\n  at runtime when the route activates — the \"correct on first run\" promise\n  fails. Add a structural Go guard (TestRender_HomeComponentDeclared + an\n  assertion in the placeholder-free test) so the regression can''t recur.\n\nP1 — real, coherent --preset mechanism\n  Add `de ufe new <name> --preset-dir <path>`: load <path>/preset.json, render\n  each entry through the base template data, and overlay it onto the project\n  (override, never delete). Define the canonical preset.json schema\n  (name/description/files:[{path,template}]) and validate it (missing/empty/\n  path-escape all fail loud). Keep --preset for built-ins (public repo ships\n  none) with a clear error pointing at --preset-dir for the private\n  infoblox-cto preset. --preset and --preset-dir are mutually exclusive.\n  Document the schema and both flags in presets/README.md. Add Go tests for\n  overlay, malformed/missing manifest, exclusivity, and unknown --preset.\n\nP2 — generated README session-DI drift\n  main.ufe.ts binds SESSION_PROVIDER as a platform StaticProvider (because\n  provideDevedgeSession returns EnvironmentProviders). Update the generated\n  README to describe the actual NgModule-bootstrap wiring and note\n  provideDevedgeSession is the standalone bootstrapApplication path.\n\nP2 — Dockerfile package manager\n  Generated Dockerfile used npm while the scaffold and CLI next-steps use pnpm.\n  Switch it to corepack pnpm + `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` + `pnpm build`.","tree":{"sha":"c975a26079672458971b8c3b2bb5889ebd9c1e6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/c975a26079672458971b8c3b2bb5889ebd9c1e6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/d82e8615676cad4f17370a73c35a1477d814ec35","verification":{"payload":"tree c975a26079672458971b8c3b2bb5889ebd9c1e6d\nparent 8c8cb74273a288e08431a500c7dcdc2bad49b380\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782888194 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782888194 -0500\n\nharden de ufe new scaffold: declare HomeComponent, real --preset-dir, doc/Dockerfile fixes (#17)\n\nFixes from an adversarial review of the `de ufe new` micro-frontend scaffold.\n\nP0 — HomeComponent in no NgModule\n  app-routing routes HomeComponent, but app.module declared only AppComponent,\n  so HomeComponent belonged to no NgModule. Import it and add it to the\n  AppModule declarations. Without this the routed landing view throws NG0203\n  at runtime when the route activates — the \"correct on first run\" promise\n  fails. Add a structural Go guard (TestRender_HomeComponentDeclared + an\n  assertion in the placeholder-free test) so the regression can''t recur.\n\nP1 — real, coherent --preset mechanism\n  Add `de ufe new <name> --preset-dir <path>`: load <path>/preset.json, render\n  each entry through the base template data, and overlay it onto the project\n  (override, never delete). Define the canonical preset.json schema\n  (name/description/files:[{path,template}]) and validate it (missing/empty/\n  path-escape all fail loud). Keep --preset for built-ins (public repo ships\n  none) with a clear error pointing at --preset-dir for the private\n  infoblox-cto preset. --preset and --preset-dir are mutually exclusive.\n  Document the schema and both flags in presets/README.md. Add Go tests for\n  overlay, malformed/missing manifest, exclusivity, and unknown --preset.\n\nP2 — generated README session-DI drift\n  main.ufe.ts binds SESSION_PROVIDER as a platform StaticProvider (because\n  provideDevedgeSession returns EnvironmentProviders). Update the generated\n  README to describe the actual NgModule-bootstrap wiring and note\n  provideDevedgeSession is the standalone bootstrapApplication path.\n\nP2 — Dockerfile package manager\n  Generated Dockerfile used npm while the scaffold and CLI next-steps use pnpm.\n  Switch it to corepack pnpm + `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` + `pnpm build`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRLcCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB18QAHIlBKnRDf7p466fFpZqsuIP\ntQI4FHcqsK7f2uD5T/uCoc9NmF7M/sjVnLvkzn+R1sUc