a500c7dcdc2bad49b380","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/8c8cb74273a288e08431a500c7dcdc2bad49b380"}],"sha":"d82e8615676cad4f17370a73c35a1477d814ec35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/d82e8615676cad4f17370a73c35a1477d814ec35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/8c8cb74273a288e08431a500c7dcdc2bad49b380/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:42:19Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T05:42:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(de): add `de ufe new` micro-frontend scaffold (#15)\n\nAdd `de ufe new <name>`, the frontend mirror of `de new service`. It\ngenerates an Angular-15 + single-spa micro-frontend wired to the open-core\n@infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-* SDK, correct on first run.\n\nThe generator is self-contained (internal/ufescaffold) and mirrors\ninternal/scaffold''s render machinery: an embedded template tree walked with\npath substitution, rendered in memory, then written atomically.\n\nBy construction it eliminates the known template-bootstrap bugs:\n- default nav group validates against a dev GroupRegistry (renders, not a\n  silent drop) and assertNavContributions runs at import (fails loud);\n- the app route matches the manifest route (no accidental path: '''');\n- the session is provided into Angular DI and HttpClient carries the Bearer\n  token via the open-core bearerAuthInterceptor;\n- a single custom-webpack browser build (no dead single-spa architect\n  targets), no Angular-2-era deadweight deps, and no committed lockfile.\n\n--preset <name> is a clean overlay seam: the public CLI ships no proprietary\npreset; an unknown preset fails with a clear error pointing at the private\ninfoblox-cto preset. Includes Go tests asserting a placeholder-free tree,\nmatching route, valid nav group, and the unknown-preset error.","tree":{"sha":"a0980a61562aa30616a199c2f6477f0bee3ae108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/a0980a61562aa30616a199c2f6477f0bee3ae108"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/8c8cb74273a288e08431a500c7dcdc2bad49b380","verification":{"payload":"tree a0980a61562aa30616a199c2f6477f0bee3ae108\nparent 9bf96a3d009bcbc8ce363ad0812f3e4d614fce1c\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782884539 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782884539 -0500\n\nfeat(de): add `de ufe new` micro-frontend scaffold (#15)\n\nAdd `de ufe new <name>`, the frontend mirror of `de new service`. It\ngenerates an Angular-15 + single-spa micro-frontend wired to the open-core\n@infobloxopen/devedge-ufe-* SDK, correct on first run.\n\nThe generator is self-contained (internal/ufescaffold) and mirrors\ninternal/scaffold''s render machinery: an embedded template tree walked with\npath substitution, rendered in memory, then written atomically.\n\nBy construction it eliminates the known template-bootstrap bugs:\n- default nav group validates against a dev GroupRegistry (renders, not a\n  silent drop) and assertNavContributions runs at import (fails loud);\n- the app route matches the manifest route (no accidental path: '''');\n- the session is provided into Angular DI and HttpClient carries the Bearer\n  token via the open-core bearerAuthInterceptor;\n- a single custom-webpack browser build (no dead single-spa architect\n  targets), no Angular-2-era deadweight deps, and no committed lockfile.\n\n--preset <name> is a clean overlay seam: the public CLI ships no proprietary\npreset; an unknown preset fails with a clear error pointing at the private\ninfoblox-cto preset. Includes Go tests asserting a placeholder-free tree,\nmatching route, valid nav group, and the unknown-preset error.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRKi7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJagQAJroHLQFRUgOAChxF0AanD6F\nX02pVXkWraB75nESUs/dc5pEAv8nfIdQ70HZeve6n3/VEaRIHXW7U65YuwBuQljd\nM+R0VtkgOOOpoUugbYN7fQBc8v0vmCNHHq55J5ebz70xxNQEIfwhUxuyzxxTcf/a\nat3UqVGTUxlL1FBIqAk+eRr0OVw6Rfqh3zgf1NQ5aUIZzyuFKu/J+QoxHwYvsrND\npkdQfB2gOSYaWz11BODduNlMprnxLhHhUzmQkdVwyw/sytThIkPfYUVTW6Kl3bUv\nrEwycG8g5cWtTqzHnrQ7by1YEgZXkMD1tyr4f8kd3jyasJHPXqcPZ2FBccOuo1EJ\nnVt5xBaLdiXtTzGrLA6iNxZMy6xtcgPXP1L/5bAh0dxR+xTus9qGfr8TDzx6rcT7\nG6qxFAJMp/XP3oWdP1gXLMH1SgfJjn9+I2f0/Tle80Iv9JTFOgRXRAJR1A9aruvM\nq/ryA4R+Is6XMqnPZ9aBLKq8rKWYgy/8DGOUaysOaGTTBoHOcSTj9mZmtdZcSBad\nmq5XTnzqUNZSGedI46wBFCS/b0LjzW/H5Pl0wF9xCXm5kxW+536lqEbyiD71wFwk\ncrW4e9f8jh9kKBamA6a6OgQuALYT7pwmXqt6q90s3ue+nizegIsA+1Ou1We9n8tV\nW+gtThL3ryggscPgLTEb\n=hayY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-01T05:42:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following