os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/9bf96a3d009bcbc8ce363ad0812f3e4d614fce1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:41:07Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:41:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"de: add ''de api publish'' to publish a public API as OpenAPI v3 via apx (#13)\n\nThin wrapper chaining the existing steps: (re)generate the spec\n(make generate -> openapi/<svc>.openapi.yaml), arrange it into the apx\nlayout openapi/<domain>/<svc>/<line>/, then shell out to apx release\nprepare (and submit behind --submit; otherwise print the follow-on\nsubmit/finalize commands). Fails clearly if apx is not on PATH.","tree":{"sha":"bc01ca3bd0b779076a549f07ac6fb31cd25a8ca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/bc01ca3bd0b779076a549f07ac6fb31cd25a8ca1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/9bf96a3d009bcbc8ce363ad0812f3e4d614fce1c","verification":{"payload":"tree bc01ca3bd0b779076a549f07ac6fb31cd25a8ca1\nparent 9791c2cc2418d03f6df01ddbf4d6b64b07ae93cc\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782704467 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782704467 -0500\n\nde: add ''de api publish'' to publish a public API as OpenAPI v3 via apx (#13)\n\nThin wrapper chaining the existing steps: (re)generate the spec\n(make generate -> openapi/<svc>.openapi.yaml), arrange it into the apx\nlayout openapi/<domain>/<svc>/<line>/, then shell out to apx release\nprepare (and submit behind --submit; otherwise print the follow-on\nsubmit/finalize commands). Fails clearly if apx is not on PATH.","reason":"v