/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/c9127e1d57f4020741920bdbc468d22d6c4daf22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T22:24:41Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T22:25:36Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"feat(cell): add kind:Cell + de cell command group\n\nAdd cell-based deployment and tenant routing to de:\n\n- pkg/config/cell.go: kind:Cell resource (apiVersion devedge.infoblox.dev/v1alpha1,\n  ParseCell/MarshalCell, strict decode, replicas defaults to 1); registered in\n  ParseResource dispatch and supportedKinds.\n- cmd/de/cell.go: cellCmd() group (create/down/status/assign/move/rebalance)\n  registered in rootCmd(). Uses FileTable + MoveController + Campaign from the SDK.\n  Routes file defaults to .devedge/cells/routes.json.\n- internal/cell/cell.go: TimedDrainer (cells.Drainer), CellValues (per-cell Helm\n  values), ReleaseName helper.\n- specs/013-de-cell/spec.md: acceptance criteria for the feature.\n- Tests: pkg/config ParseCell/MarshalCell round-trip + ParseResource dispatch;\n  internal/cell assign/move/rebalance/budget/drainer against a temp-dir FileTable.\n  All tests pass without a cluster.","tree":{"sha":"caf3a9ba3fae67db90057741e9c3abbec3828f49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/caf3a9ba3fae67db90057741e9c3abbec3828f49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/c9127e1d57f4020741920bdbc468d22d6c4daf22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/c9127e1d57f4020741920bdbc468d22d6c4daf22","node_id":"C_kwDORkaP6toAKGM5MTI3ZTFkNTdmNDAyMDc0MTkyMGJkYmM0NjhkMjJkNmM0ZGFmMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/8e30243b7cd5869359e22f18da0940e63475c16f","sha":"8e30243b7cd5869359e22f18da0940e63475c16f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/8e30243b7cd5869359e22f18da0940e63475c16f"}],"sha":"c9127e1d57f4020741920bdbc468d22d6c4daf22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/c9127e1d57f4020741920bdbc468d22d6c4daf22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/8e30243b7cd5869359e22f18da0940e63475c16f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T18:06:16Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel García"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T18:06:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"WS-012: Composable Services — kind: Composition + de compose (#12)\n\n* feat(compose): add kind: Composition + de compose (WS-012 P4)\n\nSurface devedge-sdk''s servicekit composed host through devedge''s CLI: a\nkind: Composition project-file resource plus a ''de compose'' command group\nthat scaffolds, validates, generates, and smoke-tests a STATIC composed-suite\nbinary from a set of member service modules.\n\n- pkg/config: Composition resource (ParseComposition, strict decode) wired into\n  supportedKinds + ParseResource; satisfies Resource (aggregated ToRoutes) +\n  DependencyDeclarer (shared DB). Edit-tolerant parse for in-place add/remove.\n- internal/compose: module-ref parsing, the cmd/<name>/main.go + go.mod +\n  composition.lock generators (static composition — imports the modules, no Go\n  plugins), descriptor-union + version tidy (servicekit.ValidateModules +\n  servicekittest.CompatibleModules), and an in-process boot smoke.\n- cmd/de: ''de compose init/add/remove/tidy/build/test/up''; ''de compose chart''\n  is a P6 stub. ''compose up'' reuses the project-up sequencing via a shared\n  runResourceUp helper extracted from projectUpCmd (behavior preserved).\n- testdata/composefixtures: two real servicekit.Module fixtures (+ a conflicting\n  and a future-SDK one) backing the build/tidy/smoke acceptance tests; a build\n  test compiles a real two-module composed binary.\n- go.mod: require devedge-sdk v0.28.0.\n\nCloses WS-012 P4 (specs/012-de-compose).\n\n* feat(compose): implement de compose chart — P6 deploy rendering (WS-012)\n\nReplace the P4 stub with real composition → Helm chart rendering. Three\ntopology modes from spec.runtime.mode or --mode flag:\n\n  single-binary  — one Deployment for the composed binary; all member\n                   routes aggregated into that workload''s Ingress.\n  multi-daemon   — one Deployment per member module; member-owned routes.\n  hybrid         — members with failurePolicy:degraded (optional modules)\n                   get their own Deployment; all others share the composed\n                   binary. Documented rule: degraded = independent restart\n                   domain, fail-host/unset = must stay co-resident.\n\nShared database (spec.database) is provisioned once as a DependencyClaim\nin each workload; module schemas appear in values as compositionSchemas for\noperator tooling. Runtime namespacing is performed by servicekit, not by\ndeploying separate DB instances.\n\nReuses internal/helm ChartService (helm.WriteChart + helm.Lint) — same\nrendering path as de project chart; no new chart engine.\n\nNew files:\n  internal/compose/chart.go       — ComposeChart + 3 topology shapes + ToHelmValues\n  internal/compose/chart_test.go  — 19 pure structural tests\n\nUpdated:\n  cmd/de/compose.go               — composeChartCmd (replaces P6 stub)\n  cmd/de/compose_test.go          — chart CLI tests (single-binary + multi-daemon)\n  specs/012-de-compose/spec.md    — P6 spec section appended\n\nGate: make build + make lint + make test all pass; 40 compose tests green.","tree":{"sha":"2b88c8c2bcb8e1039c89ced73cbe907e4e4156e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/2b88c8c2bcb8e1039c89ced73cbe907e4e4156e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/8e30243b7cd5869359e22f18da0940e63475c16f","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b88c8c2bcb8e1039c89ced73cbe907e4e4156e8\nparent fb7458b20df9586696a4f63aba344655b32c337d\nauthor Daniel García <dgarcia@infoblox.com> 1782669976 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782669976 -0500\n\nWS-012: Composable Services — kind: Composition + de compose (#12)\n\n* feat(compose): add kind: Composition + de compose (WS-012 P4)\n\nSurface devedge-sdk''s servicekit composed host through devedge''s CLI: a\nkind: Composition project-file resource plus a ''de compose'' command group\nthat scaffolds, validates, generates, and smoke-tests a STATIC composed-suite\nbinary from a set of member service modules.\n\n- pkg/config: Composition resource (ParseComposition, strict decode) wired into\n  supportedKinds + ParseResource; satisfies Resource (aggregated ToRoutes) +\n  DependencyDeclarer (shared DB). Edit-tolerant parse for in-place add/remove.\n- internal/compose: module-ref parsing, the cmd/<name>/main.go + go.mod +\n  composition.lock generators (static composition — imports the modules, no Go\n  plugins), descriptor-union + version tidy (servicekit.ValidateModules +\n  servicekittest.CompatibleModules), and an in-process boot smoke.\n- cmd/de: ''de compose init/add/remove/tidy/build/test/up''; ''de compose chart''\n  is a P6 stub. ''compose up'' reuses the project-up sequencing via a shared\n  runResourceUp helper extracted from projectUpCmd (behavior preserved).\n- testdata/composefixtures: two real servicekit.Module fixtures (+ a conflicting\n  and a future-SDK one) backing the build/tidy/smoke acceptance tests; a build\n  test compiles a real two-module composed binary.\n- go.mod: require devedge-sdk v0.28.0.\n\nCloses WS-012 P4 (specs/012-de-compose).\n\n* feat(compose): implement de compose chart — P6 deploy rendering (WS-012)\n\nReplace the P4 stub with real composition → Helm chart rendering. Three\ntopology modes from spec.runtime.mode or --mode flag:\n\n  single-binary  — one Deployment for the composed binary; all member\n                   routes aggregated into that workload''s Ingress.\n  multi-daemon   — one Deployment per member module; member-owned routes.\n  hybrid         — members with failurePolicy:degraded (optional modules)\n                   get their own Deployment; all others share the composed\n                   binary. Documented rule: degraded = independent restart\n                   domain, fail-host/unset = must stay co-resident.\n\nShared database (spec.database) is provisioned once as a DependencyClaim\nin each workload; module schemas appear in values as compositionSchemas for\noperator tooling. Runtime namespacing is performed by servicekit, not by\ndeploying separate DB instances.\n\nReuses internal/helm ChartService (helm.WriteChart + helm.Lint) — same\nrendering path as de project chart; no new chart engine.\n\nNew files:\n  internal/compose/chart.go       — ComposeChart + 3 topology shapes + ToHelmValues\n  internal/compose/chart_test.go  — 19 pure structural tests\n\nUpdated:\n  cmd/de/compose.go               — composeChartCmd (replaces P6 stub)\n  cmd/de/compose_test.go          — chart CLI tests (single-binary + multi-daemon)\n  specs/012-de-compose/spec.md    — P6 spec section appended\n\nGate: make build + make lint + make test all pass; 40 compose tests green.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQWKYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApH0QAIXkveA86SovZZOypaFfRfBq\nQFLYFF+XWdy7D4m2MU4mcvG9219STg4lX1HNJFGO/y1fhCIA9cpsC/HWi1d8X+sx\nfIvjrMX3TAlWggNYzAiE/CHn2T+WnC858W88ZaLUid8a2UJHiE7FIZEWQksqq5oM\nrjEpY3CmWxDcPcmeD0mr25hjcEIxt5kEPlNQLB5oodJFbZKD248Rcaj77uSsNwQZ\nwVcTqzPmsmfL5zqaCRhzcfxBOB40tYdRdCkE4FlD1uARS/ibF1uC1agA+yHqilA1\n5t1uRJcEuR0z90gjqfq+t6TUZQlw+Tmhl2UAy0946U4Z9OeO4TebxF5eGsGF3jV1\n24ds9zbE/I8jFdb6XvfajYGE7oReAsC6nMVj5kYAwBWTm2Hl6DzXRzXoWnCbprhf\nMw8D21XUYr7fnAZl76RD2AyILvPqpFeY0plL5VyUdg7wAtEYNp2KfRz/dbhM9AR2\nDcoi0+iN+UwOjL5wrKy0m8xGAopHtfSSW1ZtE5rPnMd9Zwwfvzqy7g7x3t7B4IBi\nC0HMetnICzFjuxw1INJfeXY4bdhoj6zaBR7k9dkhUh/eYuPWA6VcoaHzuNFF4nII\n+eHuH9FwsdPOxNSAt5sNv5KYeNh5KPsSR4Wwlx9S4FfAyne/VBjc+GksMI0pdpfC\nyULgOSKyIH+XHToQnWHm\n=evVx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-28T18:06:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"ht