a/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/20a5f9f73e731dcaf2c232be6a6dffbbbc688e89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T03:56:28Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T03:56:28Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Reconcile local main with origin: integrate #10 (mkcert CAROOT/TLS fallback) and #11 (daemon PATH/doctor toolchain) over feature 008\n\nMerge origin/main (commits 7b5d6e1 #10, a05f96f #11) into the local\nhub-driven feature line (007-010, de new). Both origin commits overlap our\nfeature 008 (daemon-toolchain-install-doctor), which independently implemented\ndaemon PATH injection + a doctor daemon-toolchain check. Resolved by combining,\nnot picking a side, so no local behavior regresses and origin''s missing value\nis folded in.\n\nAuto-merged (no local overlap): internal/certs/ca.go (+ca_test.go),\ninternal/proxy/proxy.go (+proxy_test.go), cmd/de/lifecycle.go,\ninternal/daemon/server.go, internal/daemon/api_test.go — these carry #10''s\nCAROOT resolution (DEVEDGE_CAROOT/CAROOT overrides, install-time caroot record,\nmkcert-output verification), the loud self-signed-fallback proxy warnings, and\nthe /v1/status TLS block wiring (SetTLSStatus/proxyTLSStatus).\n\nConflict resolutions (008 overlap):\n- internal/daemon/api.go: kept our dependency-runtime API + 3-arg NewAPI; added\n  #10''s TLSStatus type, SetTLSStatus, and tls block in /v1/status. Folded the\n  toolchain endpoint onto origin''s doctorTools list (adds \"docker\"); single\n  toolchainCheck using writeJSON.\n- internal/platform/darwin.go: dropped our duplicate discoverToolEnv/clusterTools\n  in favor of origin''s docker-aware discoverToolEnv with the richer fallback\n  (~/.rd/bin, /opt/homebrew/bin); kept OUR richer invokerHome (SUDO_HOME +\n  Linux /home fallbacks). Plist still carries PATH/HOME/KUBECONFIG.\n- internal/platform/doctor.go: kept #10''s new checkProxyTLS (self-signed = FAIL,\n  offline/old-daemon = skipped) and a single checkDaemonToolchain using origin''s\n  richer failure message (bootout/bootstrap hint); both base URLs retained.\n- internal/platform/darwin_test.go (add/add) and doctor_test.go: reconciled to\n  keep BOTH sides'' coverage — our plist-env assertion, origin''s discoverToolEnv\n  discovery/fallback/dedup + invokerHome tests, origin''s checkProxyTLS (4) and\n  checkDaemonToolchain (found/missing/offline/old-daemon) tests.\n\nPreserved unchanged: de new service, 008 client.GetToolchain + cluster preflight,\nand the rest of features 007-010.\n\nIntentionally dropped as duplicates: our copies of discoverToolEnv/clusterTools\nand the simpler origin invokerHome — superseded by the single combined versions\nabove; no behavior lost (tooling now also resolves docker).\n\nVerified: go build, go vet, and unit tests across internal/cmd/pkg all green\n(daemon, platform, certs, proxy packages reconciled from both sides pass).\ne2e/integration skipped (need k3d/daemon infra).","tree":{"sha":"9b6f727fd6ab3f51a27f496bd17f72433c0f5476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/9b6f727fd6ab3f51a27f496bd17f72433c0f5476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/