.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/d639db19897320d46bcf208e58db2fa61ae79d61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T08:49:16Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T08:49:16Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"010: health-gated route readiness — probe upstream before route registration\n\nRoutes may declare an optional readiness block in devedge.yaml:\n\n  routes:\n    - host: svc.dev.local\n      upstream: localhost:8080\n      readiness:\n        path: /healthz\n        timeout: 30s\n        interval: 500ms\n\nde project up probes the upstream health endpoint before calling\nc.Register(), preventing 502s during service startup. On timeout,\nwarns and registers anyway (non-blocking fallback). Opt-in; routes\nwithout a readiness block are unaffected.\n\n- pkg/config/project.go: ReadinessSpec struct + Readiness field on RouteEntry\n- pkg/config/service.go: Validate() checks path/timeout/interval/ordering\n- internal/health: new HTTPProber (stdlib only; injected client for tests)\n- cmd/de/main.go: probe loop before register loop; (healthy) suffix on output\n- 5 k3d e2e tests pass unchanged (SC-002/SC-005)","tree":{"sha":"cbe7499678186f20e234ac9496f1c4376d227836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/cbe7499678186f20e234ac9496f1c