","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:53:30Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:53:30Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"008: treat daemon-offline and old-daemon as skipped (not FAIL) in doctor toolchain check","tree":{"sha":"1bcff8e1c88afb368369c5d3adccb92e54df1d8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/1bcff8e1c88afb368369c5d3adccb92e54df1d8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/566d6e2efb8be2ae33751ef5219dd46fce7247d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/566d6e2efb8be2ae33751ef5219dd46fce7247d3","node_id":"C_kwDORkaP6toAKDU2NmQ2ZTJlZmI4YmUyYWUzMzc1MWVmNTIxOWRkNDZmY2U3MjQ3ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63","sha":"48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63"}],"sha":"566d6e2efb8be2ae33751ef5219dd46fce7247d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/566d6e2efb8be2ae33751ef5219dd46fce7247d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:51:25Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:51:25Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"008: de install injects PATH/HOME/KUBECONFIG; doctor shows daemon toolchain; preflight before cluster\n\nCloses the five open friction findings from the 007 onboarding walk-through\nhuman run (2026-06-10):\n\n  #1 — requireDependencyTools() now fires BEFORE EnsureCluster(), so a missing\n       helm/kubectl/k3d is caught immediately with no cluster time wasted.\n\n  #2/#3/#4 — DarwinAdapter.Install() now discovers tool directories from the\n       invoking user''s PATH (via exec.LookPath) and writes PATH, HOME, and\n       KUBECONFIG into the plist EnvironmentVariables dict, so the daemon running\n       under launchd (bare PATH, no HOME, root kubeconfig) has the execution\n       environment it needs to exec helm/kubectl/k3d and read the user''s kube\n       context. discoverToolEnv() collects unique parent dirs of found tools and\n       prepends them to a static fallback PATH. invokerHome() resolves the real\n       user''s home from SUDO_USER for sudo installs.\n\n  #5 — de doctor now includes a \"daemon toolchain\" section that calls the new\n       GET /v1/doctor/toolchain daemon endpoint. The endpoint runs exec.LookPath\n       in the daemon''s own environment (not the shell''s) and returns per-tool\n       found/path/PathSearched. Toolchain checks report \"skipped (daemon offline)\"\n       when the daemon is not running, so doctor is useful at any point.\n\nSpec: specs/008-daemon-toolchain-install-doctor/\nTests added:\n  - Plist golden test (darwin_test.go): asserts PATH/HOME/KUBECONFIG keys in\n    rendered plist; tolerates absent tools (fallback PATH, no panic).\n  - Doctor toolchain tests (doctor_test.go): httptest.Server stubs; asserts\n    found/failed results with PATH= in messages; asserts skipped when offline.\n  - All existing unit and integration tests remain green.\n\nNote: friction #6 (relative -f ENOENT) was already fixed in 577a649 with a\nregression test. The client-go port-forward migration (friction #5 durable fix)\nis deferred to a follow-on feature; de doctor''s new toolchain check exposes the\nstate so the gap is at least visible at doctor time.","tree":{"sha":"8417ff390758cad471794328c9f7b2adb1428610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/8417ff390758cad471794328c9f7b2adb1428610"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63","node_id":"C_kwDORkaP6toAKDQ4ZTQ3MTE4MjlkYjFmZmRmODU4NDhlNjM5YmNhZjIwNjQ3NWFmNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/5e298d7ba2669233afd3f00aad132be7de035e0e","sha":"5e298d7ba2669233afd3f00aad132be7de035e0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/5e298d7ba2669233afd3f00aad132be7de035e0e"}],"sha":"48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/48e4711829db1ffdf85848e639bcaf206475af63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/