:"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/b04e03d940b79dd3e3f4dd8226cfd400d341d874/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:16:29Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:16:29Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"006: dev seed on `up` (US3)\n\nApply optional dev seed once per database after migrations, dev-only.\n\n- internal/migrate/seed.go: ForkApplier.Seed runs the seed SQL (a file or a dir of\n  *.sql) and records a content fingerprint in a devedge_seed marker table, in one\n  transaction; a matching marker makes it a no-op. Uses database/sql + lib/pq.\n- reconcile: after a successful migrate, the daemon seeds when a seed is declared\n  and the resolved environment is not ephemeral/CI (FR-013); a failure holds the\n  dependency out of Ready. The environment is resolved CLI-side (DEVEDGE_ENV) and\n  passed through the apply request, since the daemon cannot detect CI itself.\n- the seed outcome (seeded / already seeded / skipped (CI)) is reported on up and\n  logged. down --clean drops the DB + marker, so the next up re-seeds.\n- verified by a live k3d e2e: apply-once, no duplicate on re-up, --clean re-seed,\n  and schema-applied-but-seed-skipped in an ephemeral environment.","tree":{"sha":"c0964048bf669e9b7d8680b27c5addfe6935276f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/c0964048bf669e9b7d8680b27c5addfe6935276f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/b04e03d940b79dd3e3f4dd8226cfd400d341d874","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/b04e03d940b79dd3e3f4dd8226cfd400d341d874","node_id":"C_kwDORkaP6toAKGIwNGUwM2Q5NDBiNzlkZDNlM2Y0ZGQ4MjI2Y2ZkNDAwZDM0MWQ4NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3","sha":"02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3"}],"sha":"b04e03d940b79dd3e3f4dd8226cfd400d341d874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/b04e03d940b79dd3e3f4dd8226cfd400d341d874"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:04:53Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T05:04:53Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"006: schema migrations in deploy mode (US2)\n\nApply a service''s schema in-cluster via a Helm pre-install/pre-upgrade hook Job\nbefore the workload Deployment rolls, and roll back across image changes via a\npersisted down-store.\n\n- service chart: migrate-job.yaml hook (rendered only when migrations declared)\n  runs the service image''s `migrate` command against the per-dep DSN Secret,\n  mounting the down-store PVC; gated before the Deployment by `helm --wait`.\n- deploy: chartValues migrations block + Workload.Migrations; cmd/de wires the\n  hook from a postgres dependency''s declared migrations; a deploy failure with\n  declared migrations points at the service-image `migrate` contract (no silent\n  skip, T016).\n- depruntime: EnsureMigrationStore side-provisions the per-service down-store PVC\n  alongside the in-cluster DSN Secret; --clean removes it.\n- the deploy migrate command and the daemon share one applier that targets the\n  image''s bundled version and migrates up OR down — deploying an older image\n  rolls the schema back using down steps persisted in the PVC even when that\n  image no longer ships them (FR-012/SC-007).\n- verified by a live k3d deploy e2e (schema-before-serve; rollback-across-image)\n  with a testdata fixture image exposing the `migrate` subcommand.","tree":{"sha":"7088109343174bdb84a22d7bf58becac1cb647c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/7088109343174bdb84a22d7bf58becac1cb647c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3","node_id":"C_kwDORkaP6toAKDAyODEwNTIyZDNmOTY4ZGQyODY0MDc4MTliYmM3MjExNWEzM2EwYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/aa680d61f7b73a3f3247d122d100cb975c0e4ef9","sha":"aa680d61f7b73a3f3247d122d100cb975c0e4ef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/aa680d61f7b73a3f3247d122d100cb975c0e4ef9"}],"sha":"02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/02810522d3f968dd286407819bbc72115a33a0a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/aa680d61f7b73a3f3247d122d100cb975c0e4ef9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T04:43:44Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T04:43:44Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"006: schema migrations on `up` — local-run (US1 MVP)\n\nGive a Service''s Postgres dependency a versioned schema-migration surface and\napply it during `de project up`, before the dependency is marked ready.\n\n- config: optional `migrations`/`seed` on a postgres dependency (strict decode,\n  engine-gated FR-011); MigrationDeclarer resolves project-relative paths.\n- internal/migrate: portable Applier (fake + fork-backed) over the\n  infobloxopen/migrate fork (consumed via a go.mod replace at the org pin). The\n  applier targets the source''s highest version and migrates up OR down to reach\n  it, using the persisted down-store as the migration source so down steps\n  survive the source no longer shipping them (FR-012).\n- depruntime/daemon: reconcileOne applies migrations over the supervised\n  port-forward after provisioning and before the DSN/env-var is emitted; on\n  failure it holds the dependency out of Ready and aborts up (FR-007); the\n  outcome is reported on up and logged; down --clean resets the host down-store.\n- verified by a live k3d e2e (test/e2e/migrations_local_test.go): schema before\n  ready, idempotent re-run, failure + common-case recovery, --clean rebuild,\n  non-clean preserve/reuse, two-service isolation, and local-run rollback.","tree":{"sha":"c547e4a8795de502ed64976313d1bcecb060c695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/c547e4a8795de502ed64976313d1bcecb060c695"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/aa680d61f7b73a3f3247d122d100cb975c0e4ef9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","rec