ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/45e8976ff4167ae7075767bef94446ea8bd8f26a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T21:21:21Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T21:21:21Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Finish 005: in-cluster dependency connection, build path, coexistence, polish\n\nComplete the workload-deploy feature (US2/US3 + polish) on top of the MVP.\n\n- depruntime: Provisioner.EnsureConnSecret emits a per-(service,dependency)\n  in-cluster DSN Secret (in-cluster Service DNS + 003 creds) during provisioning,\n  so a deployed workload connects to its deps; inClusterDSN derivation + unit test\n- service chart: gate the prod DependencyClaim CR behind service.noDependencyClaims\n  (the dev deploy sets it — no CRD in a local cluster); the daemon owns the\n  connection Secret (chart no longer renders it)\n- internal/deploy: structured logging on resolve/deploy/teardown\n- e2e: deployed workload connects to its postgres dependency over the in-cluster\n  DSN (psql round-trip) + is routable; build path (docker build + k3d image import);\n  two-service coexistence — all green on live k3d\n- docs: README/CLAUDE/CHANGELOG + quickstart; SCOPE.md trace (FR-001..011, no gold-plating)\n\nAll 20 tasks complete; build + lint + full suite green; 5 workload e2e validated.","tree":{"sha":"c23a9619c0a60df14e35ad994d6ac401686071c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/c23a9619c0a60df14e35ad994d6ac401686071c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/45e8976ff4167ae7075767bef94446ea8bd8f26a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","f