i.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/a1680161934f6c88d6187c0d264dec14f2e0f11f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T21:01:13Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T21:01:13Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Implement 005 MVP (US1): opt-in workload deploy onto the resolved cluster\n\n`de project up --deploy` deploys the service workload into the resolved cluster\n(004) via the embedded service Helm chart; down removes it. Local-run is unchanged\nwhen --deploy is absent (FR-010).\n\n- pkg/config: spec.workload block (image | build{context,dockerfile}, port, replicas)\n  with strict decode + validation + Workload()/WorkloadDeclarer (T002/T004)\n- internal/deploy: portable Deployer (render + helm upgrade --install --wait) behind\n  an ImageBuilder adapter; reference passthrough + docker-build/k3d-import build path\n  (T003/T005/T006)\n- service chart: add ingress.yaml (devedge.io/expose) for the dev hostname (T008)\n- cmd/de: `de project up --deploy` opt-in wiring + actionable error when no workload;\n  `de project down` removes the workload release (footprint-only) (T011/T012/T017)\n- e2e: reference-image deploy reaches Ready, idempotent re-deploy, ingress created,\n  down removes the release — verified on live k3d (T010)\n\nMVP only (11/20 tasks). Remaining on this branch: US2 in-cluster dependency\nconnection (T007/T009/T013) + build-path e2e (T014), US3 coexistence (T015/T016),\npolish (logging/docs/scope T018-T020).","tree":{"sha":"a4f72af5875933966dc5c06170110a4743d9a64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/a4f72af5875933966dc5c06170110a4743d9a64c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/a1680161934f6c88d6187c0d264dec14f2e0f11f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/a1680161934f6c88d6187c0d264dec14f2e0f11f","node_id":"C_kwDORkaP6toAKGExNjgwMTYxOTM0ZjZjODhkNjE4N2MwZDI2NGRlYzE0ZjJlMGYxMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/e5342b3cb150af28236f3f0594c2c6cdefc66222","sha":"e5342b3cb150af28236f3f0594c2c6cdefc66222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/e5342b3cb150af28236f3f0594c2c6cdefc66222"}],"sha":"a1680161934f6c88d6187c0d264dec14f2e0f11f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commi