cluster dependency connection via the\n  in-cluster Service DNS + per-service DSN secret (reuses 003 bindings), routing via the\n  existing external-dns/ingress-watch path\n- tasks.md: 20 tasks, MVP-first, tests-first, all [S]/[C] tagged (route-tasks gate clean)\n- analyze: cross-artifact consistency gate clean (100% requirement coverage)\n\nNo code yet; implementation follows on this branch.","tree":{"sha":"2040106364e71b4994a79b5ce600b2a196a03e10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/2040106364e71b4994a79b5ce600b2a196a03e10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/e5342b3cb150af28236f3f0594c2c6cdefc66222","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/e5342b3cb150af28236f3f0594c2c6cdefc66222","node_id":"C_kwDORkaP6toAKGU1MzQyYjNjYjE1MGFmMjgyMzZmM2YwNTk0YzJjNmNkZWZjNjYyMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/infobloxopen/devedge/commit/1ba2f0ed087e5ed6e15fadd8f05c19dc26aed02f","sha":"1ba2f0ed087e5ed6e15fadd8f05c19dc26aed02f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/1ba2f0ed087e5ed6e15fadd8f05c19dc26aed02f"}],"sha":"e5342b3cb150af28236f3f0594c2c6cdefc66222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/e5342b3cb150af28236f3f0594c2c6cdefc66222"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/1ba2f0ed087e5ed6e15fadd8f05c19dc26aed02f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:38:22Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:38:22Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Add cluster topology: shared dev cluster, ephemeral CI clusters, dedicated opt-ins (004)\n\nResolve every project to a target cluster from an explicit topology instead of the\nambient kube context.\n\n- topology: DetectEnvironment (--env/DEVEDGE_ENV > CI > dev) + Resolve -> ClusterTarget\n  (shared \"devedge\", \"devedge-ci-<runid>\", \"devedge-proj-<slug>\")\n- ensure: idempotent create-once under a host flock, reconcile-if-unbootstrapped, no\n  half-state, never mutates the current kube-context; Bootstrap installs cert-manager\n  on the local cluster so the ClusterIssuer applies (hard-fail; local-only)\n- de project up: resolve -> report \"cluster: <name> (<mode>)\" -> ensure (when deps\n  declared) -> provision deps on the resolved cluster (--env override)\n- de ci run -- <cmd>: per-run ephemeral cluster, scoped context via DEVEDGE_KUBECONTEXT,\n  torn down on every exit, propagates the wrapped exit code\n- daemon DepManager provisions per (kube context, namespace); empty context preserves\n  prior behavior; toggle-migration releases the prior cluster before reprovisioning\n- config: spec.cluster.dedicated and dependencies[].dedicated opt-ins (strict-decoded)\n- docs: README/CLAUDE/CHANGELOG; spec SCOPE.md trace (FR-017 intentionally omitted)\n\nVerified by unit + integration tests and six live k3d e2e (ensure/reuse, coexistence,\nCI lifecycle + dependency parity, dedicated instance, dedicated cluster).","tree":{"sha":"3a0e59f19f8a1e000d7e7f4840003c101184f812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/3a0e59f19f8a1e000d7e7f4840003c101184f812"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/1ba2f0ed087e5ed6e15fadd8f05c19dc26aed02f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dani