/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/commits/17b80f1e16822e1a70b098481d24aee8b98773a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T13:47:35Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T13:47:35Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Document dependency runtime + QA gate; drop dead FormatDependencies (003)\n\n- README: document the dependency runtime (shared instance + per-service\n  isolation, the fsnotify hotload DSN convention for both engines, up/down/\n  --clean/chart) and update the CLI reference.\n- Remove FormatDependencies (and its tests): dead since project up now actually\n  starts dependencies; its ''not yet supported'' message was stale.\n\nQA gate (T039): make build + lint + test green; the postgres and redis k3d\ne2es passed live this session; scope diff traces every FR/SC with no\ngold-plating. Feature 003 is functionally complete.\n\nCovers T038/T039.","tree":{"sha":"8a67c408df99f147c17993f5cf89a2d683b1e52a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/trees/8a67c408df99f147c17993f5cf89a2d683b1e52a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infobloxopen/devedge/git/commits/17b80f1e16822e1a70b098481d24aee8b98773a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/da