Cross-ref reconciliation flagged (Accepted ADRs left immutable).\n- ADR-0042 (Proposed): deterministic LLM execution (temperature-0 + SHA-256 receipts;\n  seed best-effort — Claude exposes none). Load-bearing for ADR-0018''s exact-match cache.\n\nBoth Status: Proposed — acceptance is founder-gated via the ADR-0031 ceremony (not\nself-accepted). Coherence registry regenerated (464 vars, 0 contradictions).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ekBf2Tvqg9UnocbnvDYgg\n\n* docs(adr): accept 0041/0042, reconcile 0036 cross-refs, port borderline 0043/0044\n\nFounder-authorized close-out of the legacy ADR reconciliation:\n- 0041/0042: Status Proposed -> Accepted (founder acceptance 2026-08-04, ADR-0031 ceremony).\n- 0036: reconcile the dangling ''ADR-0012'' references -> ADR-0041 (founder-authorized edit of\n  an Accepted ADR; provenance note added; rebuild 0012 is finops, not the pipeline).\n- 0043: port legacy capacity-ceiling (fib(20)=6765) as Accepted, reconciled to 0010/0032.\n- 0044: port legacy ring-topology as PROPOSED and flagged conflicting with Accepted 0032\n  (agent-waves) — recorded for provenance + founder resolution, NOT accepted (would create\n  an Accepted-vs-Accepted contradiction). Coherence: 466 vars, 0 contradictions.\n\nNote: grep confirms only 0036 (not 0030) cited ADR-0012.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ekBf2Tvqg9UnocbnvDYgg\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b60da5c35a83fb4735d0097c4966f9fdee48ece5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/b60da5c35a83fb4735d0097c4966f9fdee48ece5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/dacc673afb09072e2d7d99d28c16704469952883","verification":{"payload":"tree b60da5c35a83fb4735d0097c4966f9fdee48ece5\nparent 53b2391cca61b2cc9432b52a9816b808285cecfd\nauthor Eric Haywood <257220306+HeadyMe@users.noreply.github.com> 1785844778 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785844778 -0600\n\ndocs(adr): rewrite important legacy ADRs into rebuild (0041 pipeline, 0042 determinism) (#271)\n\n* docs(adr): rewrite important legacy ADRs into rebuild (0041 pipeline, 0042 determinism)\n\nLegacy->rebuild ADR reconciliation. A rigorous cross-map of the 21 legacy canonical\nADRs vs rebuild''s 40 (+ AGENTS.md/SOURCE_OF_TRUTH) found only TWO genuine, important,\nstill-consistent gaps — the rest are already covered, or were deliberately reversed\n(0008 dual-active, 0013 Redis event spine) and must NOT be reintroduced.\n\n- ADR-0041 (Proposed): 21-stage HCFullPipeline canonical. Closes a real defect —\n  rebuild''s 0036/0030 cite ''ADR-0012'' but rebuild 0012 is finops-spend-reporting; this\n  is the canonical home. Cross-ref reconciliation flagged (Accepted ADRs left immutable).\n- ADR-0042 (Proposed): deterministic LLM execution (temperature-0 + SHA-256 receipts;\n  seed best-effort — Claude exposes none). Load-bearing for ADR-0018''s exact-match cache.\n\nBoth Status: Proposed — acceptance is founder-gated via the ADR-0031 ceremony (not\nself-accepted). Coherence registry regenerated (464 vars, 0 contradictions).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ekBf2Tvqg9UnocbnvDYgg\n\n* docs(adr): accept 0041/0042, reconcile 0036 cross-refs, port borderline 0043/0044\n\nFounder-authorized close-out of the legacy ADR reconciliation:\n- 0041/0042: Status Proposed -> Accepted (founder acceptance 2026-08-04, ADR-0031 ceremony).\n- 0036: reconcile the dangling ''ADR-0012'' references -> ADR-0041 (founder-authorized edit of\n  an Accepted ADR; provenance note added; rebuild 0012 is finops, not the pipeline).\n- 0043: port legacy capacity-ceiling (fib(20)=6765) as Accepted, reconciled to 0010/0032.\n- 0044: port legacy ring-topology as PROPOSED and flagged conflicting with Accepted 0032\n  (agent-waves) — recorded for provenance + founder resolution, NOT accepted (would create\n  an Accepted-vs-Accepted contradiction). Coherence: 466 vars, 0 contradictions.\n\nNote: grep confirms only 0036 (not 0030) cited ADR-0012.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ekBf2Tvqg9UnocbnvDYgg\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcdQqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqd0QAKlsjNiyYFoNnG8WTHUA8x6D\nFSrwDNGAiq2MwMgtiv9MFTsNTpL+Xz972CCXZ0T7aKB+VnhPhwWFfod/O7xJhK5z\ncLkD3bXLbcwTodcIJ5f7S3V21T4PBqjlGNSrFeKR5I9JLvABAohZmQHE7N6tnwHo\nrzywoefY2ElIrgdXyavcquZtiVYgXCmVu2IrD3a8ovj3J/OAfkurHzvCjR5rEpKH\nf00AzuPCj5Gg5JsvfrhRXVOMzVnblAESWFFQK7bPPhbgAAt4qRy4rNrLzjtPTOFv\nXTg7uunEQ7r89CDoihcNrng6dCgTZn1K93N5wrcfwy+yQltRvGwHYFNrEWWN+w/3\nEIRl00jrB1htqN1BvNlcO9W+b9fsr67Y74Z3yRnb7XPZr3qJbFLIe5of/EflbFZB\nmSj8sNA1Cnld8LtJEqQ0me9UTF67kzb+oxNfNmL1Z72Ye4f3Przc2/5RU4Le1brA\nVOTEgTrZ0PWLHNM8ckGBjj9DI597mACnCDRpy6yI+PljpOgIeWoE852MVIGEXAli\nA6vLeGLe0bdrnx/oSRMUefU/8CpDMYwF6RoPsuJAg9sfI8WoUh5E83rQ+ySYCnKA\nLzcE+BWKOF784YZnTRg5/DG4oPMl4dLDNBUtwmtb/RgR+fg9ugziCSexJYpAcIYY\nV8ydS3fdXPuLfYNREXU/\n=kbHZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-04T12:00:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/rec