mit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:57:33Z","email":"257220306+HeadyMe@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:57:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(causal-inference): @heady/causal-inference — Wave-1 legacy port pilot (#270)\n\n* feat(causal-inference): port Pearl causal engine as @heady/causal-inference (Wave-1 pilot)\n\nFirst legacy->rebuild capability recovery (roadmap Wave 1, ADR-0040). Ports the\npublic-domain causal core from the legacy service into a pure, deterministic ESM\npackage mirroring @heady/csl-engine:\n\n- createModel (SCM), intervene (Pearl do-operator), counterfactual\n  (abduction->action->prediction), monteCarloSimulate (seeded, deterministic).\n- Pure functions (no IO), constants from @heady/phi-math (no magic numbers),\n  cycle detection, node --test suite (8 tests passing locally).\n\nPer ARBITER (ADR-0040): the causal core is public-domain Pearl math and is NOT\npatent-locked; the legacy /pipeline/assess CSL stage-gate (HS-2026-058) is DEFERRED\nand, when added, must delegate to @heady/csl-engine.cslGate rather than re-embody it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ekBf2Tvqg9UnocbnvDYgg\n\n* fix(ci): sync pnpm-lock + regenerate coherence variable registry for causal-inference\n\n- pnpm-lock.yaml: register @heady/causal-inference workspace project (unblocks\n  ''pnpm install --frozen-lockfile'' → lint·test·build + managed-region freshness).\n- docs/HEADY_VARIABLE_REGISTRY.md: regenerate via tooling/coherence (462→463 vars,\n  ADR-0040 row) → unblocks the coherence gate. 0 contradictions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ekBf2Tvqg9UnocbnvDYgg\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b97c9d49ee22aff92bd8f561359371b174a61b07","url":"https: