ed in speculative/analytical engines\n  (causal-inference, digital-twin, ghost-protocol — top 3 verified by endpoint code)\n  and a consumer companion-MCP line.\n- Corrected a false-positive: hc_imagination/monte_carlo/story_driver already in rebuild.\n\nIncludes a 4-wave implementation roadmap landing each significant gap in rebuild\nconventions (Latent Service Pattern, Zod, contracts, ADR), with causal-inference as\nthe recommended pilot PR.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ekBf2Tvqg9UnocbnvDYgg\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"670a198588c8a1129db7344ed405db49844e3b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/670a198588c8a1129db7344ed405db49844e3b5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/a47772db07673416310f9e2a52a8f33cdfb1567d","verification":{"payload":"tree 670a198588c8a1129db7344ed405db49844e3b5d\nparent a284a516a183fb188a7759f293c6a23d6b6bd8e7\nauthor Eric Haywood <257220306+HeadyMe@users.noreply.github.com> 1785832032 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785832032 -0600\n\ndocs: legacy->rebuild gap analysis + implementation roadmap (#268)\n\nComponent-level (not file-level) cross-map of the legacy orphan\n(legacy/sacred-geometry-orphan-2026-06) against rebuild''s packages, apps, and 135\nskills. Findings verified against source:\n\n- The 20k-file legacy mass is largely illusory: 95 empty-stub services (0-line\n  server.js, verified), most of the rest name-only boilerplate.\n- Rebuild''s skill layer supersedes ~155 legacy components (not gaps).\n- 24 genuine gaps (H=3, M=15, L=6), clustered in speculative/analytical engines\n  (causal-inference, digital-twin, ghost-protocol — top 3 verified by endpoint code)\n  and a consumer companion-MCP line.\n- Corrected a false-positive: hc_imagination/monte_carlo/story_driver already in rebuild.\n\nIncludes a 4-wave implementation roadmap landing each significant gap in rebuild\nconventions (Latent