I/commits/a7b68443361149c42bb16449af7d44c9c8b52f6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:22:23Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:22:23Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"chore(gitignore): ignore the session-local 990 live-verify harness\n\ntooling/verify990.local.mjs applies 0005/0006 to an isolated Neon COW branch and\nruns a real hybrid query to verify the 990 search plane against live pgvector.\nKept local (gitignored) — hits the live Neon API, not for CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c327bbe6f2a6aabc99d51353322f2c52c0aafc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/1c327bbe6f2a6aabc99d51353322f2c52c0aafc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/a7b68443361149c42bb16449af7d44c9c8b52f6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c327bbe6f2a6aabc99d51353322f2c52c0aafc5\nparent afaefece23a73998d3c0147f11a6b944d5112b44\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785342143 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785342143 -0600\n\nchore(gitignore): ignore the session-local 990 live-verify harness\n\ntooling/verify990.local.mjs applies 0005/0006 to an isolated Neon COW branch and\nruns a real hybrid query to verify the 990 search plane against live pgvector.\nKept local (gitignored) — hits the live Neon API, not for CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamoovwAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHPZ/AQCIu7HhQqJfv9V82/72nw5ZtwFleVYJ+eYxIxRACN8rIQD/R5PcPE6W67FQ\naYTHsTdRqGdBigUNIsGfzAWtP3Muigk=\n=hD+l\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/a7b68443361149c42bb16449af7d44c9c8b52f6f","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKGE3YjY4NDQzMzYxMTQ5YzQyYmIxNjQ0OWFmN2Q0NGM5YzhiNTJmNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/afaefece23a73998d3c0147f11a6b944d5112b44","sha":"afaefece23a73998d3c0147f11a6b944d5112b44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/afaefece23a73998d3c0147f11a6b944d5112b44"}],"sha":"a7b68443361149c42bb16449af7d44c9c8b52f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a7b68443361149c42bb16449af7d44c9c8b52f6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/afaefece23a73998d3c0147f11a6b944d5112b44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:03:33Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:03:33Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"fix(heady-sync): fail-closed deletion guard — kill the mass-deletion hazard\n\n`git add -A` in the sync path would stage deletions a concurrent writer\n(cron auto-commit, IDE agent, --watch) transiently caused, then commit+push\nthem, wiping the configs/+ADR corpus on origin. Add a deletion_guard (mirrors\nthe existing secret_guard) that runs after `git add -A`, before commit:\n\n- BULK: aborts if staged deletions exceed HEADY_SYNC_MAX_DELETIONS (default 13\n  = fib(7), φ-derived) — a race drops far more than a refactor\n- INVARIANT PATHS: a single deletion under configs/, docs/adr/,\n  packages/db/migrations/, or of AGENTS.md/facts.yaml/CLAUDE.md aborts\n- fail-closed: on trip, `git reset` unstages and exits 3 — nothing pushed\n- override intended deletions with HEADY_SYNC_ALLOW_DELETIONS=1\n- --dry-run previews whether the guard would trip\n\nVerified in a throwaway repo: bulk→trip, protected→trip, override→pass,\nsmall-refactor→pass. Small deletions still sync freely.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a5c2d7fd21b944dc1a42a27db085803f895597f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/0a5c2d7fd21b944dc1a42a27db085803f895597f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/afaefece23a73998d3c0147f11a6b944d5112b44","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a5c2d7fd21b944dc1a42a27db085803f895597f\nparent 4ded4c59c13cfb9256f17efca28365e20b4d830c\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785341013 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785341013 -0600\n\nfix(heady-sync): fail-closed deletion guard — kill the mass-deletion hazard\n\n`git add -A` in the sync path would stage deletions a concurrent writer\n(cron auto-commit, IDE agent, --watch) transiently caused, then commit+push\nthem, wiping the configs/+ADR corpus on origin. Add a deletion_guard (mirrors\nthe existing secret_guard) that runs after `git add -A`, before commit:\n\n- BULK: aborts if staged deletions exceed HEADY_SYNC_MAX_DELETIONS (default 13\n  = fib(7), φ-derived) — a race drops far more than a refactor\n- INVARIANT PATHS: a single deletion under configs/, docs/adr/,\n  packages/db/migrations/, or of AGENTS.md/facts.yaml/CLAUDE.md aborts\n- fail-closed: on trip, `git reset` unstages and exits 3 — nothing pushed\n- override intended deletions with HEADY_SYNC_ALLOW_DELETIONS=1\n- --dry-run previews whether the guard would trip\n\nVerified in a throwaway repo: bulk→trip, protected→trip, override→pass,\nsmall-refactor→pass. Small deletions still sync freely.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamokVQAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHKm8AQDukHxetGE5vjmuRQJIsMBnsVtPqzngX0tfU0ty8JFRGQD/SNlKCkMKpy0N\nhJbBw9U46AM6qnOAQ3cihw/K+S6awg0=\n=RRRL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gith