ub.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a8eccd3ee3d88ee0893485318e4ab874c0636785/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:36:44Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T15:48:22Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(990): Phase-A A3 — hybrid search + provenance-linked org/filings API\n\nThe 990 vertical''s action surface over the data plane. Every result carries\nits IRS MeF lineage (source object + content sha256) — no assertion without\nprovenance.\n\n- packages/heady990/src/search.mjs: pure RRF (k=60) + keyword(tsvector),\n  vector(pgvector cosine, 384-dim), hydrate(org+latest filing) SQL builders;\n  state/minRevenue pushed INTO the candidate WHERE (pre-rank, never a\n  post-filter on a truncated top-N)\n- packages/heady990 shapes: validateSearchQuery boundary (q/limit/state/minRevenue)\n- migration 0006_990_search: search_tsv GENERATED column (GIN) + embedding\n  vector(384) (hnsw) on heady_990.organizations\n- apps/heady-manager/src/heady990.mjs: kernel-managed service; GET /990/search\n  (hybrid when embedder wired, keyword-only otherwise), /990/orgs/:ein,\n  /990/orgs/:ein/filings; disabled⇒503; search results enforce provenance\n- apps/heady-manager/src/embed-query.mjs: Workers-AI REST query embedder for the\n  origin (no edge AI binding); locked bge-small-384, fail-closed on wrong dim,\n  φ-backoff on transient failures\n- apps/heady-manager/src/index.mjs: composition root now injects the 990 service\n  (live DbPort + CF-cred-gated embedder) — previously it registered disabled\n- contracts: OpenAPI search990/getOrg990/getOrgFilings990 + Search990Result/\n  Provenance990 schemas; lock-step contract test updated\n\nNOTE: migration 0006 + the pgvector/tsvector SQL are verified at the\nplumbing/string level only (fake DbPort); NOT yet run against a live Postgres\n(HEADY_TEST_DATABASE_URL unset). Acceptance = apply 0006 to a Neon COW branch\n+ one real hybrid query.\n\nGates green: heady990 17/17, heady-manager 39/1-skip, contracts 35/35,\nturbo 86/86; law-lint + 6 enforcers + governance + coherence + facts all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43f2bd28777dd5fbddea1eabe975a7fab28298c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/43f2bd28777dd5fbddea1eabe975a7fab28298c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/a8eccd3ee3d88ee0893485318e4ab874c0636785","verification":{"payload":"tree 43f2bd28777dd5fbddea1eabe975a7fab28298c5\nparent a656d89367e515a31c6cd8a8a891ca9e718ddf54\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785339404 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785340102 -0600\n\nfeat(990): Phase-A A3 — hybrid search + provenance-linked org/filings API\n\nThe 990 vertical''s action surface over the data plane. Every result carries\nits IRS MeF lineage (source object + content sha256) — no assertion without\nprovenance.\n\n- packages/heady990/src/search.mjs: pure RRF (k=60) + keyword(tsvector),\n  vector(pgvector cosine, 384-dim), hydrate(org+latest filing) SQL builders;\n  state/minRevenue pushed INTO the candidate WHERE (pre-rank, never a\n  post-filter on a truncated top-N)\n- packages/heady990 shapes: validateSearchQuery boundary (q/limit/state/minRevenue)\n- migration 0006_990_search: search_tsv GENERATED column (GIN) + embedding\n  vector(384) (hnsw) on heady_990.organizations\n- apps/heady-manager/src/heady990.mjs: kernel-managed service; GET /990/search\n  (hybrid when embedder wired, keyword-only otherwise), /990/orgs/:ein,\n  /990/orgs/:ein/filings; disabled⇒503; search results enforce provenance\n- apps/heady-manager/src/embed-query.mjs: Workers-AI REST query embedder for the\n  origin (no edge AI binding); locked bge-small-384, fail-closed on wrong dim,\n  φ-backoff on transient failures\n- apps/heady-manager/src/index.mjs: composition root now injects the 990 service\n  (live DbPort + CF-cred-gated embedder) — previously it registered disabled\n- contracts: OpenAPI search990/getOrg990/getOrgFilings990 + Search990Result/\n  Provenance990 schemas; lock-step contract test updated\n\nNOTE: migration 0006 + the pgvector/tsvector SQL are verified at the\nplumbing/string level only (fake DbPort); NOT yet run against a live Postgres\n(HEADY_TEST_DATABASE_URL unset). Acceptance = apply 0006 to a Neon COW branch\n+ one real hybrid query.\n\nGates green: heady990 17/17, heady-manager 39/1-skip, contracts 35/35,\nturbo 86/86; law-lint + 6 enforcers + governance + coherence + facts all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamogxgAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHFfSAP4oKm/tv99Q5Cq9oi9JMxyrDkXX2CX3Q/3fEP+NcOrSGQEAl0twH32fqA/2\nL2411ZSpyR6v/LUHFV3OIeaSDO7dfgY=\n=s+u1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_