","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/ff078c1e20ae6c7dc6e1b8e9882fcc70f2aefc69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T13:29:17Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T13:29:17Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(headyfinance): leg 2 — the live path (PAPER first): execution adapter + trading loop\n\nCompletes the vertical''s pipeline: strategy signal → risk gate → EXECUTION.\n\n- execution.mjs: the broker-agnostic ExecutionAdapter contract + createPaperBroker\n  — deterministic paper fills with correct signed-position / weighted-avg-price /\n  realized-P&L accounting (add, partial close, flip), no network, no money.\n- live-loop.mjs: runLivePaper — the SAME loop a live run would use, reconciling\n  the broker''s position to the risk-gated strategy target each bar, marking to\n  market, feeding equity back to the risk engine (no lookahead). Refuses a\n  non-paper broker — live execution stays separately gated.\n- A live Apex/Tradovate adapter is a FUTURE impl of the same contract (NOT\n  stubbed — real money is triple-gated: account procured + paper-proven +\n  explicit founder go). Founder-decided path: free paper account first, Apex\n  eval next.\n- 33 headyfinance tests total (7 new): broker accounting incl. flip, the\n  end-to-end loop, risk-breach flatten, and the non-paper-broker refusal.\n  npm run live = the full pipeline on paper.\n\nGates: law-lint/enforcers clean · coherence 0 · headyfinance 33/33.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9d4590d547a459c7fb664c6c5ba887c566ba56c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/d9d4590d547a459c7fb664c6c5ba887c566ba56c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/ff078c1e20ae6c7dc6e1b8e9882fcc70f2aefc69","verification":{"payload":"tree d9d4590d547a459c7fb664c6c5ba887c566ba56c\nparent 279695871859ed04fb56928dfd81770f77dd68a7\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785331757 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785331757 -0600\n\nfeat(headyfinance): leg 2 — the live path (PAPER first): execution adapter + trading loop\n\nCompletes the vertical''s pipeline: strategy signal → risk gate → EXECUTION.\n\n- execution.mjs: the broker-agnostic ExecutionAdapter contract + createPaperBroker\n  — deterministic paper fills with correct signed-position / weighted-avg-price /\n  realized-P&L accounting (add, partial close, flip), no network, no money.\n- live-loop.mjs: runLivePaper — the SAME loop a live run would use, reconciling\n  the broker''s position to the risk-gated strategy target each bar, marking to\n  market, feeding equity back to the risk engine (no lookahead). Refuses a\n  non-paper broker — live execution stays separately gated.\n- A live Apex/Tradovate adapter is a FUTURE impl of the same contract (NOT\n  stubbed — real money is triple-gated: account procured + paper-proven +\n  explicit founder go). Founder-decided path: free paper account first, Apex\n  eval next.\n- 33 headyfinance tests total (7 new): broker accounting incl. flip, the\n  end-to-end loop, risk-breach flatten, and the non-paper-broker refusal.\n  npm run live = the full pipeline on paper.\n\nGates: law-lint/enforcers clean · coherence 0 · headyfinance 33/33.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8