ollowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/279695871859ed04fb56928dfd81770f77dd68a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T13:26:28Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T13:26:28Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(heady990): 990 Intelligence Phase-A — schema + MeF XML ingestion w/ provenance\n\nSecond vertical, built directly after the background worktree agent stalled\n(produced nothing — killed, taken over). Phase-A A1+A2 per FOUNDATIONS plan §3.\n\n- A1: packages/db/migrations/0005_990_intelligence.sql — heady_990 schema:\n  organizations (EIN pk, name, state, NTEE, subsection, ruling year) + filings\n  (financials: revenue/expenses/assets/liabilities/net-assets; governance:\n  voting/independent members) + PROVENANCE (source_object_id, source_url,\n  content_sha256, ingested_at) so every fact traces to its source filing.\n  Upsert-keyed (ein, tax_period_end, return_type) — 990 is refreshable public\n  data, not an append-only ledger.\n- A2: @heady/heady990 — a targeted IRS MeF 990 XML parser (real efile element\n  names), normalization that binds every filing to its provenance, strict\n  validators (no fact without a source: content hash mandatory), and a\n  DbPort-based org+filing upsert loader (org + filing in ONE tx; injected port,\n  unit-testable with a fake). Realistic MeF fixture + 9 tests (parse, hash\n  determinism, normalize, validate, fake-port load, fail-closed).\n- .gitignore: un-ignore all packages/db/migrations/*.sql (migrations are source,\n  not dumps — previously only 0004 was exempt from the *.sql ignore).\n\nTestable now with no network/DB: cd packages/heady990 && npm test. Lawful public\nIRS data — no regulatory weight. Gates: law-lint/enforcers/governance/coherence\nclean · facts.v1 · turbo 86/86 · heady990 9/9.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ad7ceb023e50c131d2efc20fb5559b78ef3a866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/7ad7ceb023e50c131d2efc20fb5559b78ef3a866"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/279695871859ed04fb56928dfd81770f77dd68a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ad7ceb023e50c131d2efc20fb5559b78ef3a866\nparent 10625a9e827120edffc3543ee24b4f7a501192e3\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785331588 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785331588 -0600\n\nfeat(heady990): 990 Intelligence Phase-A — schema + MeF XML ingestion w/ provenance\n\nSecond vertical, built directly after the background worktree agent stalled\n(produced nothing — killed, taken over). Phase-A A1+A2 per FOUNDATIONS plan §3.\n\n- A1: packages/db/migrations/0005_990_intelligence.sql — heady_990 schema:\n  organizations (EIN pk, name, state, NTEE, subsection, ruling year) + filings\n  (financials: revenue/expenses/assets/liabilities/net-assets; governance:\n  voting/independent members) + PROVENANCE (source_object_id, source_url,\n  content_sha256, ingested_at) so every fact traces to its source filing.\n  Upsert-keyed (ein, tax_period_end, return_type) — 990 is refreshable public\n  data, not an append-only ledger.\n- A2: @heady/heady990 — a targeted IRS MeF 990 XML parser (real efile element\n  names), normalization that binds every filing to its provenance, strict\n  validators (no fact without a source: content hash mandatory), and a\n  DbPort-based org+filing upsert loader (org + filing in ONE tx; injected port,\n  unit-testable with a fake). Realistic MeF fixture + 9 tests (parse, hash\n  determinism, normalize, validate, fake-port load, fail-closed).\n- .gitignore: un-ignore all packages/db/migrations/*.sql (migrations are source,\n  not dumps — previously only 0004 was exempt from the *.sql ignore).\n\nTestable now with no network/DB: cd packages/heady990 && npm test. Lawful public\nIRS data — no regulatory weight. Gates: law-lint/enforcers/governance/coherence\nclean · facts.v1 · turbo 86/86 · heady990 9/9.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamn/hAAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHKtTAPwJMFhm7h9YKeW4GBOfItGtVLsbJ5NumG4Mr0eLQAkhngD/c+KAVQYZFSEt\nuRt6iBk+VK8yCjs0UflQ4+aLQpGUqAs=\n=kQZS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"h