criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/d8aa4a4a931f2b806e552e2f4e3f13aa95033c8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T13:05:53Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T13:05:53Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"fix(governance-gate): skip .claude (agent worktrees) in the patent-coverage walk\n\nSame worktree-pollution class as the law-lint fix: the walk() skipped\nnode_modules/.git/dist/_archive but descended into .claude/worktrees/agent-*/,\nwhose internal /packages/ copies matched the coverage scope and flagged every\npatent-marked file as CODEOWNERS-uncovered (false positives). Real governance\ntargets live at the repo root, never under .claude. 7/7 self-tests pass;\npatent-coverage back to OK (9 marked, all covered).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a0b8a1a5d90dcac6c38ac38d694b1592d0e9932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/7a0b8a1a5d90dcac6c38ac38d694b1592d0e9932"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/d8aa4a4a931f2b806e552e2f4e3f13aa95033c8e","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a0b8a1a5d90dcac6c38ac38d694b1592d0e9932\nparent 3268dcd0d0e81d8d1c97001bad7400bd05f154e5\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785330353 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785330353 -0600\n\nfix(governance-gate): skip .claude (agent worktrees) in the patent-coverage walk\n\nSame worktree-pollution class as the law-lint fix: the walk() skipped\nnode_modules/.git/dist/_archive but descended into .claude/worktrees/agent-*/,\nwhose internal /packages/ copies matched the coverage scope and flagged every\npatent-marked file as CODEOWNERS-uncovered (false positives). Real governance\ntargets live at the repo root, nev