url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a7d9c678bffb7302a41122b00b2911f4f6428752/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:51:31Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:51:31Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(headyfinance): paper-mode risk+signal advisory engine (first vertical)\n\nThe first product vertical, on the governed foundation. Ports + CORRECTS the\nlegacy Apex risk agent (src/trading/apex-risk-agent.js) into @heady/headyfinance\n— paper-mode only: it computes risk verdicts + a ternary signal (REPEL/HOLD/\nENGAGE) over price/P&L ticks. No order execution, no custody (light-regulatory).\n\n- Fixed the drawdown bug per the heady-trading-compliance spec: trail UP on\n  highest REALIZED balance (not live equity), LOCK once the level reaches the\n  starting balance, BREACH on real-time equity (balance + unrealized P&L). The\n  legacy code got all three wrong. Faithful port + a proof test for each.\n- src/: accounts (Apex tier presets + custom personal account), drawdown tracker,\n  CSL risk gates (over the locked @heady/csl-engine sigmoid), the risk engine\n  (structured onEvent sink, no console), and a paper-trading simulator so it''s\n  testable on SIMULATED money with no broker/data/real-capital.\n- bin/demo-sim.mjs (npm run sim) — a runnable no-money demo.\n- 13 tests, all green; personalized via account config.\n- facts.yaml: registered headyfinance (role fintech-advisory) per the founder''s\n  headyfinance-vs-headytrade reconciliation (2026-07-29). Single-line note (the\n  golden-record''s minimal YAML reader rejects folded scalars).\n\nGates: facts.v1 conformant · coherence 0 · law-lint + enforcers clean ·\nturbo 85/85 · headyfinance 13/13.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dced23a8343645efe65a0c7c1460383fe26828e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/2dced23a8343645efe65a0c7c1460383fe26828e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/a7d9c678bffb7302a41122b00b2911f4f6428752","verification":{"payload":"tree 2dced23a8343645efe65a0c7c1460383fe26828e\nparent c95b276a33323f5d3ce3cd3707444a21b1425163\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785329491 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785329491 -0600\n\nfeat(headyfinance): paper-mode risk+signal advisory engine (first vertical)\n\nThe first product vertical, on the governed foundation. Ports + CORRECTS the\nlegacy Apex risk agent (src/trading/apex-risk-agent.js) into @heady/headyfinance\n— paper-mode only: it computes risk verdicts + a ternary signal (REPEL/HOLD/\nENGAGE) over price/P&L ticks. No order execution, no custody (light-regulatory).\n\n- Fixed the drawdown bug per the heady-trading-compliance spec: trail UP on\n  highest REALIZED balance (not live equity), LOCK once the level reaches the\n  starting balance, BREACH on real-time equity (balance + unrealized P&L). The\n  legacy code got all three wrong. Faithful port + a proof test for each.\n- src/: accounts (Apex tier presets + custom personal account), drawdown tracker,\n  CSL risk gates (over the locked @heady/csl-engine sigmoid), the risk engine\n  (structured onEvent sink, no console), and a paper-trading simulator so it''s\n  testable on SIMULATED money with no broker/data/real-capital.\n- bin/demo-sim.mjs (npm run sim) — a runnable no-money demo.\n- 13 tests, all green; personalized via account config.\n- facts.yaml: registered headyfinance (role fintech-advisory) per the founder''s\n  headyfinance-vs-headytrade reconciliation (2026-07-29). Single-line note (the\n  golden-record''s minimal YAML reader rejects folded scalars).\n\nGates: facts.v1 conformant · coherence 0 · law-lint + enforcers clean ·\nturbo 85/85 · headyfinance 13/13.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamn3UwAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHOWoAPwNsl/oy2HGDhmnrGbgj1ihS24xB/mGsA1YC4nZ9srEIAEA4js+UUGviNS/\nHtephOdDDS4C7qCG36r/NIHZ9MCanA0=\n=rjNb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/a7d9c678bffb7302a41122b00b2911f4f6428752","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKGE3ZDljNjc4YmZmYjczMDJhNDExMjJiMDBiMjkxMWY0ZjY0Mjg3NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/c95b276a33323f5d3ce3cd3707444a21b1425163","sha":"c95b276a33323f5d3ce3cd3707444a21b1425163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/c95b276a33323f5d3ce3cd3707444a21b1425163"}],"sha":"a7d9c678bffb7302a41122b00b2911f4f6428752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a7d9c678bffb7302a41122b00b2911f4f6428752"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/c95b276a33323f5d3ce3cd3707444a21b1425163/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:27:42Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:27:42Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"docs: foundations-via-products plan — ship 990 + headyfinance ON the foundation\n\nReconciles the funder''s \"ship both ASAP\" with the founder''s \"build foundations\nproperly so automation is natural later.\" Thesis: each product is a vertical\nslice that forces exactly the foundation it needs, in dependency order, nothing\nspeculative — and automation arrives as the capstone because its prerequisites\n(action surface, eval gate, model-egress chokepoint, audit/approval rails) are\nbuilt as byproducts of shipping 990 then headyfinance.\n\n- Phase A (990): 5 testable increments (domain schema → ingestion+provenance →\n  hybrid-search API → assisted summaries → benchmark) that each leave a reusable\n  foundation piece; grounded in the existing @heady/* packages.\n- Phase B (headyfinance): reuses ~70% of A, adds signed audit-of-record\n  (@heady/approvals) + compliance gate; scope flagged as a founder decision.\n- Phase C: automation as capstone — maps each prerequisite to the A/B step that\n  builds it.\n- Preconditions: July-6 breach vector is a HARD STOP for infra automation (not\n  for product build); cost stays ~0 on the Cloudflare credit.\n- Two founder decisions needed: sequential vs parallel; what headyfinance IS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb20952b23e41fe0d8fadd010778a5751b11a61b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/eb20952b23e41fe0d8fadd010778a5751b11a61b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/c95b276a33323f5d3ce3cd3707444a21b1425163","verification":{"payload":"tree eb20952b23e41fe0d8fadd010778a5751b11a61b\nparent 596ec5122bc4de3979c44c1907c37f6fe6d0b6fd\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785328062 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785328062 -0600\n\ndocs: foundations-via-products plan — ship 990 + headyfinance ON the foundation\n\nReconciles the funder''s \"ship both ASAP\" with the founder''s \"build foundations\nproperly so automation is natural later.\" Thesis: each product is a vertical\nslice that forces exactly the foundation it needs, in dependency order, nothing\nspeculative — and automation arrives as the capstone because its prerequisites\n(action surface, eval gate, model-egress chokepoint, audit/approval rails) are\nbuilt as byproducts of shipping 990 then headyfinance.\n\n- Phase A (990): 5 testable increments (domain schema → ingestion+provenance →\n  hybrid-search API → assisted summaries → benchmark) that each leave a reusable\n  foundation piece; grounded in the existing @heady/* packages.\n- Phase B (headyfinance): reuses ~70% of A, adds signed audit-of-record\n  (@heady/approvals) + compliance gate; scope flagged as a founder decision.\n- Phase C: automation as capstone — maps each prerequisite to the A/B step that\n  builds it.\n- Preconditions: July-6 breach vector is a HARD STOP for infra automation (not\n  for product build); cost stays ~0 on the Cloudflare credit.\n- Two founder decisions needed: sequential vs parallel; what headyfinance IS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamnxvgAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHFPQAQDWPJ3t90Un5IfolBQo6dawURJcWIuWBmzEpP7cneTrwgD+MUR1cHaUdT/k\ndWG+i4x8kpTLU+QLoWofreMhAw30xQQ=\n=2tkM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"logi