/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/596ec5122bc4de3979c44c1907c37f6fe6d0b6fd","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDU5NmVjNTEyMmJjNGRlMzk3OWM0NGMxOTA3YzM3ZjZmZTZkMGI2ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/dd08f78a9c9e5467434c5e3b5f9baf126305079c","sha":"dd08f78a9c9e5467434c5e3b5f9baf126305079c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/dd08f78a9c9e5467434c5e3b5f9baf126305079c"}],"sha":"596ec5122bc4de3979c44c1907c37f6fe6d0b6fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/596ec5122bc4de3979c44c1907c37f6fe6d0b6fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/dd08f78a9c9e5467434c5e3b5f9baf126305079c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:14:22Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:14:22Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(field): ADR-0032 — the Field & agent-waves as an enforceable invariant\n\nFormalizes the founder''s model — one universal substrate (\"the Field\"), with\nseeds and agents as temporary, localized waves of thought — as governed\narchitecture, not metaphor. Names the invariant the rebuild already encodes\n(\"no positions\"; agents-last, derived) and extends the projection-engine law\n(ADR-0017: reconstructible one-way projection of the SoR) from artifacts to\ncognition.\n\n- docs/adr/0032-field-and-agent-waves.md: the Field is the sole authority\n  (append-only event log + Neon/pgvector SoR); a Seed is a bounded initial\n  condition; an agent is an ephemeral wave (seeded→localizing→exciting→\n  writing_back→dissolved) that holds NO authoritative state outside the Field\n  (conservation = ADR-0000 reconstructibility); identity is emergent; composition\n  is geometric (CSL). Explicitly reconciled with ADR-0000 (the Field is the\n  DURABLE substrate, vector/latent is a derived region — NOT RAM/latent-as-truth)\n  so it doesn''t reopen the settled rejection. Includes an external-language\n  guardrail: internally \"the Field / agent-waves\"; externally speak it concretely\n  (single authoritative memory substrate, stateless ephemeral agents, CSL\n  composition) — never market \"consciousness\".\n- @heady/contracts seed.v1 (seed-shapes.mjs): validateSeed makes\n  temporary·localized·bounded·purposeful machine-checkable (intention, context_ref\n  + non-empty scope, finite-positive amplitude, positive-integer ttl_ms, origin\n  enum); isLegalWaveTransition enforces a forward-only lifecycle with collapse from\n  any live state. Magnitudes (φ ceilings) stay with the executor/phi-math; the\n  contract enforces shape. 4 tests.\n- configs/laws.json: registers the `field-authority` law — advisory (honest): the\n  contract shape is enforced now; the deep \"no agent persists authoritative state\n  outside the Field\" rule waits for the native agent loop (ADR-0016) to enforce\n  against. Enforcement target named.\n\nGates: contracts 34/34 · coherence 0 contradictions (law registry valid) ·\nlaw-lint + enforcers clean · facts.v1 conformant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7c0386e5d08293ed130e9d7a2c8ba25b9616bcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/e7c0386e5d08293ed130e9d7a2c8ba25b9616bcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/dd08f78a9c9e5467434c5e3b5f9baf126305079c","verification":{"payload":"tree e7c0386e5d08293ed130e9d7a2c8ba25b9616bcb\nparent ec870d3b37e91bb852dadd3f6f90de65a0d99b65\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785327262 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1785327262 -0600\n\nfeat(field): ADR-0032 — the Field & agent-waves as an enforceable invariant\n\nFormalizes the founder''s model — one universal substrate (\"the Field\"), with\nseeds and agents as temporary, localized waves of thought — as governed\narchitecture, not metaphor. Names the invariant the rebuild already encodes\n(\"no positions\"; agents-last, derived) and extends the projection-engine law\n(ADR-0017: reconstructible one-way projection of the SoR) from artifacts to\ncognition.\n\n- docs/adr/0032-field-and-agent-waves.md: the Field is the sole authority\n  (append-only event log + Neon/pgvector SoR); a Seed is a bounded initial\n  condition; an agent is an ephemeral wave (seeded→localizing→exciting→\n  writing_back→dissolved) that holds NO authoritative state outside the Field\n  (conservation = ADR-0000 reconstructibility); identity is emergent; composition\n  is geometric (CSL). Explicitly reconciled with ADR-0000 (the Field is the\n  DURABLE substrate, vector/latent is a derived region — NOT RAM/latent-as-truth)\n  so it doesn''t reopen the settled rejection. Includes an external-language\n  guardrail: internally \"the Field / agent-waves\"; externally speak it concretely\n  (single authoritative memory substrate, stateless ephemeral agents, CSL\n  composition) — never market \"consciousness\".\n- @heady/contracts seed.v1 (seed-shapes.mjs): validateSeed makes\n  temporary·localized·bounded·purposeful machine-checkable (intention, context_ref\n  + non-empty scope, finite-positive amplitude, positive-integer ttl_ms, origin\n  enum); isLegalWaveTransition enforces a forward-only lifecycle with collapse from\n  any live state. Magnitudes (φ ceilings) stay with the executor/phi-math; the\n  contract enforces shape. 4 tests.\n- configs/laws.json: registers the `field-authority` law — advisory (honest): the\n  contract shape is enforced now; the deep \"no agent persists authoritative state\n  outside the Field\" rule waits for the native agent loop (ADR-0016) to enforce\n  against. Enforcement target named.\n\nGates: contracts 34/34 · coherence 0 contradictions (law registry valid) ·\nlaw-lint + enforcers clean · facts.v1 conformant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamnungAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHIWPAQCGZHIXUVn5ppdiY/jGqUICPxQyOW4IeO/0aFtnR9Rm8QEA3UuR3fUEer4M\nKiMLM7T+Vh3fs1Lp6qGcSafmcQ8LWQY=\n=/sUo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com