_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/252318c4bd86f3eadc04e754494db9a9160ac667/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T04:05:19Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T04:05:19Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(projection): founder-confirmed headyX source mappings (2026-07-24)\n\nFounder-approved the domain→source_path mappings — the last non-gated item in\nthe projection track. All 5 headyX shells now derive from real, substantial\nsources (no more confirmed:false):\n\n- headysystems → apps/headysystems (its own app + dedicated systems-projection\n  deploy workflow) — unchanged.\n- headyos, headyio, headyapi, headyweb → apps/headyme-portal (the one\n  substantial Heady frontend SPA, 42 files) as pages-app/cloudflare-pages.\n  Corrects a bad default: headyos/headyapi previously mapped to\n  apps/mcp-dashboard, which is a README-only stub (1 file) — they were\n  projecting an empty app. These 4 have no dedicated app yet, so they project\n  the canonical frontend as their proposed source; edit sources.json + re-run\n  projections:generate when each domain''s own app lands.\n\nRegenerated all manifests; drift gate clean (5/5 in-sync); unconfirmed_sources\nnow empty; console still renders all 5 projection_only (12/12).\n\nGates: 9/9 · law-lint · enforcers 0 · coherence 0 · facts.v1 conformant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3f5ded51c74c2db554d0fa574428223bdd4c13b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/c3f5ded51c74c2db554d0fa574428223bdd4c13b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/252318c4bd86f3eadc04e754494db9a9160ac667","verification":{"payload":"tree c3f5ded51c74c2db554d0fa574428223bdd4c13b\nparent e10a1872bc486c4ea47097453f6929fa89ee29f2\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784952319 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784952319 -0600\n\nfeat(projection): founder-confirmed headyX source mappings (2026-07-24)\n\nFounder-approved the domain→source_path mappings — the last non-gated item in\nthe projection track. All 5 headyX shells now derive from real, substantial\nsources (no more confirmed:false):\n\n- headysystems → apps/headysystems (its own app + dedicated systems-projection\n  deploy workflow) — unchanged.\n- headyos, headyio, headyapi, headyweb → apps/headyme-portal (the one\n  substantial Heady frontend SPA, 42 files) as pages-app/cloudflare-pages.\n  Corrects a bad default: headyos/headyapi previously mapped to\n  apps/mcp-dashboard, which is a README-only stub (1 file) — they were\n  projecting an empty app. These 4 have no dedicated app yet, so they project\n  the canonical frontend as their proposed source; edit sources.json + re-run\n  projections:generate when each domain''s own app lands.\n\nRegenerated all manifests; drift gate clean (5/5 in-sync); unconfirmed_sources\nnow empty; console still renders all 5 projection_only (12/12).\n\nGates: 9/9 · law-lint · enforcers 0 · coherence 0 · facts.v1 conformant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEAB