"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/b2d04ab98b6d0338ca94eb921bd4d660198183ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:32:33Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:32:33Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"ci(projection): ADR-0017 §4 drift cron + close CI enforcer-coverage gap\n\nFounder-approved + signed 2026-07-24 (per ADR-0013) — the scheduled/persistent\njob the anti-silent-persistence rule (AGENTS.md) gates on explicit approval.\n\n- .github/workflows/projection-drift.yml: scheduled realization of ADR-0017 §4.\n  Runs `npm run projections:check` on cron + on PR/push touching the projection\n  sources or manifests + workflow_dispatch. Fail-closed on stale shells.\n  Cost-aware cadence: HOURLY (not the ADR''s 15-min) — pre-deploy only\n  source-ahead is detectable, so hourly cuts scheduled runs ~4×; bump to */15\n  once shells deploy and the live projection-ahead probe is active. (Dormant\n  until the account-level Actions suppression clears — same as the other gates.)\n- ci.yml: added zod-boundary (Law 5) + phi-timing (Law 8) enforcer steps to the\n  governance job — they ran in the /heady-handoff verify table but not in CI;\n  now every enforcer is CI-gated on PR/push, closing the coverage gap.\n\nVerified: both workflows parse; governance workflow-sync intact (33↔33);\nprojections:check green (5/5 in-sync). Gates 9/9 · turbo 80/80.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a961862755ba10b84b194bf1ac0d89a05dab9825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/a961862755ba10b84b194bf1ac0d89a05dab9825"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/b2d04ab98b6d0338ca94eb921bd4d660198183ea","verification":{"payload":"tree a961862755ba10b84b194bf1ac0d89a05dab9825\nparent 1b039abbf5cb417e70651ea1413f760a6790b748\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784950353 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784950353 -0600\n\nci(projection): ADR-0017 §4 drift cron + close CI enforcer-coverage gap\n\nFounder-approved + signed 2026-07-24 (per ADR-0013) — the scheduled/persistent\njob the anti-silent-persistence rule (AGENTS.md) gates on explicit approval.\n\n- .github/workflows/projection-drift.yml: scheduled realization of ADR-0017 §4.\n  Runs `npm run projections:check` on cron + on PR/push touching the projection\n  sources or manifests + workflow_dispatch. Fail-closed on stale shells.\n  Cost-aware cadence: HOURLY (not the ADR''s 15-min) — pre-deploy only\n  source-ahead is detectable, so hourly cuts scheduled runs ~4×; bump to */15\n  once shells deploy and the live projection-ahead probe is active. (Dormant\n  until the account-level Actions suppression clears — same as the other gates.)\n- ci.yml: added zod-boundary (Law 5) + phi-timing (Law 8) enforcer steps to the\n  governance job — they ran in the /heady-handoff verify table but not in CI;\n  now every enforcer is CI-gated on PR/push, closing the coverage gap.\n\nVerified: both workflows parse; governance workflow-sync intact (33↔33);\nprojections:check green (5/5 in-sync). Gates 9/9 · turbo 80/80.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamQuUQAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHPZ6AP9VcrRGw2+oG2tCgg2fptxuyqzUKflqPRezMLIog7UlAAD+Mt4npFMUqZzJ\nxAQAAp4TAuRLg/v5/8ewRzCoghjFwAU=\n=oiV9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/b2d04ab98b6d0338ca94eb921bd4d660198183ea","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKGIyZDA0YWI5OGI2ZDAzMzhjYTk0ZWI5MjFiZDRkNjYwMTk4MTgzZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/1b039abbf5cb417e70651ea1413f760a6790b748","sha":"1b039abbf5cb417e70651ea1413f760a6790b748"