erate handoff HANDOFF-2026-07-23T17-06-38-282Z.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5fa1bd8e894f83ae1b598889e601d74826efb15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/d5fa1bd8e894f83ae1b598889e601d74826efb15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/5a0155e7e12f6c74e59e48fb7d7e5f630e41e057","verification":{"payload":"tree d5fa1bd8e894f83ae1b598889e601d74826efb15\nparent a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784826399 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784826399 -0600\n\ndocs: generate handoff HANDOFF-2026-07-23T17-06-38-282Z.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamJKHwAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHKmAAP9PE/YPAActlyiUKyVCIDMhFc/AfSQJtLWazNdUfi6bWgD/U9jclddspdNV\nNBmhw4AuBtNAlCSJp5H0rkPKHz2zwQo=\n=6GW8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/5a0155e7e12f6c74e59e48fb7d7e5f630e41e057","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDVhMDE1NWU3ZTEyZjZjNzRlNTllNDhmYjdkN2U1ZjYzMGU0MWUwNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f","sha":"a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f"}],"sha":"5a0155e7e12f6c74e59e48fb7d7e5f630e41e057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/5a0155e7e12f6c74e59e48fb7d7e5f630e41e057"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:06:38Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:06:38Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(console): render headyX shells projection_only from governed manifests (ADR-0017/§8)\n\nThe §8 console already honored a LIVE server-manifest.v1 body (classifyHttp),\nbut the headyX shells aren''t deployed — probing their .com hit app2 and would\nmasquerade as \"healthy\". Now the console reads the committed governed manifest\nFIRST for any expected:\"projection\" connector and renders projection_only from\nit — the shell telling the truth about itself before it is deployed, never a\nnetwork probe of its public URL (the exact masquerade §8 forbids).\n\n- classifyProjectionManifest (pure, exported): projection.v1 manifest →\n  {state: projection_only, detail: \"projected → <target_repo> (<status>)\"}.\n- Injectable readProjection (default: configs/projections/<id>.projection.json);\n  probeOne short-circuits expected:projection to the manifest, falling through to\n  the live-manifest probe only when no governed manifest exists.\n- Tests: classifier unit; manifest-first path proves the .com is NEVER fetched;\n  no-manifest fallthrough still measures a live shell; the live-app test now\n  asserts all 5 headyX candidates render projection_only despite fetch→200.\n\nPortal side unchanged — console-logic.mjs already styles projection_only\n(violet ghost cell + expected-vs-measured truthNote). This closes the console\nconsumption slice; shell deploy stays gated (facts.yaml + open hijack incident).\n\nGates: 11/11 · turbo 80/80 · console 12/12, 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9f2192aa7536de445aa9a99c5be2229257092b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/f9f2192aa7536de445aa9a99c5be2229257092b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f","verification":{"payload":"tree f9f2192aa7536de445aa9a99c5be2229257092b5\nparent 9885642e40f32d1504219fa2b85fd4af1d38e9ed\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784826398 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784826398 -0600\n\nfeat(console): render headyX shells projection_only from governed manifests (ADR-0017/§8)\n\nThe §8 console already honored a LIVE server-manifest.v1 body (classifyHttp),\nbut the headyX shells aren''t deployed — probing their .com hit app2 and would\nmasquerade as \"healthy\". Now the console reads the committed governed manifest\nFIRST for any expected:\"projection\" connector and renders projection_only from\nit — the shell telling the truth about itself before it is deployed, never a\nnetwork probe of its public URL (the exact masquerade §8 forbids).\n\n- classifyProjectionManifest (pure, exported): projection.v1 manifest →\n  {state: projection_only, detail: \"projected → <target_repo> (<status>)\"}.\n- Injectable readProjection (default: configs/projections/<id>.projection.json);\n  probeOne short-circuits expected:projection to the manifest, falling through to\n  the live-manifest probe only when no governed manifest exists.\n- Tests: classifier unit; manifest-first path proves the .com is NEVER fetched;\n  no-manifest fallthrough still measures a live shell; the live-app test now\n  asserts all 5 headyX candidates render projection_only despite fetch→200.\n\nPortal side unchanged — console-logic.mjs already styles projection_only\n(violet ghost cell + expected-vs-measured truthNote). This closes the console\nconsumption slice; shell deploy stays gated (facts.yaml + open hijack incident).\n\nGates: 11/11 · turbo 80/80 · console 12/12, 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamJKHgAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHO3KAP44L1UaeL7T1qbomO8Nq9iYnue8CX1hskZrmcGIjFXcDQEAmcsJ3hzm0Noa\n/8HrcxMcpyXYnq2av1kTKDmVJ7yljQc=\n=Aw65\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKGE5NmU0OTI5MWIwMjc5NzZhNjQzMzBhZDhiODg1ZWY0YTZjNzNkMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/9885642e40f32d1504219fa2b85fd4af1d38e9ed","sha":"9885642e40f32d1504219fa2b85fd4af1d38e9ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/9885642e40f32d1504219fa2b85fd4af1d38e9ed"}],"sha":"a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a96e49291b027976a64330ad8b885ef4a6c73d1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/u