2\nSgsWJK/xRtz9GJBg2+lx8Ok1QgWMqQ4=\n=ulcS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/9885642e40f32d1504219fa2b85fd4af1d38e9ed","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDk4ODU2NDJlNDBmMzJkMTUwNDIxOWZhMmI4NWZkNGFmMWQzOGU5ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/3ac52c98bbe3bb2d1c816ceb03a9e951f187cd42","sha":"3ac52c98bbe3bb2d1c816ceb03a9e951f187cd42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/3ac52c98bbe3bb2d1c816ceb03a9e951f187cd42"}],"sha":"9885642e40f32d1504219fa2b85fd4af1d38e9ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/9885642e40f32d1504219fa2b85fd4af1d38e9ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/3ac52c98bbe3bb2d1c816ceb03a9e951f187cd42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:01:34Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:01:34Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(projection): ADR-0017 governed projection engine + headyX shell manifests\n\nDomains-as-projections, built on the confirmed ADR-0017 reading (governed\none-way shells derived from the monorepo SoR; vector/latent space is a DERIVED\nlayer, NOT the authority — ADR-0000). Engine + manifests only; NO shell is\ndeployed to any live domain (human-gated + the open hijack incident).\n\n- @heady/contracts projection-shapes: validateProjectionManifest (projection.v1,\n  ADR-0017 §2 fields, strict), PROJECTION_STATES lifecycle + isLegalProjection-\n  Transition (forward-only except deprecated→active), DRIFT_STATES. 5 tests.\n- @heady/projection-engine (tooling/): content-addressable sorted-tree SHA-256\n  hash (excl .git/node_modules/build/dist + manifest private_paths — an edit OR\n  rename retriggers; private paths never enter the hash), the Node projector\n  (drift classify in-sync/source-ahead/projection-ahead, emits a projection_only\n  ServerManifest validated by the EXISTING validateServerManifest), and the\n  governed SyncProjectionBee work-unit — porting the INTENT of the legacy CJS\n  src/bees/sync-projection-bee.js (hash→delta→project) MINUS its `git add -A`\n  push and RAM-as-truth framing; no live-swarm runtime is faked. 8 tests.\n- Generator (bin/heady-project): derives a projection.json manifest +\n  ServerManifest for each headyX projection candidate in connectors.json via an\n  explicit, reviewable configs/projections/sources.json mapping; fail-closed on\n  a missing source_path. 5 shells generated (all manifests contract-valid),\n  status:proposed. Server-manifests land in gitignored .data/ (derived,\n  reconstructible per ADR-0000).\n\nHonest gaps (flagged, not faked): 4 of 5 source mappings are `confirmed:false`\n(headyos/headyio/headyapi/headyweb) — founder confirms each domain''s real\nsource_path in sources.json. Console consumption of the ServerManifests + shell\ndeploy are the gated follow-ups.\n\nGates: 11/11 · turbo 80/80 · contracts 30 · projection-engine 8, 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f45ea8a82a9c30399816744b789606c8d59d92c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/f45ea8a82a9c30399816744b789606c8d59d92c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/3ac52c98bbe3bb2d1c816ceb03a9e951f187cd42","verification":{"payload":"tree f45ea8a82a9c30399816744b789606c8d59d92c0\nparent a04419e4ea167519efefde935b9e815813edea69\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784826094 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784826094 -0600\n\nfeat(projection): ADR-0017 governed projection engine + headyX shell manifests\n\nDomains-as-projections, built on the confirmed ADR-0017 reading (governed\none-way shells derived from the monorepo SoR; vector/latent space is a DERIVED\nlayer, NOT the authority — ADR-0000). Engine + manifests only; NO shell is\ndeployed to any live domain (human-gated + the open hijack incident).\n\n- @heady/contracts projection-shapes: validateProjectionManifest (projection.v1,\n  ADR-0017 §2 fields, strict), PROJECTION_STATES lifecycle + isLegalProjection-\n  Transition (forward-only except deprecated→active), DRIFT_STATES. 5 tests.\n- @heady/projection-engine (tooling/): content-addressable sorted-tree SHA-256\n  hash (excl .git/node_modules/build/dist + manifest private_paths — an edit OR\n  rename retriggers; private paths never enter the hash), the Node projector\n  (drift classify in-sync/source-ahead/projection-ahead, emits a projection_only\n  ServerManifest validated by the EXISTING validateServerManifest), and the\n  governed SyncProjectionBee work-unit — porting the INTENT of the legacy CJS\n  src/bees/sync-projection-bee.js (hash→delta→project) MINUS its `git add -A`\n  push and RAM-as-truth framing; no live-swarm runtime is faked. 8 tests.\n- Generator (bin/heady-project): derives a projection.json manifest +\n  ServerManifest for each headyX projection candidate in connectors.json via an\n  explicit, reviewable configs/projections/sources.json mapping; fail-closed on\n  a missing source_path. 5 shells generated (all manifests contract-valid),\n  status:proposed. Server-manifests land in gitignored .data/ (derived,\n  reconstructible per ADR-0000).\n\nHonest gaps (flagged, not faked): 4 of 5 source mappings are `confirmed:false`\n(headyos/headyio/headyapi/headyweb) — founder confirms each domain''s real\nsource_path in sources.json. Console consumption of the ServerManifests + shell\ndeploy are the gated follow-ups.\n\nGates: 11/11 · turbo 80/80 · contracts 30 · projection-engine 8, 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamJI7gAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHGbYAQCiUUGIhLbE61NuAXLwsYu3eTbg