y@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamIvogAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHHuAAP9XuvOcdBLWSSI+/D1jvVrqDhXBezlYY9cypbUTPEb9zgD+KBXFMNTMdKCK\nnctiyDL876pDy+ST1CxRu8aBjj9/FAU=\n=bMIH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/1f0373a6d3b85475c83fa43c22413d70e833fb3b","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDFmMDM3M2E2ZDNiODU0NzVjODNmYTQzYzIyNDEzZDcwZTgzM2ZiM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/85cf4bf5e91aca05319a5dbd7a8b897a28c348d7","sha":"85cf4bf5e91aca05319a5dbd7a8b897a28c348d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/85cf4bf5e91aca05319a5dbd7a8b897a28c348d7"}],"sha":"1f0373a6d3b85475c83fa43c22413d70e833fb3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/1f0373a6d3b85475c83fa43c22413d70e833fb3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/85cf4bf5e91aca05319a5dbd7a8b897a28c348d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:13:37Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:13:37Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"fix(edge): headymcp.com restored to the live origin — governed router replaces hijacked proxy\n\nDiscovered during the redeploy: the live headymcp.com worker (script\nheadymcp-com) was a reverse proxy to an external host — one of 23 per-domain\nworkers overwritten 2026-07-06 (founder-attributed to a tool run, not an\nexternal breach). The repo''s governed router was itself stale (dead us-east1\norigin + dead Colab-compiler webhook + KV-hologram cruft), so a blind redeploy\nwould have swapped one broken state for another.\n\n- Rewrote cloudflare/worker-heady-router as a clean transparent edge proxy:\n  origin is env-derived (HEADY_ORIGIN, AGENTS.md #4 — fail-closed 502/503 when\n  unset/unreachable), MCP passthrough tag for headymcp, redirect-Location\n  rewrite, hop-by-hop header stripping. Removed the dead Colab/KV path\n  (AGENTS.md: no dead-end integrations).\n- Live origin located by probing: heady-manager-609590223909.us-central1\n  (heady-mcp-bridge v2.0.0) serves the MCP surface at /sse (text/event-stream)\n  + /health; the router''s old us-east1 target is dead.\n- Deployed to the headymcp-com script in place (route headymcp.com/* preserved),\n  HEADY_ORIGIN bound to the live origin.\n\nVERIFIED: headymcp.com/health → 200 (heady-mcp-bridge), headymcp.com/sse → 200\ntext/event-stream via x-heady-origin=us-central1, root no longer serves the\nexternal proxy''s challenge page.\n\nScope: headymcp only (the request). The other 22 hijacked scripts still proxy\nthe external host; each needs its OWN intended origin (headyme→portal, etc.) —\npointing them all at the MCP bridge would be wrong, so they are left for a\nper-domain follow-up. Forensics + full list in session-local incident record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28185d9c3871c7a1ccb7a20b8eb7952d337a0e94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/28185d9c3871c7a1ccb7a20b8eb7952d337a0e94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/85cf4bf5e91aca05319a5dbd7a8b897a28c348d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 28185d9c3871c7a1ccb7a20b8eb7952d337a0e94\nparent 196524759ed733b50db7823411293d18b1e9ddb4\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784819617 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784819617 -0600\n\nfix(edge): headymcp.com restored to the live origin — governed router replaces hijacked proxy\n\nDiscovered during the redeploy: the live headymcp.com worker (script\nheadymcp-com) was a reverse proxy to an external host — one of 23 per-domain\nworkers overwritten 2026-07-06 (founder-attributed to a tool run, not an\nexternal breach). The repo''s governed router was itself stale (dead us-east1\norigin + dead Colab-compiler webhook + KV-hologram cruft), so a blind redeploy\nwould have swapped one broken state for another.\n\n- Rewrote cloudflare/worker-heady-router as a clean transparent edge proxy:\n  origin is env-derived (HEADY_ORIGIN, AGENTS.md #4 — fail-closed 502/503 when\n  unset/unreachable), MCP passthrough tag for headymcp, redirect-Location\n  rewrite, hop-by-hop header stripping. Removed the dead Colab/KV path\n  (AGENTS.md: no dead-end integrations).\n- Live origin located by probing: heady-manager-609590223909.us-central1\n  (heady-mcp-bridge v2.0.0) serves the MCP surface at /sse (text/event-stream)\n  + /health; the router''s old us-east1 target is dead.\n- Deployed to the headymcp-com script in place (route headymcp.com/* preserved),\n  HEADY_ORIGIN bound to the live origin.\n\nVERIFIED: headymcp.com/health → 200 (heady-mcp-bridge), headymcp.com/sse → 200\ntext/event-stream via x-heady-origin=us-central1, root no longer serves the\nexternal proxy''s challenge page.\n\nScope: headymcp only (the request). The other 22 hijacked scripts still proxy\nthe external host; each needs its OWN intended origin (headyme→portal, etc.) —\npointing them all at the MCP bridge would be wrong, so they are left for a\nper-domain follow-up. Forensics + full list in session-local incident record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamIvoQAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHEIWAP9u900CVpcKbb3gk9k3XeSlFt5VUUuRgxO3A9W6jfHcqgD/bk3ydky3BwCg\nLbrhAdrtHaPEYqKeEdN2wzAF4huRsgA=\n=FRs7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","followin