on/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/196524759ed733b50db7823411293d18b1e9ddb4","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDE5NjUyNDc1OWVkNzMzYjUwZGI3ODIzNDExMjkzZDE4YjFlOWRkYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/bc30e5106118ebc423e45f0d20b72ee0e75ef6cf","sha":"bc30e5106118ebc423e45f0d20b72ee0e75ef6cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/bc30e5106118ebc423e45f0d20b72ee0e75ef6cf"}],"sha":"196524759ed733b50db7823411293d18b1e9ddb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/196524759ed733b50db7823411293d18b1e9ddb4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/bc30e5106118ebc423e45f0d20b72ee0e75ef6cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T14:33:41Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T14:33:41Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"fix(secrets,embed): rotation CLI positional bug + vault-access de-fork — first real corpus embed\n\nTwo defects found while landing the founder-approved CF credential, both fixed\nwith regression coverage; the rotation then completed and the corpus embedded.\n\n- packages/secrets CLI: `rotate --project heady-ai` read the flag''s VALUE as\n  the quarantine file (ENOENT ''heady-ai'') — argv.find skipped flags but not\n  their value tokens. New exported positionalArg() consumes value-flag pairs\n  (--project/--source/--require); regression test covers the exact failing\n  invocation. Dry-run proven before any live use.\n- tooling/embed-corpus: its private fetchCloudflareSecrets used the\n  @google-cloud/secret-manager SDK (needs ADC) while the canonical\n  @heady/secrets path shells the gcloud CLI (auth the founder actually has) —\n  a silent vault-access fork that reported \"no embedder binding\" with a live\n  credential in the vault. De-forked: loadSecrets({source:\"auto\"}) — gcloud\n  CLI → env fallback, correct on Cloud Run too; drops the package''s only\n  external dependency.\n\nCredential state: scoped token heady-rebuilt-… minted by the founder, rolled\nafter a shred-on-abort, vault CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN → version 3, vault→\nloadSecrets→Bearer chain proven ACTIVE (the exact console-probe path).\n\nFIRST REAL CORPUS EMBED (payoff of both legs): 690 gate-passed files embedded\nvia Workers AI — all dim-384, locked @cf/baai/bge-small-en-v1.5@v1 (ADR-0015),\nwritten to .data/vector-memory. Idempotency proven: immediate re-run plans 0\njobs (690 ledger dedup hits). Merkle trigger showed incremental precision\nbetween runs (688 unchanged / 2 changed — exactly the files edited).\n\nGates: all green · secrets 11/11 · embed-corpus 8/8 · coherence 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e751ee33c033fe1f41b54870d027f512b8264ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/9e751ee33c033fe1f41b54870d027f512b8264ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/bc30e5106118ebc423e45f0d20b72ee0e75ef6cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e751ee33c033fe1f41b54870d027f512b8264ae\nparent 5f609e897824245069ec052f29faa3c8230bfd91\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784817221 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784817221 -0600\n\nfix(secrets,embed): rotation CLI positional bug + vault-access de-fork — first real corpus embed\n\nTwo defects found while landing the founder-approved CF credential, both fixed\nwith regression coverage; the rotation then completed and the corpus embedded.\n\n- packages/secrets CLI: `rotate --project heady-ai` read the flag''s VALUE as\n  the quarantine file (ENOENT ''heady-ai'') — argv.find skipped flags but not\n  their value tokens. New exported positionalArg() consumes value-flag pairs\n  (--project/--source/--require); regression test covers the exact failing\n  invocation. Dry-run proven before any live use.\n- tooling/embed-corpus: its private fetchCloudflareSecrets used the\n  @google-cloud/secret-manager SDK (needs ADC) while the canonical\n  @heady/secrets path shells the gcloud CLI (auth the founder actually has) —\n  a silent vault-access fork that reported \"no embedder binding\" with a live\n  credential in the vault. De-forked: loadSecrets({source:\"auto\"}) — gcloud\n  CLI → env fallback, correct on Cloud Run too; drops the package''s only\n  external dependency.\n\nCredential state: scoped token heady-rebuilt-… minted by the founder, rolled\nafter a shred-on-abort, vault CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN → version 3, vault→\nloadSecrets→Bearer chain proven ACTIVE (the exact console-probe path).\n\nFIRST REAL CORPUS EMBED (payoff of both legs): 690 gate-passed files embedded\nvia Workers AI — all dim-384, locked @cf/baai/bge-small-en-v1.5@v1 (ADR-0015),\nwritten to .data/vector-memory. Idempotency proven: immediate re-run plans 0\njobs (690 ledger dedup hits). Merkle trigger showed incremental precision\nbetween runs (688 unchanged / 2 changed — exactly the files edited).\n\nGates: all green · secrets 11/11 · embed-corpus 8/8 · coherence 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamImRQAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHCL1AQDnovdb5wKH992CnFlqw21icwgjW82Ti6G9uLUIqWZECAD/S1BRdyP/aKZc\nhUhTUxXNrpEnd227UUBZCLEEj/SAlgY=\n=68Sv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","rece