ses: violations\n  still block; wrong-token, ESM-waiver, and beyond-window attempts all refused.\n  Recorded in configs/laws.json known_defects as resolved.\n\n- Law #11 merkle-trigger: the CDC \"contradiction\" was already RESOLVED by\n  ADR-0023 §Reconciliation v2 + compendium R11 (two triggers, two sources) —\n  the law layer just never absorbed it. AGENTS.md #11 gains the scope sentence\n  (file/source indexing = Merkle; DB→derived-store sync = WAL CDC per\n  ADR-0014); laws.json statement + note cite the resolution. Stays advisory\n  pending the heady-merkle-index build — the enforcement trigger is named.\n\nGates: coherence 0 contradictions · law-lint clean · facts.v1 conformant ·\ncoherence tests 21/21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2cd7e2330314414267345bb8d5384d705c042d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/2cd7e2330314414267345bb8d5384d705c042d0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/c5d60cd9cfca2f3dd2c90fb35abd8c51f02fd5fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 2cd7e2330314414267345bb8d5384d705c042d0e\nparent 606315d9e28ed5b197220e044b540742dbca5f63\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784815042 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784815042 -0600\n\nfeat(laws): founder-approved closures — hook waiver contract + law-11 scoping\n\nTwo human-gated items from the enforcement-backlog run, both approved:\n\n- Hook v1.2.0 (.claude/hooks/heady-rules.mjs): the write-time gate now scans\n  line-by-line and honors exactly the per-line heady-allow waivers the gate\n  scripts honor — glass-box (family|ruleId), no-localhost (family token only),\n  ESM/brand none — tested against the enforcers'' trimmed 200-char evidence\n  window. Closes the second half of the policy fork (sanctioned waivers were\n  unauthorable through Edit/Write). Proven with 8 payload cases: violations\n  still block; wrong-token, ESM-waiver, and beyond-window attempts 