@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:23:21Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(laws): enforcement backlog — 4 advisory laws now machine-enforced\n\nThe invariant-substrate tail from step 6: every feasible advisory law gains\na real fail-closed enforcer (configs/laws.json tiers flipped honestly).\n\n- #5 zod-validation → tooling/enforcers/zod-boundary.mjs: any apps/packages\n  source reading req.body / request.json() must import its validator from\n  @heady/contracts (or zod, post-ADR-0002 codegen). EnqueueTask''s shape moves\n  to @heady/contracts (src/task-shapes.mjs, strict dependency-free idiom) with\n  a LOCK-STEP test against the live OpenAPI schema; heady-manager tasks.mjs\n  delegates (single shape authority, ADR-0025 non-orphanage). First live catch:\n  consistency-bus express middleware — sanctioned schema-less-by-design waivers.\n- #8 phi-constants → tooling/enforcers/phi-timing.mjs: no bare numeric ms\n  literal as a setTimeout/setInterval delay in substrate sources (narrow\n  honest slice; broader magic numbers stay review-enforced).\n- #9 tests-alongside → coherence TEST-missing (error) for every packages/ +\n  tooling/ member; apps surface as TEST-missing-app INFO debt. Enabled by NEW\n  real tests: skeleton-guard verify-placement (live-manifest conformance),\n  auto-flow preflight (live-catalog φ-ternary gate), doc-hydrator template\n  core — hydrate.mjs v1.1.0 refactored to pure exports + argv guard (importing\n  it no longer executes the hydrator) + structured log lines.\n- no-frontend-framework → coherence C-framework: fails on any vue/@vue/\n  angular/@angular dependency in any workspace manifest.\n\nWiring: /heady-handoff verify table gains zod-boundary + phi-timing gates;\ncoherence gains the pure packages-law module (9 new unit tests); variable\nregistry regenerated; lockfile reconciled (manager→contracts dep, sdk removal).\n\nStill advisory (honest): #7 redis-namespace (no cache client wired yet),\n#11 merkle-trigger (in tension with REBUILD_PLAN_V2 §3 WAL→projector CDC —\nfounder decision required before enforcement).\n\nGates: 9/9 green · turbo 79/79 · 106 tests on touched packages, 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48f76d9ce3217f74ffe1ba7cd4c884d09a5c8119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/48f76d9ce3217f74ffe1ba7cd4c884d09a5c8119"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/4c8833db4635377dd821533f19ca53ce893e4339","verification":{"payload":"tree 48f76d9ce3217f74ffe1ba7cd4c884d09a5c8119\nparent ce4aa9ef5354d4fc8cd5ee810d373dead110af40\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784805801 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784805801 -0600\n\nfeat(laws): enforcement backlog — 4 advisory laws now machine-enforced\n\nThe invariant-substrate tail from step 6: every feasible advisory law gains\na real fail-closed enforcer (configs/laws.json tiers flipped honestly).\n\n- #5 zod-validation → tooling/enforcers/zod-boundary.mjs: any apps/packages\n  source reading req.body / request.json() must import its validator from\n  @heady/contracts (or zod, post-ADR-0002 codegen). EnqueueTask''s shape moves\n  to @heady/contracts (src/task-shapes.mjs, strict dependency-free idiom) with\n  a LOCK-STEP test against the live OpenAPI schema; heady-manager tasks.mjs\n  delegates (single shape authority, ADR-0025 non-orphanage). First live catch:\n  consistency-bus express middleware — sanctioned schema-less-by-design waivers.\n- #8 phi-constants → tooling/enforcers/phi-timing.mjs: no bare numeric ms\n  literal as a setTimeout/setInterval delay in substrate sources (narrow\n  honest slice; broader magic numbers stay review-enforced).\n- #9 tests-alongside → coherence TEST-missing (error) for every packages/ +\n  tooling/ member; apps surface as TEST-missing-app INFO debt. Enabled by NEW\n  real tests: skeleton-guard verify-placement (live-manifest conformance),\n  auto-flow preflight (live-catalog φ-ternary gate), doc-hydrator template\n  core — hydrate.mjs v1.1.0 refactored to pure exports + argv guard (importing\n  it no longer executes the hydrator) + structured log lines.\n- no-frontend-framework → coherence C-framework: fails on any vue/@vue/\n  angular/@angular dependency in any workspace manifest.\n\nWiring: /heady-handoff verify table gains zod-boundary + phi-timing gates;\ncoherence gains the pure packages-law module (9 new unit tests); variable\nregistry regenerated; lockfile reconciled (manager→contracts dep, sdk removal).\n\nStill advisory (honest): #7 redis-namespace (no cache client wired yet),\n#11 merkle-trigger (in tension with REBUILD_PLAN_V2 §3 WAL→projector CDC —\nfounder decision required before enforcement).\n\nGates: 9/9 green · turbo 79/79 · 106 tests on touched packages, 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamH5qQAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHGRxAQD7BprQkIbfLSRTWTMqYax+/MCEZivS5SUP23XZcXAckAD/TsHK5A5pBQ/Q\nxgGuPUPKyBKN7fWNGzHHssE48W7dpQs=\n=v18Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.g