h-redis healthy (308ms);\nvectorize token_expired (HTTP 401) — the console MEASURED the known\nrotten CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN that has been blocking the headymcp\nredeploy, surfacing it as a living amber cell.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed427480c1e4b74009e0023ceb088803c8301bde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/ed427480c1e4b74009e0023ceb088803c8301bde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/ff3f189b22dbd5fff1406ebd977f335650d78ed7","verification":{"payload":"tree ed427480c1e4b74009e0023ceb088803c8301bde\nparent f080c15298bdd5018870d22fa490b903c619ade1\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784792627 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784792627 -0600\n\nfeat(console): vault probe kind — the live token lifecycle (§8 phase 1)\n\ntoken_expired is now a MEASURED state, not a theoretical one:\n- probe.kind \"vault\": secrets resolved once via a composition-root\n  resolver (index.mjs wires @heady/secrets loadSecrets{only}; tests/dev\n  without a resolver report not_connected — the DbPort rule), then an\n  authenticated ping. 2xx = healthy · 401/403 = token_expired (lights\n  the honeycomb''s amber Re-authorize cell) · else degraded/unreachable.\n- Contract: vault probes REQUIRE a ping (a credential''s existence proves\n  nothing); exactly one of url|urlSecret; secret hygiene enforced — no\n  vault URL or token value ever reaches a detail string (an Upstash\n  instance host is itself sensitive).\n- Registry: upstash-redis (REST /ping) + vectorize (Cloudflare token\n  verify) go live; google-drive stays honestly not_connected pending\n  the OAuth dance.\n\nLive sweep against the real vault: upstash-redis healthy (308ms);\nvectorize token_expired (HTTP 401) — the console MEASURED the known\nrotten CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN that has been blocking the headymcp\nredeploy, surfacing it as a living amber cell.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude 