 amber token_expired, red\n  unreachable, muted not_connected/connecting/empty.\n- Canvas:drawer ≈ φ:1; drawer shows machine values in JetBrains Mono +\n  the expected-vs-measured truth note (anti-masquerade surface);\n  deploy-class cells carry the ⚠ confused-deputy flag.\n- token_expired renders one-tap Re-authorize dispatching the\n  `heady-reauthorize` CustomEvent — the OAuth-lifecycle integration\n  point, never a dead end. Per-session Enable/Disable via\n  sessionStorage.\n- Pure render logic extracted to console-logic.mjs (6 node tests);\n  portal gains a turbo-registered test script (workspace now 76 tasks).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4729a806e6e4d5fc85ba89f4322d9921c6289a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/e4729a806e6e4d5fc85ba89f4322d9921c6289a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/f080c15298bdd5018870d22fa490b903c619ade1","verification":{"payload":"tree e4729a806e6e4d5fc85ba89f4322d9921c6289a1\nparent fb99b4e8417e3184e365f2ea299024371efbd01f\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784792198 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784792198 -0600\n\nfeat(portal): §8 living honeycomb — <heady-console-honeycomb> in the AdminUI\n\nThe Console front-end over the probe service''s measured truth:\n- One HexCell per connector (CSS clip-path, 5-wide offset rows): initial\n  state from GET /api/console/summary, live patches from the SSE fabric\n  (console.connector.state), full refresh on stream reconnect — never\n  stale-as-fresh; fetch failure renders an honest global-error banner.\n- State SIGNALS per design-tokens color.state: teal healthy (φ-heartbeat\n  pulse, 2.9034s, suppressed under prefers-reduced-motion), violet\n  degraded, violet-ghost projection_only, amber token_expired, red\n  unreachable, muted not_connected/connecting/empty.\n- Canvas:drawer ≈ φ:1; drawer shows machine values in JetBrains Mono +\n  the expected-vs-measured truth note (anti-masquerade surface);\n  deploy-class cells carry the ⚠ confused-deputy flag.\n- token_expired renders one-tap Re-authorize dispatching the\n  `heady-reauthorize` CustomEvent — the OAuth-lifecycle integration\n  point, never a dead end. Per-session Enable/Disable via\n  sessionStorage.\n- Pure render logic extracted to console-logic.mjs (6 node tests);\n  portal gains a turbo-registered test script (workspace now 76 tasks).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamHEhgAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHG7KAQC4bCjekrtaAGCyTDkwFEJ/h7roJKyJ14Agos2XBUXLQwEApc+M/DU9w3U8\n1uhzsxdr+GIN1ussSjFeIokJ4/97KA8=\n=7i5u\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/f080c15298bdd5018870d22fa490b903c619ade1","node_id":"C_k