cal (REBUILD_PLAN_V2 §8):\n- @heady/contracts mcp-shapes: STRICT shared contract for Connector,\n  ConnectorRegistry, ServerManifest (projection_only + Provenance — the\n  anti-masquerade contract), ConsoleSummary + the §8 state model with\n  token_expired/projection_only first-class.\n- configs/connectors.json: 15 connectors (10 heady + 5 infra) grounded\n  in the facts.yaml domain canon; Qdrant absent by design (dropped\n  store); probe:null = honest not_connected, never faked.\n- heady-manager console service: kernel-managed probes on HEARTBEAT_MS\n  (φ⁷×1000 = 29034ms), φ²-derived probe timeout, measured states\n  (healthy/degraded-gated/unreachable/projection_only via manifest),\n  state-transition events on the SSE bus, GET /api/console/summary.\n- Boots last (kernel deps: http, tasks) so the first sweep sees live\n  services; kernel probes read each service''s FULL health object —\n  a disabled tasks service reports neon as not_connected, never the\n  flattened fake-healthy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84198a2dce1f091739a44bd7135dd5150b21a113","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/84198a2dce1f091739a44bd7135dd5150b21a113"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/fb99b4e8417e3184e365f2ea299024371efbd01f","verification":{"payload":"tree 84198a2dce1f091739a44bd7135dd5150b21a113\nparent 764d2688dc02fb7c1d7b8458e73f038568e7a57f\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784790189 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784790189 -0600\n\nfeat(console): §8 connector registry + φ⁷ heartbeat probe service + summary API\n\nThe Console spearhead''s backend vertical (REBUILD_PLAN_V2 §8):\n- @heady/contracts mcp-shapes: STRICT shared contract for Connector,\n  ConnectorRegistry, ServerManifest (projection_only + Provenance — the\n  anti-masquerade contract), ConsoleSummary + the §8 state model with\n  token_expired/projection_only first-class.\n- configs/connectors.json: 15 connectors (10 heady + 5 infra) grounded\n  in the facts.yaml domain canon; Qdrant absent by design (dropped\n  store); probe:null = honest not_connected, never faked.\n- heady-manager console service: kernel-managed probes on HEARTBEAT_MS\n  (φ⁷×1000 = 29034ms), φ²-derived probe timeout, measured states\n  (healthy/degraded-gated/unreachable/projection_only via manifest),\n  state-transition events on the SSE bus, GET /api/console/summary.\n- Boots last (kernel deps: http, tasks) so the first sweep sees live\n  services; kernel probes read each service''s FULL health object —\n  a disabled tasks service reports neon as not_connected, never the\n  flattened fake-healthy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamG8rQAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHM5+AQDwWQmXhF5coWmbEw9X0EjGIhVvTm+3VkJ/ce0H95nTtAEApmetAsWDH77J\n8RjqjzwgWR1oMu+ShalSK4hFlALShwo=\n=VcE8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co