,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:03:09Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"fix(consistency-bus): egress rewrites only exact multi-segment linked paths\n\nFound live by the Console: egressNormalize rewrote the summary''s\nschema:\"console-summary.v1\" to the golden record''s \"facts.v1\" — any\npayload key colliding with a single-segment fact name (schema, auth,\nsecrets, event_bus…) was silently corrupted on the way out. Rewrites now\nrequire an exact multi-segment byName match; ingress keeps single-segment\nrecognition (blocking is loud and has the authorized-header channel;\nsilent egress corruption has no escape).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bca56ec2a2d994e2bce5cbb6894d33d40eb8410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/4bca56ec2a2d994e2bce5cbb6894d33d40eb8410"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/764d2688dc02fb7c1d7b8458e73f038568e7a57f","verification":{"payload":"tree 4bca56ec2a2d994e2bce5cbb6894d33d40eb8410\nparent bddc590422dcea9aef3eeac52423e79f70976234\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784790189 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784790189 -0600\n\nfix(consistency-bus): egress rewrites only exact multi-segment linked paths\n\nFound live by the Console: egressNormalize rewrote the summary''s\nschema:\"console-summary.v1\" to the golden record''s \"facts.v1\" — any\npayload key colliding with a single-segment fact name (schema, auth,\nsecrets, event_bus…) was silently corrupted on the way out. Rewrites now\nrequire an exact multi-segment byName match; ingress keeps single-segment\nrecognition (blocking is loud and has the authorized-header channel;\nsilent egress corruption has no escape).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQUL