venance/ = output of the G99 stale-tree remediation\n  (archive-g99.mjs); DX-13-config-sprawl-secrets.tar.gz contains LIVE\n  private keys (nginx ca/client/server .key + private-key blocks,\n  confirmed by the canonical secret-scan) → /_archive/ is now gitignored\n  so it can never reach a remote; the archiver script joined its output.\n- backend/, src/mcp-server/ (stubs) and packages/phi-math-foundation/\n  (duplicate of @heady/phi-math) → moved to _archive/legacy-stubs/.\n- scratch/ gitignored (throwaway session helpers).\n- apps/headyme-portal/dist/index.html restored to HEAD (derived build\n  artifact referencing an untracked asset — regenerates on build).\nNote: _archive/legacy-src-services/neon-db.js remains tracked from the\nGATE-2 archive commit (credential-free code); the ignore rule only\nblocks new additions, which is the intent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b6982fda4c4aa575db125394496343cc1d10423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/2b6982fda4c4aa575db125394496343cc1d10423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/779df696999a10333f815c0af0589d2e9bc5f1ca","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b6982fda4c4aa575db125394496343cc1d10423\nparent a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786606 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786606 -0600\n\nchore(disposition): quarantine local-only archive + scratch from sync surface\n\nDisposition pass on the six unknown-provenance untracked items (pre-push):\n- _archive/provenance/ = output of the G99 stale-tree remediation\n  (archive-g99.mjs); DX-13-config-sprawl-secrets.tar.gz contains LIVE\n  private keys (nginx ca/client/server .key + private-key blocks,\n  confirmed by the canonical secret-scan) → /_archive/ is now gitignored\n  so it can never reach a remote; the archiver script joined its output.\n- backend/, src/mcp-server/ (stubs) and packages/phi-math-foundation/\n  (duplicate of @heady/phi-math) → moved to _archive/legacy-stubs/.\n- scratch/ gitignored (throwaway session helpers).\n- apps/headyme-portal/dist/index.html restored to HEAD (derived build\n  artifact referencing an untracked asset — regenerates on build).\nNote: _archive/legacy-src-services/neon-db.js remains tracked from the\nGATE-2 archive commit (credential-free code); the ignore rule only\nblocks new additions, which is the intent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamGurgAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHMTwAQDLzXULQf0cHG+YamkZFnrDYHABwqj2t6EYoqrfQmXXzQD/aVV8v/TloqU1\njM4o4yRYdKjyLp49TqSUEAZjMaBFmws=\n=2aeJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/779df696999a10333f815c0af0589d2e9bc5f1ca","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDc3OWRmNjk2OTk5YTEwMzMzZjgxNWMwYWYwNTg5ZDJlOWJjNWYxY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3","sha":"a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3"}],"sha":"779df696999a10333f815c0af0589d2e9bc5f1ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/779df696999a10333f815c0af0589d2e9bc5f1ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:56:21Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:56:21Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(manager): GATE-2 — live tasks write path with end-to-end trace visibility\n\n- tasks service (apps/heady-manager/src/tasks.mjs): kernel-managed,\n  realizes the OpenAPI contract (enqueueTask/getTask) over DbPort +\n  @heady/task-ledger; POST /tasks lands task + outbox in ONE Neon tx;\n  strict contract validation at the boundary.\n- Trace chain proven at every hop: X-Heady-Trace-Id header → pino async\n  context → span-exporter tag → SSE task.created payload → echoed reply.\n- Composition-root rule: createApp without tasks.getDbPort boots the\n  service DISABLED (health ok, routes 503) so tests/dev never implicitly\n  touch a live DB; only src/index.mjs injects the vault resolver.\n- Sentry exporter (packages/observability/src/sentry-exporter.mjs):\n  dependency-free envelope-API adapter (span→transaction, error→event,\n  headyTraceId tag verbatim + 32-hex normalize, fire-and-forget,\n  bounded); cred-gated via SENTRY_DSN env. Langfuse pending (no vault\n  keys — flagged, not faked).\n- GATE-2 integration test against the Neon COW branch: HTTP POST → 201\n  → durable GET → create→complete → SUCCEEDED + result → 3 outbox\n  topics → health ok; skips without HEADY_TEST_DATABASE_URL.\n- Post-GATE-2 orders: legacy src/services/neon-db.js archived to\n  _archive/legacy-src-services/ (all importers legacy + try-guarded);\n  colab/ quarantine enforced via the QUAR-colab gate (see invariants\n  commit).\n\nDisclosure: pnpm-lock.yaml includes inherited dependency-bump hunks\nentangled with the session''s workspace edges (see chore(inherited)).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fc2ba6835e580398675b0d4c19408292164312b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/8fc2ba6835e580398675b0d4c19408292164312b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3","verification":{"payload":"tree 8fc2ba6835e580398675b0d4c19408292164312b\nparent 35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786181 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786181 -0600\n\nfeat(manager): GATE-2 — live tasks write path with end-to-end trace visibility\n\n- tasks service (apps/heady-manager/src/tasks.mjs): kernel-managed,\n  realizes the OpenAPI contract (enqueueTask/getTask) over DbPort +\n  @heady/task-ledger; POST /tasks lands task + outbox in ONE Neon tx;\n  strict contract validation at the boundary.\n- Trace chain proven at every hop: X-Heady-Trace-Id header → pino async\n  context → span-exporter tag → SSE task.created payload → echoed reply.\n- Composition-root rule: createApp without tasks.getDbPort boots the\n  service DISABLED (health ok, routes 503) so tests/dev never implicitly\n  touch a live DB; only src/index.mjs injects the vault resolver.\n- Sentry exporter (packages/observability/src/sentry-exporter.mjs):\n  dependency-free envelope-API adapter (span→transaction, error→event,\n  headyTraceId tag verbatim + 32-hex normalize, fire-and-forget,\n  bounded); cred-gated via SENTRY_DSN env. Langfuse pending (no vault\n  keys — flagged, not faked).\n- GATE-2 integration test against the Neon COW branch: HTTP POST → 201\n  → durable GET → create→complete → SUCCEEDED + result → 3 outbox\n  topics → health ok; skips without HEADY_TEST_DATABASE_URL.\n- Post-GATE-2 orders: legacy src/services/neon-db.js archived to\n  _archive/legacy-src-services/ (all importers legacy + try-guarded);\n  colab/ quarantine enforced via the QUAR-colab gate (see invariants\n  commit).\n\nDisclosure: pnpm-lock.yaml includes inherited dependency-bump hunks\nentangled with the session''s workspace edges (see chore(inherited)).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamGtBQAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHPB+AP9m+MH/aRBm9Xx4K70bRn8Vp6QEXtNCvNIQzKaNFyt9dwD+IAITUVWARe5t\nZ37rIazGms3AUF2JFBDc+OAIH09M4QA=\n=Vy2Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKGE1NGJkOGQzOGNiMjUwZmU1OTA0MTkzZWVlMmNiMDU3ZjRhNWJmYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29","sha":"35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29"}],"sha":"a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/a54bd8d38cb250fe5904193eee2cb057f4a5bfc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:56:03Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:56:03Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(db): GATE-1 — forward-only migration runner, plan/apply rail, DbPort, real-tx\n\n- src/migrate.mjs: pure injected-executor runner; one migrations home\n  (packages/db/migrations), checksum journal (schema_migrations) written\n  in the SAME tx as each migration, fail-closed drift (edited-after-apply\n  or applied-but-missing halts), halt-on-first-failure with rollback.\n- bin/migrate.mjs: DATABASE_URL via @heady/secrets loadSecrets; SAFETY\n  RAIL — plan-only (read-only) by default, mutation requires --apply\n  (added after an unintended additive apply hit the root endpoint; the\n  rail makes accidental mutation impossible). Root scripts db:migrate /\n  db:migrate:apply; broken legacy consistency:migrate retired.\n- migrations/0002_legacy_capture.sql: faithful additive capture of the\n  pre-existing March-2026 tables from live introspection on the\n  rebuild-gate1 COW branch (latent_os_memory vector(1536) = legacy dim,\n  flagged; buddy_messages vector(384) conformant).\n- src/port.mjs: live DbPort (pg 8.22.0 explicit); tx(fn) hands a\n  pg-shaped client inside BEGIN/COMMIT/ROLLBACK — the ledger tx contract.\n- task-ledger real-tx integration test: full lifecycle durable on the\n  Neon COW branch (skips without HEADY_TEST_DATABASE_URL). GATE 1 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d4fcc602d47a35bc934852718a060261021460c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/9d4fcc602d47a35bc934852718a060261021460c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d4fcc602d47a35bc934852718a060261021460c\nparent 7dfffa9fcf71dcedc31878720b87f0b81689f236\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786163 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786163 -0600\n\nfeat(db): GATE-1 — forward-only migration runner, plan/apply rail, DbPort, real-tx\n\n- src/migrate.mjs: pure injected-executor runner; one migrations home\n  (packages/db/migrations), checksum journal (schema_migrations) written\n  in the SAME tx as each migration, fail-closed drift (edited-after-apply\n  or applied-but-missing halts), halt-on-first-failure with rollback.\n- bin/migrate.mjs: DATABASE_URL via @heady/secrets loadSecrets; SAFETY\n  RAIL — plan-only (read-only) by default, mutation requires --apply\n  (added after an unintended additive apply hit the root endpoint; the\n  rail makes accidental mutation impossible). Root scripts db:migrate /\n  db:migrate:apply; broken legacy consistency:migrate retired.\n- migrations/0002_legacy_capture.sql: faithful additive capture of the\n  pre-existing March-2026 tables from live introspection on the\n  rebuild-gate1 COW branch (latent_os_memory vector(1536) = legacy dim,\n  flagged; buddy_messages vector(384) conformant).\n- src/port.mjs: live DbPort (pg 8.22.0 explicit); tx(fn) hands a\n  pg-shaped client inside BEGIN/COMMIT/ROLLBACK — the ledger tx contract.\n- task-ledger real-tx integration test: full lifecycle durable on the\n  Neon COW branch (skips without HEADY_TEST_DATABASE_URL). GATE 1 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamGs8wAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHNCzAQC8WZ5byY215SxkjRd9OHDyZnDZXtjs+ZdEJCp4ZfVUmgD/RHE5Qw+QAEB4\nkif1hjz5uylCN3hO2ZmogdvNhpbP2gs=\n=vtKg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDM1ZTFlOTVmNmQ5Njc4MzU5N2ZkMTA2NjAyMGQ3ZjQwZmM3YmJmMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/7dfffa9fcf71dcedc31878720b87f0b81689f236","sha":"7dfffa9fcf71dcedc31878720b87f0b81689f236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/7dfffa9fcf71dcedc31878720b87f0b81689f236"}],"sha":"35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/35e1e95f6d96783597fd1066020d7f40fc7bbf29"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/7dfffa9fcf71dcedc31878720b87f0b81689f236/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:56:03Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:56:03Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"fix(consistency-bus): fail-open in prod — fall back to committed facts.yaml floor\n\nloadLinkIndex read only the generated .data/coherence/variable-registry.json,\nwhich is gitignored and absent in a fresh deploy — the express middleware\ndegraded to passthrough and the locked-value BLOCK was a silent no-op in\nproduction. The index now falls back to the committed golden record\n(@heady/config.loadFacts, every fact leaf a LOCKED entry) so runtime\nenforcement stays live; `source` is reported for observability. Proven:\nBLOCK on drifted locked values, ALLOW on canonical/unknown/authorized.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c92cd00b0a5294ce12f0ccb2da4f129d7e48c695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/c92cd00b0a5294ce12f0ccb2da4f129d7e48c695"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/7dfffa9fcf71dcedc31878720b87f0b81689f236","verification":{"payload":"tree c92cd00b0a5294ce12f0ccb2da4f129d7e48c695\nparent f66707188173262ec4fb62179366eef41f5dcf21\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786163 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786163 -0600\n\nfix(consistency-bus): fail-open in prod — fall back to committed facts.yaml floor\n\nloadLinkIndex read only the generated .data/coherence/variable-registry.json,\nwhich is gitignored and absent in a fresh deploy — the express middleware\ndegraded to passthrough and the locked-value BLOCK was a silent no-op in\nproduction. The index now falls back to the committed golden record\n(@heady/config.loadFacts, every fact leaf a LOCKED entry) so runtime\nenforcement stays live; `source` is reported for observability. Proven:\nBLOCK on drifted locked values, ALLOW on canonical/unknown/authorized.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamGs8wAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHIeYAQCkkGFxn9FBdTkX5iK9zYq3MliEm6Cca3HIgMcDLlHsxwEA9QvaKlgVUHdm\nXupxSLZmBeJ/pRMsRkWki00yZo97UQE=\n=AMVd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConn