dyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/f66707188173262ec4fb62179366eef41f5dcf21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:55:40Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T05:55:40Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(invariants): facts.v1 keystone + stage0 untouchables + law registry + gates\n\nThe enforced invariant substrate (rebuild steps 3-6):\n- facts.v1: canonical golden-record schema in @heady/contracts\n  (validateFactsV1 — value-locked architectural decisions, type-checked\n  counters); @heady/config.validateFacts delegates to it (single\n  authority); standalone fail-closed gate `npm run facts:validate`;\n  turbo globalDependencies += facts.yaml (closes the cache-skip hole).\n- Stage 0 (STEPWISE §0.8 / ADR-0016): configs/stage0-untouchables.json\n  path-glob SoT, CODEOWNERS-locked, enforced live by new STAGE0-* checks\n  in the coherence kernel (resolve + codeowner-covered + self-included).\n- Law registry: configs/laws.json maps every AGENTS.md law to its\n  enforcer with honest tier/moment; coherence LAW-* checks prove\n  membership + downgrade-ratchet + contiguous rule coverage; 6 of 11\n  laws surfaced as advisory (no enforcer) rather than faked.\n- Rule-gate hook v1.1.0 de-forked: sources canonical GLASSBOX/LOCALHOST\n  rules (console.*/XXX/0.0.0.0/::1 now blocked at write-time).\n- colab/ quarantine: QUAR-colab coherence check (rebuild imports of\n  colab/ fail the gate) + laws.json colab-quarantine entry.\n- tooling/coherence is now a tested workspace package (@heady/coherence).\n- scaffold-plan p0.stage0 corrected from fictional \"done\" to in-progress.\n\nDisclosure: root package.json/turbo.json include inherited hunks\n(dependency bumps, turbo reformat) entangled with these changes; see\nthe preceding chore(inherited) commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"917a124fe1fc8de3170f41a12fee5fec4e5f04b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/917a124fe1fc8de3170f41a12fee5fec4e5f04b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/f66707188173262ec4fb62179366eef41f5dcf21","verification":{"payload":"tree 917a124fe1fc8de3170f41a12fee5fec4e5f04b1\nparent 7e100b41563878a982fdc6218d464d7a1bd5c5a8\nauthor Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786140 -0600\ncommitter Eric Haywood <eric@headysystems.com> 1784786140 -0600\n\nfeat(invariants): facts.v1 keystone + stage0 untouchables + law registry + gates\n\nThe enforced invariant substrate (rebuild steps 3-6):\n- facts.v1: canonical golden-record schema in @heady/contracts\n  (validateFactsV1 — value-locked architectural decisions, type-checked\n  counters); @heady/config.validateFacts delegates to it (single\n  authority); standalone fail-closed gate `npm run facts:validate`;\n  turbo globalDependencies += facts.yaml (closes the cache-skip hole).\n- Stage 0 (STEPWISE §0.8 / ADR-0016): configs/stage0-untouchables.json\n  path-glob SoT, CODEOWNERS-locked, enforced live by new STAGE0-* checks\n  in the coherence kernel (resolve + codeowner-covered + self-included).\n- Law registry: configs/laws.json maps every AGENTS.md law to its\n  enforcer with honest tier/moment; coherence LAW-* checks prove\n  membership + downgrade-ratchet + contiguous rule coverage; 6 of 11\n  laws surfaced as advisory (no enforcer) rather than faked.\n- Rule-gate hook v1.1.0 de-forked: sources canonical GLASSBOX/LOCALHOST\n  rules (console.*/XXX/0.0.0.0/::1 now blocked at write-time).\n- colab/ quarantine: QUAR-colab coherence check (rebuild imports of\n  colab/ fail the gate) + laws.json colab-quarantine entry.\n- tooling/coherence is now a tested workspace package (@heady/coherence).\n- scaffold-plan p0.stage0 corrected from fictional \"done\" to in-progress.\n\nDisclosure: root package.json/turbo.json include inherited hunks\n(dependency bumps, turbo reformat) entangled with these changes; see\nthe preceding chore(inherited) commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unverified_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQQULWecpbEbCbd+V2n0hCLs8YQHAUCamGs3AAKCRCn0hCLs8YQ\nHAzvAP9NB7boOxHwFCEKvK9g8gtmWWd2uen5CSNQW8xLkqwzhAD+MRmGDUAGpEB1\nHA08UVlWj8jwIeIG+BLZaTongiNAUgA=\n=wRbF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady