ream;\n  LegacyUI off EventSource (couldn''t auth) onto it.\n- heady-portal-gateway CORS allowlist += https://1ime1.com,www.\n- Gate greening: governance SKIP_DIR += _archive (C2); coherence patent count 60+→51 in\n  CLAUDE.md + heady-commander-plugin/AGENTS.md (C1, ARBITER-ALLOW); 2 glass-box SW waivers (C4).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e217b43495c3bd3d0388d9b9032b6862e5f475e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/e217b43495c3bd3d0388d9b9032b6862e5f475e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/ffd1aadc338ae8cf9cffc958b31f278137adcf1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/ffd1aadc338ae8cf9cffc958b31f278137adcf1c","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKGZmZDFhYWRjMzM4YWU4Y2Y5Y2ZmYzk1OGIzMWYyNzgxMzdhZGNmMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://gi