/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/6537ed9388d4b184070ff86e66824d263b29ece0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:36:49Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:36:49Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"fix(gates): clear no-loopback + secret-scan enforcers — rewords, sanctioned waivers, install-script restructure\n\nHandoff gate table showed no-loopback ✗ / secret-scan ✗ / glass-box ✗. Triage:\n\n- secret-scan (9): all were envSecret NAME strings in src/auth/provider-registry.js\n  (GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET et al) — env-var names, never values; per-line\n  heady-allow waivers → 0 violations\n- no-loopback (17): prose reworded (app.mjs header, index.mjs log string);\n  sanctioned waivers where the literal is structural (Cloud Run all-interfaces\n  bind, the localhost-validator''s own regex, law prose in handoff/law-lint);\n  one-click-install.sh restructured (port/URL variables — also fixes a shell\n  continuation my first waiver pass broke; enforcer''s 200-char waiver window\n  respected) → 0 violations\n- glass-box: 8 platform-sink waivers (browser/SW register.js, Workers\n  edge-gatekeeper — console IS the sink there, payloads structured JSON);\n  the remaining 428 are legacy call-sites (vault-init, scripts, old src/) —\n  queued as a dedicated migration leg, NOT bulk-waived\n\nGates after: no-loopback 0 (15 waived) · secret-scan 0 (8 waived) ·\nlaw-lint clean · handoff 7/7 · heady-manager 11/11 · portal build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e4239fb38fe0d025d1a7adbdef36e1dad4d2bc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/5e4239fb38fe0d025d1a7adbdef36e1dad4d2bc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/6537ed9388d4b184070ff86e66824d263b29ece0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/6537ed9388d4b184070ff86e66824d263b29ece0","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKDY1MzdlZDkzODhkNGIxODQwNzBmZjg2ZTY2ODI0ZDI2M2IyOWVjZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b","sha":"b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b"}],"sha":"6537ed9388d4b184070ff86e66824d263b29ece0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/6537ed9388d4b184070ff86e66824d263b29ece0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:15:05Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:15:05Z","email":"eric@headysystems.com","name":"Eric Haywood"},"message":"feat(devices): installable realtime Heady — PWA, SSE fabric, sync-fabric, desktop shell\n\nAutopilot/omni-sync run 2026-07-05 (founder-approved matrix: PWA + native\ndesktop, SSE canon + WS device hub, sync-fabric port + hardened buddy wake,\nSW auto-update + release manifest):\n\n- PWA: headyme-portal now installable (manifest.webmanifest, maskable PNG\n  icons from canon SVG, apple metas); stamped service worker — /api/* and\n  SSE never intercepted, hashed assets cache-first, offline shell,\n  consent-based update toast (φ-timed, design tokens); firebase.json\n  headers (manifest type, sw no-cache, immutable assets)\n- SSE fabric: kernel-managed events service on the origin projects the\n  in-process bus to GET /api/events (FIB ring buffer, Last-Event-ID replay,\n  φ⁷ heartbeat, connection cap); portal goes live-push: ServiceNav health\n  dots update in place, <heady-live-status> tile strip on the admin home\n  (origin/bus/stream/freshness, honest degraded states)\n- @heady/sync-fabric: hardened port of the cross-device hub — WS /ws/sync,\n  SYNC_TOKEN required (fail-closed 503/401, timingSafeEqual), FIB caps\n  (233KB msg, 21 msg/s), heartbeat sweep, handoff sessions with resumable\n  context, debounced persistence, anonymized presence REST; 10/10 tests.\n  Legacy CrossDeviceSyncHub found silently dead in prod (TDZ throw caught\n  at boot) — deprecation pointer added, migration is a follow-up leg\n- Buddy wake: BuddyAgentHub wired into the legacy monolith with mandatory\n  guards (throws if mounted unguarded): 3 admin-guarded routes, 5 platform-\n  control routes requiring admin + SYNC_TOKEN; fail-open\n  buddy-authorization default recorded for its own hardening leg\n- Desktop: apps/heady-desktop Electron shell (contextIsolation/sandbox on,\n  https-only portal chain → 1ime1.com, auth-chain-scoped navigation,\n  branded offline page with φ-backoff, single CJS preload under a narrow\n  documented law-lint exemption — sandboxed preloads are CJS-only by\n  platform); facts.yaml-derived version/appId; live windowed smoke passed\n- Release contract: deploy workflow emits heady.release-manifest.v1\n  (sha256 of index/sw/manifest) + post-deploy PWA smoke tests; per-device\n  INSTALL_HEADY_ON_YOUR_DEVICES runbook; legacy INSTALLABLE_PACKAGES\n  marked superseded\n\nGates: turbo 74/74 test + 36/36 build, law-lint clean (+ its 6 tests),\ncoherence 0 contradictions. Founder-gated: SYNC_TOKEN + ADMIN_TOKEN to\nSecret Manager, Firebase deploy (makes installs live), signing/notarization.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76f3a3302b27c0511b24c88b5034760f1ee9f525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/trees/76f3a3302b27c0511b24c88b5034760f1ee9f525"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/git/commits/b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250789142?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HeadyConnection","id":250789142,"login":"HeadyConnection","node_id":"U_kgDODvK9Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HeadyConnection","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b","node_id":"C_kwDORkxJFNoAKGI1YjkzOTE2NGVjYzgwYWU4MmE5NjZhMTlhMGNiNDcwN2I0MWVkMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commit/2b3b169530860d23e4230ad47078110e43eb9922","sha":"2b3b169530860d23e4230ad47078110e43eb9922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/2b3b169530860d23e4230ad47078110e43eb9922"}],"sha":"b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits/b5b939164ecc80ae82a966a19a0cb4707b41ed2b"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeadySystems/Heady-AI/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=9d7e4b366265414322c11700e0933b54bbdc7786&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A16%3A39.621Z"}');
