public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/commits/f7b3c685cf743a0175f1e6397482ff45c7883d2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T18:47:37Z","email":"leonwuya@gmail.com","name":"Leon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T18:47:37Z","email":"leonwuya@gmail.com","name":"Leon"},"message":"feat: add SEO checker module\n\n- Add SeoReport and SeoCheck entities with one-to-many cascade\n- Add JsoupScraperService with 6 HTML checks (title, meta description, H1, headings hierarchy, images, internal links)\n- Add PageSpeedService integrating Google PageSpeed Insights API (performance score, SEO score, LCP, FCP, TBT)\n- Add SeoAnalysisService orchestrating Jsoup + PageSpeed, persisting reports atomically via CascadeType.ALL\n- Add SeoController: POST /{site_code}/seo/analyze, GET /{site_code}/seo/reports\n- Add SeoAnalysisException mapped to 503 in GlobalExceptionHandler\n- Checks are keyword-aware — title, meta description, and H1 validated against target keyword when provided\n- PageSpeed metrics stored as typed columns; full raw response preserved as JSONB for future use\n- Add Jsoup 1.22.1 dependency and pagespeed.api.key to application.properties","tree":{"sha":"2c63e7ac85703e8bb8977e08e45ad781272c759e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/git/trees/2c63e7ac85703e8bb8977e08e45ad781272c759e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/git/commits/f7b3c685cf743a0175f1e6397482ff45c7883d2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78392070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/gists{/gist_id}","gra