ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/commits/26e27b86fc258bbe2e92155a266a3dc6adf78ce9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T03:57:55Z","email":"leonwuya@gmail.com","name":"Leon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T03:57:55Z","email":"leonwuya@gmail.com","name":"Leon"},"message":"feat: add Site entity with multi-site tracking architecture\n\n- Add Site entity with auto-generated siteCode (UUID, unique, non-updatable)\n  as public tracking identifier for JS snippet initialization\n- Add SiteRepository with findByIdAndUser (ownership validation),\n  findBySiteCode (event ingest lookup), and findAllByUser (site selector)\n- Add SiteService with createSite() and getSites() scoped to current user\n- Add SiteController with POST /api/sites and GET /api/sites\n- Add CreateSiteRequest and SiteResponse DTOs\n- Scope all Campaign and Event data under Site as the security boundary\n- Update CampaignService.getSite() to validate site ownership via\n  findByIdAndUser, closing unauthorized site access vulnerability","tree":{"sha":"41c3cca0a8b94b556eb4dac00742fcff3c8f28b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/git/trees/41c3cca0a8b94b556eb4dac00742fcff3c8f28b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/git/commits/26e27b86fc258bbe2e92155a266a3dc6adf78ce9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78392070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeonWu813","id":783920