com/users/LeonWu813/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonWu813","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/commits/486356c5762dd066414ff9c8be39dafef22f9fe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T00:34:19Z","email":"leonwuya@gmail.com","name":"Leon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T00:34:19Z","email":"leonwuya@gmail.com","name":"Leon"},"message":"feat: implement auth, campaign CRUD, and site-scoped event tracking\n\nCampaign CRUD\n- Add Campaign entity with User and Site relationships, soft delete via isArchived\n- Add CampaignChannel and CampaignStatus enums stored as EnumType.STRING\n- Add CampaignRepository with ownership-scoped paginated queries\n- Add CampaignService with ownership validation on all mutating operations\n- Add CampaignController scoped to /api/{site_id}/campaigns\n- Add CreateCampaignRequest and UpdateCampaignRequest DTOs with validation\n- Add Site entity with auto-generated siteCode as public tracking identifier\n- Add SiteRepository with findByIdAndUser for ownership validation\n\nEvent Tracking\n- Add Event entity with site_id (required) and campaign_id (nullable)\n  foreign keys, JSONB metadata, UTM fields, and composite indexes\n- Add EventRepository with optional JPQL filter pattern scoped to site\n- Refactor User entity to remove circular Site dependency\n- Fix CampaignService.getSite() to validate site ownership against current user","tree":{"sha":"24ec7d2978ba11e75a43443fb246102b2f8d0f4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/git/trees/24ec7d2978ba11e75a43443fb246102b2f8d0f4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonWu813/marketing-analytics/git/commits/486356c5762dd066414ff9c8be39dafef22f9fe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78392070?v=4","events_url":