e7c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T16:48:07Z","email":"186486072+anhkhoi-cloudswe@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AK17-LeonSatoru"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T16:48:07Z","email":"186486072+anhkhoi-cloudswe@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AK17-LeonSatoru"},"message":"fix: timezone conversion and event tab filtering logic\n\nFIXES:\n- Fix +7 UTC timezone bug: Replace double timezone conversion (DBTimeToVietnamTime + NormalizeDBTimeAsUTC) with direct wall-clock formatting (FormatTimeToWallClockRFC3339)\n  - Locations: event_list_v1.go (2 functions), event_api_composition.go (multiple functions)\n  - Issue: 14:00 DB was being displayed as 21:00 (+7 offset incorrectly applied)\n  - Solution: Use FormatTimeToWallClockRFC3339 to format wall-clock time directly\n\n- Fix event tab overlapping: Replace DATE-based filtering with time-based filtering\n  - Changed from: DATE(start_time) = CURDATE()\n  - Changed to: start_time <= NOW() AND end_time >= NOW()\n  - Ensures mutual exclusivity: ''today'' shows only currently running events\n\n- Add frontend timezone-safe formatter: formatWallClockDateTimeWithDayOfWeek()\n  - Pure string extraction (no timezone interpretation)\n  - Safe Date object usage (UTC only for day-of-week calculation)\n  - Returns format: ''18/04/2026 • Thứ Năm • 14:00''\n\n- Update Dashboard.tsx to use safe formatter instead of new Date() parsing\n\nResult: All times now display correctly without +7 hour offset","tree":{"sha":"77813ada8614d7fe638c5909c9dab0b91d216e3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/trees/77813ada8614d7fe638c5909c9dab0b91d216e3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/commits/1213e0c57b310c164315297a63f25f3c6e5ee7c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu