ckend (gateway/main.go)\n- Removed backup files with old credentials\n- Replaced Bearer Authorization with credentials: ''include''\n- Configured HttpOnly cookies for secure authentication\n\nSecurity improvements:\n✅ No hardcoded credentials in code\n✅ No secrets in application logs\n✅ XSS-proof authentication via HttpOnly cookies\n✅ CSRF protection maintained\n✅ All authenticated requests use credentials: ''include''\n\nVerification:\n✅ 0 ''cookie-auth'' tokens remaining\n✅ 0 JWT secret logging\n✅ 0 insecure Bearer patterns\n✅ All 11 Docker services healthy","tree":{"sha":"73428a3f7871bdbee547e5c8a877237923e1cf44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/trees/73428a3f7871bdbee547e5c8a877237923e1cf44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/commits/72901df89ca191f37ce5c360e42638b92e75ac43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186486072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anhkhoi-cloudswe","id":186486072,"login":"anhkhoi-cloudswe","node_id":"U_kgDOCx2NOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a