i.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/commits/cf7fb6e65afa6b37dd77ac01d98d690598eda34a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T15:34:31Z","email":"ahkhoiNguyen169@gmail.com","name":"AK17-LeonSatoru"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T15:34:31Z","email":"ahkhoiNguyen169@gmail.com","name":"AK17-LeonSatoru"},"message":"🔧 Fix timezone conversion when creating Event from approved EventRequest\n\nCRITICAL FIX: When ProcessEventRequest creates an Event from an approved EventRequest,\nthe preferred_start_time and preferred_end_time were being copied as-is without\ntimezone conversion. This caused the times to be misinterpreted by the DSN loc setting.\n\nChanges:\n1. event_repository.go:1890-1925\n   - Read times from Event_Request as sql.NullTime (not strings)\n   - Normalize them using NormalizeDBTimeAsUTC() to undo DSN reinterpretation\n   - Format them as UTC storage format before inserting into Event\n\n2. event_api_composition.go:1162-1195\n   - Apply same timezone conversion fix to ProcessEventRequestComposed\n   - Update quota check to use converted startTimeUTC\n\nThis ensures Event times are stored consistently regardless of DSN loc setting.","tree":{"sha":"af3e7410566fad57557724dfa809701392ad3dcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/trees/af3e7410566fad57557724dfa809701392ad3dcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/commits/cf7fb6e65afa6b37dd77ac01d98d690598eda34a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":nul