mail.com","name":"AK17-LeonSatoru"},"message":"fix: consolidate timezone conversion to common/utils for Email & PDF - prevent UTC/GMT+7 drift\n\n- Add FormatToVNTime(t time.Time) string helper in common/utils/timezone.go\n- Refactor common/email/email.go to use ToVietnamTime + FormatToVNTime\n  * Removed duplicate loadVNLocation function\n  * Updated formatEventDateTime to use shared utils\n- Refactor common/pdf/ticket_pdf.go to use ToVietnamTime + FormatToVNTime\n  * Removed duplicate loadVNLocation function\n  * Event Time display now always uses GMT+7\n- Add comprehensive unit tests in common/utils/timezone_test.go\n  * TestFormatToVNTime_UTCToVietnam: UTC 02:00 -> VN 09:00\n  * TestFormatToVNTime_UTCToVietnam_CrossDay: UTC 18:30 -> VN 01:30\n  * TestFormatToVNTime_ZeroTime: zero time edge case\n\nFixes: Email and PDF ticket display now consistently use Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh timezone instead of UTC.","tree":{"sha":"03cf3adea1086cf61e6241b2d19f5bb19bbadb52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/trees/03cf3adea1086cf61e6241b2d19f5bb19bbadb52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/commits/7733595ae2ed16c2a172ce227b2f24ff4ce2ee4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186486072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anhkhoi-cloudswe","id":186486072,"login":"anhkhoi-cloudswe","node_id":"U_kgDOCx2NOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/orgs","received_events_url":"