d{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/commits/ac81a705732853d1e88504a7631c68dddd468741/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T09:54:52Z","email":"ahkhoiNguyen169@gmail.com","name":"AK17-LeonSatoru"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T09:54:52Z","email":"ahkhoiNguyen169@gmail.com","name":"AK17-LeonSatoru"},"message":"fix: implement axios interceptor guard against duplicated /api paths, add Ferrari BaseURL debug log\n\nFIXES: https://fpt-event.online/api/api/login error (duplicate /api prefix)\n\nChanges:\n- [frontend/src/config/api.ts] Centralized axios config with request interceptor\n  - Export api instance for singleton use\n  - Interceptor automatically strips /api prefix if present in config.url\n  - Added ''Ferrari BaseURL'' console.log for browser verification\n\n- [frontend/src/main.tsx] Import config/api to initialize setup\n  - Removes duplicate axios.defaults setup code\n  - Ensures interceptor is loaded on app startup\n\nArchitecture:\n- baseURL = /api (from VITE_API_URL env)\n- All endpoints passed as /path (not /api/path)\n- Interceptor catches and fixes any /api/path → /path (defense layer)\n- Result: axios always merges correctly (baseURL + /path = /api/path)","tree":{"sha":"cc5681a9eb43dd50b30bd065dbbc75f7f9b7bc97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/trees/cc5681a9eb43dd50b30bd065dbbc75f7f9b7bc97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/commits/ac81a705732853d1e88504a7631c68dddd468741","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont