y\n- Implement buildFrontendRedirectURL helper for consistent redirect handling\n- Payment redirects now use: Origin/Host headers -> FRONTEND_BASE_URL env -> relative path fallback\n- Gateway CORS updated to use env list only, remove insecure defaults\n- Frontend API base standardized via shared config/api.ts using VITE_API_URL env\n- Frontend pages (Login/Register/ResetPassword) and venue service now use centralized API_BASE_URL\n- Docker-compose env injection: CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS and FRONTEND_BASE_URL propagated\n- Ticket service build: success ✓ | Gateway build: success ✓\n- No hardcoded localhost in runtime backend code; only in local .env (expected)\n- VNPay callback and free-ticket flows now deployment-safe and domain-agnostic","tree":{"sha":"63e1dd5451717d3ebdfbbdaeeaee9a319c1d33fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/trees/63e1dd5451717d3ebdfbbdaeeaee9a319c1d33fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FPT-EVENT-MANAGEMENT-OJT/FPT_EVENT_MANAGEMENT_Microservices/git/commits/f8449b4a8c6f377ef17f2d96cb895a92784aafba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186486072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anhkhoi-cloudswe","id":186486072,"login":"anhkhoi-cloudswe","node_id":"U_kgDOCx2NOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anhkhoi-cloudswe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http