pi.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CybermanTX/mission-control/commits/7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:39:31Z","email":"alessandromartini@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Martini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:39:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: prevent injection in shell scripts — sed, jq, and JSON construction (#572)\n\nThree classes of shell injection hardened across four scripts:\n\n1. sed metacharacter injection (install.sh, generate-env.sh):\n   Add sed_escape() and portable_sed() helpers; use for all variable interpolation.\n\n2. jq filter injection (agent-heartbeat.sh):\n   Replace string interpolation with jq --arg name for safe escaping.\n\n3. JSON string injection (notification-daemon.sh):\n   Use jq -n with --arg/--argjson for safe JSON construction.\n   Use curl --data-urlencode for URL parameter encoding.\n   Fix $? capture bug in refactored curl control flow.","tree":{"sha":"0f0a38a26d2e3769595f8d10427f632b2464e7a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CybermanTX/mission-control/git/trees/0f0a38a26d2e3769595f8d10427f632b2464e7a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CybermanTX/mission-control/git/commits/7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f0a38a26d2e3769595f8d10427f632b2464e7a7\nparent bbd783e9544a948ab700619fc15ecdeadc618429\nauthor Alessandro Martini <alessandromartini@gmail.com> 1775842771 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <