/ra-skills/commits/3cdc583940a26c3313104eeace0b39f8d1e3681c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:49Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:49Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat(svelte-flow): add Svelte Flow (@xyflow/svelte) skill, biased to SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5\n\nNode-based UI / flow-graph editor skill for the rask SvelteKit frontend, targeting\nSvelte Flow 1.0. Leads with the five Svelte 5 rules generated code gets wrong\n($state.raw + immutable updates, bind:nodes/edges, import the stylesheet, sized\nwrapper, hooks return .current inside the flow context).\n\n- SKILL.md: five rules, quick start, golden-path table, custom node/edge snippets,\n  invoke workflow, references + templates tables.\n- references/: svelte-integration (incl. SSR + TypeScript), nodes-handles-subflows,\n  edges-connections, hooks-components-api, layout-and-theming,\n  troubleshooting-and-migration (v0 -> v1).\n- assets/: Flow.svelte, TextUpdaterNode.svelte, ButtonEdge.svelte, flow.svelte.ts,\n  dagre-layout.ts — all .svelte/.svelte.ts validated with the Svelte MCP autofixer.\n- API (props, events, hooks, utils, NodeProps/EdgeProps) verified against\n  @xyflow/svelte 1.6.1 type declarations.\n- Registered in marketplace.json; README + AGENTS.md regenerated via publish.sh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b441a4ee7bf45ca723cc553c6077f2810741e1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/b441a4ee7bf45ca723cc553c6077f2810741e1c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/3cdc583940a26c3313104eeace0b39f8d1e3681c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/priv