3/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/be7f60efebb3c73a20de88e7edc9cdbe8b71ed27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:05:21Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:05:21Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"docs(readme): clarify updates aren''t per-session + add install-all loop\n\n- \"Get the latest\" is explicitly NOT a per-session ritual: installed skills are\n  cached and load every session; marketplace update only discovers newly\n  added/changed skills, and refreshing the catalog != updating installed plugins.\n- Use the dedicated `/plugin update <name>@ra-skills` (re-install also works), or\n  `autoUpdate: true` to never run it by hand.\n- Add a shell loop to install several/all skills (there''s no single install-all\n  command); note the team-wide config is the cleaner way to pin a subset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fbee737e0e545ddd491c5d943a5fbf737ed751f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/fbee737e0e545ddd491c5d943a5fbf737ed751f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/be7f60efebb3c73a20de88e7edc9cdbe8b71ed27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com