https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/4903d7feafb9da27705b4b42be6fbef8d48aff91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:56:41Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:56:41Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"docs(readme): document how consumers install + update from the marketplace\n\nAnswer the FAQ \"do we clone this repo or get it from the marketplace?\" — you\nconsume it as a marketplace, never clone/copy. New \"Updating & staying current\"\nsection:\n- per-developer: marketplace add / install / update commands\n- the key gotcha: `/plugin marketplace update` refreshes the catalog but does NOT\n  auto-update already-installed skills (off by default for third-party\n  marketplaces) — re-install or set autoUpdate\n- team-wide committed .claude/settings.json (extraKnownMarketplaces +\n  enabledPlugins + autoUpdate, optional ref pinning)\n- pointer to the full RA surface (§1-4) wired up by `make claude-bootstrap`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4427cd640a9a1062886156274e89357b787465a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/f4427cd640a9a1062886156274e89357b787465a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/4903d7feafb9da27705b4b42be6fbef8d48aff91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith