url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/00688994005147c659e4f2c7b01bcbb5fff35835/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:53:46Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:53:46Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"docs(gradio,gsap): reference Gradio''s self-installing skill; bun-only commands\n\n- README: add §4 \"Vendor-CLI skills\" documenting Gradio''s official, self-\n  installing skill (`gradio skills add --claude --global`, run via uvx since it''s\n  a Python CLI). Referenced, not copy-vendored — it self-updates, so vendoring\n  would drift. Renumber the behavior-overlays section to §5.\n- gsap skill: switch install commands from npm to bun (`bun add gsap` / lenis),\n  matching the rask Bun-only convention. (.npmrc / npm.greensock.com kept as\n  factual nouns.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f26312c6bcd7843da26a46de1e2257cc71d4f8a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/f26312c6bcd7843da26a46de1e2257cc71d4f8a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/00688994005147c659e4f2c7b01bcbb5fff35835","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://