ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/1d41d931c2e6bbcd274db2bc0a60f2345c9bfbc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:19:58Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:19:58Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat(gsap): add GSAP animation skill, biased to SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5\n\nOne cohesive skill (not the upstream''s eight fragments) for GSAP in the rask\nSvelteKit frontend:\n\n- SKILL.md: Svelte-first; the register-once / revert-on-destroy / reduced-motion\n  laws and an integration-style decision table.\n- references/: svelte.md (the centrepiece — {@attach}, runes, gsap.context()/\n  matchMedia() cleanup, SSR/prerender safety, ScrollTrigger.refresh() on\n  afterNavigate, Lenis) plus core / timeline / scrolltrigger / plugins /\n  performance.\n- assets/: $lib/gsap.ts (SSR-safe central registration), attachments.ts\n  ({@attach} factories), Reveal.svelte (golden-path component), +layout.svelte\n  (fixes the reference template''s unstable gsap.ticker.remove ref and its\n  double-rAF loop).\n\nAll Svelte components verified with the Svelte MCP autofixer; a multi-lens review\n(GSAP API / Svelte 5 / skill structure) passed with no high or medium findings.\nOriginal content; credits the MIT GreenSock gsap-skills and the MIT\nsvelte-gsap-template. GSAP and every plugin are free following Webflow''s\nacquisition of GreenSock — installed from the public npm package, no auth token.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e3e830bc2f285bc73b83cad74550ca23af4b6c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/4e3e830bc2f285bc73b83cad74550ca23af4b6c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/1d41d931c2e6bbcd274db2bc0a60f2345c9bfbc4","verification":{"pa