organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/12c443e8021a17d1bd0b92ae17d443d8bc1eaf54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:17:55Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:17:55Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat(micro-frontends): add the micro-frontends architecture skill\n\nA framework-agnostic skill for composing one UI from independently deployed\nfrontends. Adapted from Tyler-R-Kendrick/agent-skills (MIT) + grounded in\nnaltatis \"Micro Frontends in Action\", micro-frontends.org, and Vercel\nMicrofrontends; rewritten to Anthropic skill best-practices (lean SKILL.md\ndecision hub + progressive-disclosure references).\n\n- SKILL.md: \"where does composition happen?\" decision tree (build-time / zones /\n  server-side / client-side runtime) + principles + reference map.\n- references/: composition, module-federation, routing-and-orchestration,\n  communication, principles.\n- Enriched with vendor-neutral routing-based/zones composition (Vercel\n  Microfrontends + Next.js Multi-Zones): asset prefixes, lockstep-free rollout +\n  flag-gated routing + instant rollback, local dev proxy + production fallback.\n- Adversarially reviewed (3 lenses) + fixes applied: dropped a false MF\n  circular-dep claim, native import() over System.import, DocumentEventMap,\n  Varnish ESI caveat, timeless tooling notes, de-duplicated versioned-contracts.\n\n13 shared skills now. claude plugin validate passe