ck green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c98b0b2133cb394ae8e63177962e9b09244b6172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/c98b0b2133cb394ae8e63177962e9b09244b6172"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/af8a2047bd61cec021b7cf1b2fcd5c24031e3210","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commit/af8a2047bd61cec021b7cf1b2fcd5c24031e3210","node_id":"C_kwDORk9DrdoAKGFmOGEyMDQ3YmQ2MWNlYzAyMWI3Y2YxYjJmY2Q1YzI0MDMxZTMyMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commit/1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462","sha":"1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462"}],"sha":"af8a2047bd61cec021b7cf1b2fcd5c24031e3210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/af8a2047bd61cec021b7cf1b2fcd5c24031e3210"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:43:01Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:43:01Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"chore: target Claude + VS Code + Zed only; drop Gemini/Codex/Cursor support\n\nWe don''t use Gemini CLI, OpenAI Codex, or Cursor — remove their manifests and\ngenerator so the repo ships only what the Claude ecosystem (Claude Code in the\nterminal, VS Code, and Zed) and the AGENTS.md standard need.\n\n- rm gemini-extension.json (Gemini), .cursor-plugin/ + scripts/generate_cursor_plugin.py (Cursor)\n- publish.sh: drop the cursor generation step + .cursor-plugin from GENERATED_FILES\n- validate-artifacts.yml: drop gemini/cursor/mcp trigger paths\n- README: replace Codex/Gemini/Cursor install sections with VS Code + Zed; reframe\n  agents/AGENTS.md as the standard those editors read; add an explicit scope note\n\nagents/AGENTS.md is kept — it''s the AGENTS.md standard VS Code and Zed consume,\nnot a Codex-only artifact. claude plugin validate passes; publish.sh --check green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9a74a387ebe088089819b83e97d63f844045286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/c9a74a387ebe088089819b83e97d63f844045286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commit/1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462","node_id":"C_kwDORk9DrdoAKDE4OTFhYzdmOTk0ZmVhM2JkZDcwYjFjOWNlYzY2Nzk0MmY5ZTU0NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commit/e3678eab1b4026eaf8a21128459ed5e2318ff4c9","sha":"e3678eab1b4026eaf8a21128459ed5e2318ff4c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/e3678eab1b4026eaf8a21128459ed5e2318ff4c9"}],"sha":"1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/1891ac7f994fea3bdd70b1c9cec667942f9e5462"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/commits/e3678eab1b4026eaf8a21128459ed5e2318ff4c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:38:58Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:38:58Z","email":"gabriel.borg93@gmail.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat: unify RA Claude skills into a granular marketplace\n\nPopulate ra-skills as the single source of truth for the agent skills shared\nacross Riksarkivet repos (rask, ra-hcp, lance-audio), modeled on\nhuggingface/skills. Stops the copy-vendoring drift where each repo carried its\nown diverging copy of writing-python, dagger, fastapi, etc.\n\nStructure (granular: one marketplace plugin per skill):\n- .claude-plugin/{marketplace.json (14 plugins), plugin.json}\n- cross-tool exports: .cursor-plugin/, gemini-extension.json, agents/AGENTS.md\n- PEP-723 uv generators: generate_agents.py, generate_cursor_plugin.py,\n  publish.sh (+ --check), AGENTS_TEMPLATE.md\n- CI drift gate: .github/workflows/validate-artifacts.yml\n- Apache-2.0 LICENSE\n\n14 skills (58 reference files):\n- CORE (repo-agnostic): writing-python, writing-typescript, fastapi,\n  testing-python, python-infrastructure, otel, dagger, dockerfile,\n  zensical-setup, zensical-authoring\n- PROJECT (rask-*): rask-architecture, rask-services-fleet, rask-htr-pipeline,\n  rask-orchestrator — load-bearing rask knowledge no single source file states\n\nDrift reconciled on the way in: dagger frontmatter name normalized to match dir,\nReferences/ -> references/ casing unified, stale viewer.dockerfile (dissolved\nservice) dropped, dockerfile skill genericized. README documents the full RA\nClaude surface (RA-owned skills + 3rd-party marketplaces + MCP servers incl.\nthe Svelte 5 MCP). claude plugin validate passes; publish.sh --check is green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db9a237b72a27ff3e9f8c7e7685252d0e805a0cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/trees/db9a237b72a27ff3e9f8c7e7685252d0e805a0cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/ra-skills/git/commits/e3678eab1b4026eaf8a21128459ed5e2318ff4c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","recei