der","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/99ee77e38a6ecedc984f2a2b749776377ba4680c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:48:43Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:48:43Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"refactor: split 13 complex functions outside the orchestration layer\n\nNo behaviour change; covering tests green before and after each split, and\nevery split function and helper is now at mccabe complexity 8 or below.\nSettings cross-field checks, the subagent activity view, the math-span check\n(fuzzed against the original), bot metadata assembly, widget snapshot/connect,\nmemory CAS persistence (now takes a MemoryWrite), model-usage reconcile and\nrecord, and the sidecar''s environment prepare, skill loader, bundle hash\n(compared against the original), MCP config migration and install prepare.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b63ba146d5fd97fe74da2b8817b059c4489305d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/b63ba146d5fd97fe74da2b8817b059c4489305d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/99ee77e38a6ecedc984f2a2b749776377ba4680c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c