iew_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/3adb3eee4299aa5cd961f3560830ba12e9f43a9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:40:33Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:40:33Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix(ai): carry the execution epoch through pauses and enforce the epoch cap\n\n- execution_epoch is declared on WorkflowState, so the pause node''s update is\n  no longer dropped; the pause payload carries it and mark_continuable writes it\n  to the generation row, so a second human Continue in one turn resumes, and a\n  Continue after auto-rolls agrees with the row\n- research accounting was read from an empty bucket on every pause because\n  logical_turn_id never reached graph state; it now comes from turn_identity\n- the continue branch calls begin_epoch, and the execution budget reaches\n  specialists and RAG, so generation_total_epochs_per_turn finally stops a turn\n  through the normal finalize path (default 50) instead of the recursion limit\n- the custom-agent activity trail is built from agent_history (live) instead of\n  an invocation record nothing wrote\n- delete repository methods and a token-counter helper left without callers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a4c12e699c5fd6368228cf7ba45712dc6b2e89b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/8a4c12e699c5fd6368228cf7ba45712dc6b2e89b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/3adb3eee4299aa5cd961f3560830ba12e9f43a9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use