ame":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"feat(security): generate signing and encryption keys into server_secrets\n\nSECRET_KEY and MODEL_ENCRYPTION_KEY are now optional everywhere. A configured\nvalue always wins and is never stored; otherwise the key is read from the new\nserver_secrets table, or generated once (INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, so\nreplicas converge). A database backup therefore contains these keys.\n- refuses to generate an encryption key while encrypted provider keys exist\n- seeds the signing key from an existing .dev_secret_key (development only)\n- resolved at API startup and Celery worker init; never signs with an empty key\n- widget token signing moves to app/services/widget_tokens.py so the sidecar\n  bundle never imports server key code (also drops two test-only widget\n  helpers, to_live_widget_metadata and connection_count)\n- migrations e983df693ada (server_secrets) and 9b132832d676 (make the\n  model_providers (user_id, provider_type) unique index partial, so a\n  soft-deleted provider no longer blocks re-adding it)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7b836ad1ad3805a7a7388cfae01b54c400a3ecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/d7b836ad1ad3805a7a7388cfae01b54c400a3ecb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/38c10b168bca5d45945c2bb20ab6a9ad2b14e2e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"