"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/e7c22a39b43413088e025629305104b45a2df2db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:46:57Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:46:57Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"chore: drop 28 unread settings and 9 unimported dependencies\n\n- Settings ignores unknown variables, so existing environment files that still\n  set the removed names keep working; the template lines can go\n- langchain-tavily, nltk, docx2txt, pdfplumber, tabulate and fastapi-radar leave\n  every manifest; pypdf, python-docx and langchain-text-splitters leave only\n  pyproject (mineru / langchain-classic in the frozen set still need them)\n- a contract test keeps unimported dependencies out of the manifests\n- README no longer documents the removed settings or claims citation\n  verification runs in shadow mode\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34e679aa16add5c212c89b62bcb57fc142175b30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/34e679aa16add5c212c89b62bcb57fc142175b30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/e7c22a39b43413088e025629305104b45a2df2db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id"