","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/ce1d95f50967bcdf2691e7550beb6c1ec10ebec2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:48:58Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:48:58Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix(db): integrity constraints, FK indexes, owner-scoped receipts\n\n- c0033ee1e8cd: document_chunks timestamps default now(); drop the legacy\n  page_number/content_preview columns if present\n- 371ffaf3a087: refuses to run (changing nothing) if any row violates the new\n  rules; adds 5 FK indexes (model_usage_events ones CONCURRENTLY), a partial\n  unique index on live chat_images (user_id, sha256), 4 CHECKs, an FK for\n  hitl_interrupts.resolved_by_user_id; drops 14 redundant indexes\n- chat image insert is ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING and returns the winning row\n- tool receipt transitions match user and conversation, not just the key\n- passive_deletes where the database already cascades; Message.feedback selectin\n- message queries by user exclude soft-deleted conversations; sequence lookup is\n  conversation-scoped; get_soft_deleted is bounded\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bef18f468e582c6cf1596e0c1a1ede0a2b43b8ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/bef18f468e582c6cf1596e0c1a1ede0a2b43b8ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/ce1d95f50967bcdf2691e7550beb6c1ec10ebec2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":