cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/95e47436deb38de8ede734fcfeb82896277d1b45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:40:07Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:40:07Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix(sidecar): guard every forwarded path, cap uploads, env off command lines\n\n- one check in ServerAPIClient refuses dot-segment, encoded-slash, ? and #\n  path segments on every upstream request (replaces the per-router dependency)\n- document uploads check Content-Length (CLIENT_DOCUMENT_UPLOAD_MAX_BYTES,\n  default 50 MiB) before the body is read, like skill uploads\n- the sandbox launcher starts the program directly with an explicit environment\n  block (LogonUserW + CreateEnvironmentBlock) instead of cmd.exe set, so values\n  never appear on a command line; verified on the real sandbox account\n- demo keeps the sign-in in a SameSite=Strict cookie read via st.context.cookies;\n  the token no longer travels in the URL and legacy query params are scrubbed\n- POST /auth/logout requires the local session\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae1591999c03bfc35e4939013588509aecad6135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/ae1591999c03bfc35e4939013588509aecad6135"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/95e47436deb38de8ede734fcfeb82896277d1b45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt