wner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/1bbebdc0555f8a9f61cb59c7567bd554f71dffaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:36:52Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:36:52Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix(services): bind device results, close races, drop the dead event bus\n\n- a device''s tool result is accepted only for a request dispatched to it\n- conversation deletes no longer open a checkpoint pool when checkpoints are off\n- conversation CRUD routes and the task-status lookup run off the event loop\n- widget close uses WATCH like update/patch; all three give up after 10 retries\n- delete the document event bus: its only listener logged lines nobody saw,\n  and the worker-side events had no listener at all\n- provider key previews show the key''s tail, not the ciphertext''s\n- MCP server URLs have query values and passwords masked in listings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3dc7861fae635c8525593d9b78b0f7882b22445a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/3dc7861fae635c8525593d9b78b0f7882b22445a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/1bbebdc0555f8a9f61cb59c7567bd554f71dffaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu