n and skill binding checks\n- delete unreferenced checkpoint/registry/catalog helpers and redundant docstrings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1504501038a95e156dcf6e3a53e1243df87a26bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/1504501038a95e156dcf6e3a53e1243df87a26bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/b0a65dffff5bd57e434825ace3eb4302fb053d9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/b0a65dffff5bd57e434825ace3eb4302fb053d9e","node_id":"C_kwDORlA2_toAKGIwYTY1ZGZmZmY1YmQ1N2U0MzQ4MjVhY2UzZWI0MzAyZmIwNTNkOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/694ad0b186510ee798a729383d5b9b22a948eb1b","sha":"694ad0b186510ee798a729383d5b9b22a948eb1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/694ad0b186510ee798a729383d5b9b22a948eb1b"}],"sha":"b0a65dffff5bd57e434825ace3eb4302fb053d9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/b0a65dffff5bd57e434825ace3eb4302fb053d9e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/694ad0b186510ee798a729383d5b9b22a948eb1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:56:11Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:56:11Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix(ai): close approval bypasses in RAG, specialists and resume\n\n- RAG ran MCP/client/mutation tool calls with no approval gate; gated calls\n  are now answered with a paired refusal\n- a turn with no per-user policy built specialists without ToolApprovalMiddleware;\n  it now falls back to the global policy\n- MultiAgentWorkflow.resume auto-approved every pending tool call; it now refuses\n- stream errors send the exception type, not str(exc)\n- write_todos status is per call, not the running error flag\n- the transition resolver kept one turn''s inventory on a shared instance\n- auto-continue no longer rolls over an undecidable side effect\n- a failing skill provider no longer retries without the agent''s skill scope\n- planning parent context read the wrong todo key\n- delete ~300 lines of unreferenced helpers; consolidate duplicated helpers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1a1b018a8177e6cdc19e7b819f2659bfb243b7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/b1a1b018a8177e6cdc19e7b819f2659bfb243b7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/694ad0b186510ee798a729383d5b9b22a948eb1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/694ad0b186510ee798a729383d5b9b22a948eb1b","node_id":"C_kwDORlA2_toAKDY5NGFkMGIxODY1MTBlZTc5OGE3MjkzODNkNWI5YjIyYTk0OGViMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://