es carry a\n  generic message; the exception detail is logged instead\n- MCP server listings mask env/header values; stop logging hosted MCP URLs\n- login runs bcrypt for unknown emails and refuses soft-deleted users\n- replacing a failed upload deletes its vectors/chunks, not just the row\n- keep a reference to the checkpoint-cleanup task; close the AsyncOpenAI client\n- log previously silent exceptions; split interrupt-decision validation\n- delete unreferenced service and interface methods\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08857a5306cf658da0908166909a5a9db9256578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/08857a5306cf658da0908166909a5a9db9256578"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/94c120818c6261d3d834acb4f45440bedd783159","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/94c120818