ry routes\n- feedback routes check the caller owns the message (stats/list were unauthenticated)\n- image routes reuse the app container instead of a new engine per request;\n  chat images get nosniff + CSP since SVG uploads are allowed\n- passwords over 72 bytes are a 422, not a bcrypt 500\n- explicit null for NOT NULL fields, bad device UUIDs, page_size=0 and\n  negative latestMessages are 422s instead of 500s\n- /health/qdrant read a field qdrant-client 1.19 removed; probes run in a thread\n- widget lookup escapes LIKE wildcards in the widget id\n- stop logging the runtime socket session id; log previously swallowed errors\n- remove unreferenced schemas, exceptions and redundant docstrings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4484c0f99ef86c6508766597365c64df596acde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/f4484c0f99ef86c6508766597365c64df596acde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/93268faa8cac4ebce70dd6f18eb049ded7426c97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g