-09-29T01:55:41Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix(db): correct model defaults, scoped queries, and drop dead repo code\n\n- document_chunks insert failed NOT NULL on a migrated schema (no timestamp default)\n- documents.upload_time was stamped once at import time\n- task_plans jsonb server_default rendered invalid SQL under create_all\n- declare two migration-only indexes so autogenerate stops proposing drops\n- user get_all treated skip as a page number (negative OFFSET)\n- conversation list counted and previewed soft-deleted messages, N+1 queries\n- conversation-id prefix search escaped LIKE wildcards\n- delete ~15 unreferenced repository methods and skill_setting repository\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d153ced99614f5faaa2dfb9f8db89f58d53c9ca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/d153ced99614f5faaa2dfb9f8db89f58d53c9ca7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/0a51a1e702a0aa0b3807e7b44feb94cb534c0300","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptio