mmitter":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:37:52Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"feat: let the app switch sandbox mode on and off per device\n\nCLIENT_SANDBOX_MODE could only be changed by editing .env.client and restarting\nthe sidecar. This adds a device-local override so the switch can be flipped from\nthe app: a mode.json in the profile that wins over the configured default, read\nlive, so Desktop Commander picks up the new identity on its next launch.\n\n- sandbox/mode.py: read/write the override; a missing or corrupt file falls\n  back to CLIENT_SANDBOX_MODE, so a bad file never strands the sandbox.\n- _prepare_sandbox reads the effective mode instead of the raw setting.\n- GET/PUT /mcp/sandbox: read the mode and account readiness, or set the mode and\n  restart Desktop Commander under it (422 on an unknown mode).\n- MCP Config tab: a toggle that flips the mode and warns when it is on but the\n  KaniSandbox account is not set up.\n- FE contract documents both routes.\n\nNo Windows account changes: on runs Desktop Commander as the existing\nKaniSandbox account in the managed workspace, off runs it as the signed-in user.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4912e17acbf4e08ec2e6c3209b45cadc8c18d035","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/4912e17acbf4e08ec2e6c3209b45cadc8c18d035"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/c86d7341fb7808202c61b9473f90ee2a34b680c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","grava