s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/252fa0c79819b1b70de4e67a2b9a4d8c7fb06d21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:39:26Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:39:26Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix: guard project container wiring and close error-contract gaps\n\nFix round 1 for Task 7, addressing four review findings:\n\n- B1: add three container-wiring regression guards\n  (tests/test_project_context_wiring.py), following the existing\n  test_the_container_wires_a_durable_turn_coordinator_into_message_service\n  pattern from test_workflow_concurrency.py. Each was proven to fail by\n  deleting its matching kwarg from container.py and restoring it.\n- B2: test_another_user_cannot_attach_to_the_project now asserts the\n  PROJECT_FORBIDDEN error code instead of only the 403 status, so it\n  actually pins ProjectService.attach_conversation''s own\n  require_owned() check rather than passing for the unrelated reason\n  that the conversation-ownership check below it also returns 403.\n- B3: _build_app in tests/test_projects_api.py now registers the real\n  exception handlers, and the cross-user/not-found tests assert the\n  actual PROJECT_FORBIDDEN / PROJECT_NOT_FOUND /\n  PROJECT_CONVERSATION_NOT_FOUND / CONVERSATION_ACCESS_DENIED codes\n  instead of only status codes.\n- B4: ProjectUpdate.name rejects an explicit null with 422 instead of\n  reaching setattr(project, \"name\", None) and failing as a 500\n  IntegrityError against the non-nullable column.\n\nAlso: document the reachable 404 CONVERSATION_NOT_FOUND on attach/\ndetach in plans/PROJECTS_FE_CONTRACT.md, fix its self-contradictory\nUpdate-section wording and its Create request/response mismatch, and\nupdate conversation_service.py''s stale \"not yet wired\" comment now\nthat project_service is wired.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cec080c60a993e2e78600a983be06a467bba44dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/cec080c60a993e2e78600a983be06a467bba44dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/252fa0c79819b1b70de4e67a2b9a4d8c7fb06d21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/252fa0c79819b1b70de4e67a2b9a4d8c7fb06d21","node_id":"C_kwDORlA2_toAKDI1MmZhMGM3OTgxOWIxYjcwZGU0ZTY3YTJiOWE0ZDhjN2ZiMDZkMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5","sha":"e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5"}],"sha":"252fa0c79819b1b70de4e67a2b9a4d8c7fb06d21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/252fa0c79819b1b70de4e67a2b9a4d8c7fb06d21"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:10:43Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:10:43Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"fix: unbreak custom-agent workflow test after project wiring landed\n\nMessageService._build_user_message_workflow_request reads\nself.project_context_service unconditionally, added when project\nsupport landed in message_service.py (Task 5, e40a3857). The\n__new__-built MessageService double in\ntest_ai_sdk_chat_uses_attached_custom_agents never set that\nattribute, so the test raised AttributeError as soon as anything\nexercised that code path with a bare-bones double.\n\nUnrelated to the project-API wiring commit; found while running the\nfull suite before committing that work, since it is otherwise the\nonly real check that container wiring didn''t break another path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"005c886a3e4251b1d16596c5681f9201315bdfda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/005c886a3e4251b1d16596c5681f9201315bdfda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5","node_id":"C_kwDORlA2_toAKGU3MTI0ZjhlMmEwOWQ4Mjc1NTUyMjgwMmMxNjIyMDYyOWI2NzM4YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/7a28be6de4f8091d7dfdba1a040257d67f040381","sha":"7a28be6de4f8091d7dfdba1a040257d67f040381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/7a28be6de4f8091d7dfdba1a040257d67f040381"}],"sha":"e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/e7124f8e2a09d82755522802c16220629b6738b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/7a28be6de4f8091d7dfdba1a040257d67f040381/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:10:35Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:10:35Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"feat: expose the project API and wire the container\n\nAdd the nine project HTTP routes (CRUD, default agents, conversation\nmembership), and wire project_repository / project_service /\nproject_context_service into the container: the new providers next to\ncustom_agent_service, project_service into the existing\nconversation_service provider, project_context_service into the\nexisting message_service provider and into _create_ai_service, and\n\"app.api.projects\" into wiring_config.\n\nAppAutoInjector.setup_wiring_map also needs a ProjectService entry\n(app/core/dependency_injection.py) for the router''s\nproject_service: ProjectService parameter to resolve at all; this\nmirrors the existing CustomAgentService entry and isn''t optional for\nthe router to function, even though the brief''s file list didn''t\nname it.\n\nAlso sync IConversationService.get_by_user_id''s abstract signature\nwith the project_id parameter ConversationService already implements\n(flagged in Task 6''s review).\n\nDocument the full contract for frontend integration in\nplans/PROJECTS_FE_CONTRACT.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c897bb086d79f84498b84dba5f95abacf926e16f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/c897bb086d79f84498b84dba5f95abacf926e16f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/7a28be6de4f8091d7dfdba1a040257d67f040381","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"star