Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176","sha":"8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176"}],"sha":"ca38ab115f686df9acea49f86a560031b810099d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/ca38ab115f686df9acea49f86a560031b810099d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:46:39Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:46:39Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"feat: let conversations belong to a project\n\nThreads an optional project_id through both conversation factory paths,\nConversationCreate/Read/InDB schemas, create_conversation (validates\nownership via ProjectService.require_owned and seeds the project''s\ndefault agents), get_by_user_id, and the projectId listing filter.\n\nThe owner-scoped listing has two branches backed by different\nConversationCRUDStrategy methods depending on whether \"messages\" is\nrequested. project_id is threaded into all three strategy methods\n(get_by_owner_id, count_by_owner_id, get_with_recent_messages) and\nboth ConversationRepository pass-throughs, so filtering and pagination\ntotals stay correct on both branches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"483730a2f14d909fe59c23ae1d27c1b8dff4d325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/483730a2f14d909fe59c23ae1d27c1b8dff4d325"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176","node_id":"C_kwDORlA2_toAKDhhM2JkNmY2YTYyNDgxYWI1NGIwOTc4NzA3YTNlMzMzNjMwNjExNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3","sha":"c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3"}],"sha":"8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/8a3bd6f6a62481ab54b0978707a3e33363061176"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:35:59Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:35:59Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"test: cover the wired project_context_service branches\n\nTask 5''s core change had no coverage of the branch it actually adds:\nnothing constructed MessageService or AIService with a non-None\nproject_context_service, and every existing resume-path test\nmonkeypatches _get_conversation_context away, so the collapsed call site\nat message_service.py''s resume path could regress silently.\n\nAdd tests/test_project_context_wiring.py: a stub resolver returning a\n16060-character instruction, asserted to arrive untruncated at all three\nsites (MessageService._get_conversation_context,\nMessageService._build_user_message_workflow_request,\nAIService._prepare_request), plus an end-to-end test that runs the real\nresume_message_creation_stream (not monkeypatched) to pin the specific\nline the earlier fix collapsed.\n\nAlso strengthen test_soft_deleted_project_reads_as_project_less to\nassert the repository was actually consulted, so it no longer passes\nidentically to the no-project case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff5aa1c6efd313ed5db2a33433c6715ab838a592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/ff5aa1c6efd313ed5db2a33433c6715ab838a592"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3","node_id":"C_kwDORlA2_toAKGM0OTMzOTM0YTk1YjE5NTdhN2NkNTAwYWM2MjQ2Mjc0MjMyNDNhYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commit/e40a385786fb3a7feda34297c670477ec7420596","sha":"e40a385786fb3a7feda34297c670477ec7420596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/e40a385786fb3a7feda34297c670477ec7420596"}],"sha":"c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/c4933934a95b1957a7cd500ac624627423243ab3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tox1cCoder","id":92375607,"login":"Tox1cCoder","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGKNw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/commits/e40a385786fb3a7feda34297c670477ec7420596/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:19:58Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:19:58Z","email":"hroryu.nguyen@gmail.com","name":"Tox1cC0der"},"message":"feat: resolve project instructions into the system prompt\n\nAdd ProjectContextService.resolve_system_instruction, which composes a\nconversation''s project instructions with its persona via\ncompose_system_instruction and returns an already-sanitized result that\nmay legitimately exceed 8000 characters.\n\nWire it as an optional constructor parameter (default None) into\nAIService._prepare_request and both MessageService persona call sites\n(_get_conversation_context and _build_user_message_workflow_request),\npreserving today''s sanitize_persona-only behavior when unset so existing\ndirect constructions of these services keep working ahead of Task 7''s\ncontainer wiring.\n\nCollapse the two-line persona fetch + re-sanitize at the HITL resume\ncall site into one line. The old sanitize_persona(persona) re-truncated\n_get_conversation_context''s return value back to 8000 characters,\nsilently dropping the conversation''s own persona whenever a project''s\ninstructions filled the cap. _get_conversation_context now returns the\nalready-composed, already-sanitized instruction directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb7c46f639aaa864e13b6d701646ebeb4f22bb46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/trees/cb7c46f639aaa864e13b6d701646ebeb4f22bb46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tox1cCoder/AgenticChatbot/git/commits/e40a385786fb3a7feda34297c670477ec7420596","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92375607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1cCoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tox1